<item>
  <title>S9 Ep35: Free Hit FAIL! What now for GW35? FPL GW34-GW35 Fantasy Premier League</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8895713</link>
  <itunes:episode>35</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>Free Hit FAIL! What now for GW35? FPL GW34-GW35 Fantasy Premier League</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>9</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8895713.mp3?modified=1777241272&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="70956640" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/43616195/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.png" />
  <itunes:duration>4400</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>So chip season is nearly over for Sam and Lee, as both played their free hit, with mixed success in GW34. We ask what now, as we welcome back our GW33 teams - with Lee in particular, considering what to do with Chelsea assets Palmer and Joao Pedro. On the pitch, Spurs FINALLY win a game, but so too do WestHam and Forest, keeping the relegation battle very much alive.  Elsewhere, it's 1-0 to the Arsenal and Liverpool beat Palace at Anfield, in what looked like it could be Mo Salah's last game, depending on injury news from Arne Slot next week.</p><p>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!</p><p>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:</p></div><ul>
<li><p>Exclusive FREE Podcasts every week looking ahead to the next GW</p></li>
<li><p>Manager of the Month Competitions  - MONTHLY PRIZES!</p></li>
<li><p>Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam</p></li>
<li><p>Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers</p></li>
</ul><div>
