<item>
  <title>S9 Ep34:  Our GW34 FREE HIT Drafts - Salah or Haaland Captain? FPL GW33-GW34 Fantasy Premier League</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8892637</link>
  <itunes:episode>34</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title> Our GW34 FREE HIT Drafts - Salah or Haaland Captain? FPL GW33-GW34 Fantasy Premier League</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>9</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8892637.mp3?modified=1776637163&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="90997453" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/43604016/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.png" />
  <itunes:duration>5654</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>Over halfway through DGW33 and with 4 more still to go, we take stock of how Lee's Wildcard has done so far. Success, Failure or still to be decided? We look back at the weekend's action of course, but also ahead to blank GW34 and the week which for a while now, we've had earmarked for the Free Hit chip, with us BOTH planning to play it. We talk drafts, locked in players and best differentials.</p><p>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!</p><p>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:</p></div><ul>
<li><p>Exclusive FREE Podcasts every week looking ahead to the next GW</p></li>
<li><p>Manager of the Month Competitions  - MONTHLY PRIZES!</p></li>
<li><p>Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam</p></li>
<li><p>Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers</p></li>
</ul><div>
