<item>
  <title>S9 Ep33: BIG DOUBLE GW33 is here! FPL GW32-GW33 Fantasy Premier League</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8887360</link>
  <itunes:episode>33</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>BIG DOUBLE GW33 is here! FPL GW32-GW33 Fantasy Premier League</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>9</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8887360.mp3?modified=1776031667&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="78057632" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/42921105.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>4874</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>Lots of Wildcards were played ahead of GW32 - including Lee's - so we find out how successful it was... or wasn't! And now the big DGW33 is here with a number of teams, including Man City, Chelsea and Brighton all playing twice. With that in mind, we ask whether you need a FULL team of Doublers? Or how many is enough? And who are the best ones to target?</p><p>On the pitch this week, Liverpool keep a clean sheet (for a change) at home to Fulham, Arsenal's title charge takes a "punch in the face" according to Mikel Arteta, Thiago punishes the sellers and FPL favourite J-P Mateta is BACK with a brace against Newcastle.</p><p>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!</p><p>Thanks to our Stream Sponsors FOOTIUM! <br>Give Footium a try!</p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa21vQVN1QWVXcUk0RFdlMmhjRGNSdUFIUWI4QXxBQ3Jtc0trV2VwTXpXZWhKd3pwRTBZb081eFRGcGFUaG5sTDBGU2FfYllWaThXRDVPUGZNZExnM0dKaVliLVpfYXc4UFk5bTJiejRiTHA3Zy1tYnpGVDJHN2ltdUJMV0prR3dxTHJKZGZ6bEpoQVBpeVBEcl9zMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffootium.club%2Fgame%2Fsocial%2Ffriends%3Fjoin_code%3DOTI2MDoxMjk6Y2Y5NTkxODA4OTkzZWYwZDE3YmUyZmIyZDgwZDllZDExODA5ZDE3ZDBjOTVjMmRjNWMxZjcyZDI5ODA3NTI2Yzox%26utm_campaign%3Ds17%26utm_source%3Dfplfamily%26utm_medium%3Dcreator%26utm_content%3Dvid1&amp;v=v59tmAwN8No">https://footium.club/game/social/frie...</a></p><p>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:</p></div><ul>
<li><p>Exclusive FREE Podcasts every week looking ahead to the next GW</p></li>
