  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>With Arsenal exiting the FA Cup, our FPL strategies are now under serious review. We pick through the bones of the FA Cup ties, ask what went wrong for Liverpool (again) and whether Chelsea can be trusted again?</p><p>With Wildcards in back pockets all over the community, poised to be played in GW32, ready for a big Bench Boost 33 - we ask whether it's really that simple any more....and do we really want to treble up on Brighton, Leeds and Burnley? </p><p>A lot to consider at this defining crossroads of the 25/26 season.</p><p>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!</p><p>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:</p></div><ul>
<li><p>Exclusive FREE Podcasts every week looking ahead to the next GW</p></li>
<li><p>Manager of the Month Competitions  - MONTHLY PRIZES!</p></li>
<li><p>Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam</p></li>
<li><p>Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers</p></li>
</ul><div>
