  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>Congratulations to Man City fans, the winners of this season's League Cup trophy! Meanwhile, in the league, Fantasy managers had a Blank GW to navigate and it was littered with FPL traps! Ekitike OFF INJURED after 7 minutes, a James Hill OWN GOAL and Malik Thiaw BENCHED! What a week! </p><p>We've got a few weeks break from FPL now, so we look ahead to GW32, whether Lee will play the Wildcard and if so, who he's got his eye on.</p><p>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!</p><p>Thanks to our Stream Sponsors FOOTIUM! <br>Give Footium a try!</p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGs0T21UN2dTWlQ0Q094dEFXdlExQVpUY3pUZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuX3J5Q3BoM0V0aEdOUVdBMWdJWmJQdkJwUkdKUlJFMGhfdXZlUWVZSXkybWxMSV9qc25QYnk0RnpiaEpybkRzdV94aGpwTGlTUHRnYTlOSE5yZWtjREwyWFJWdjUwbFBjN1U1TTh3N09DcGxuZ1hUSQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffootium.club%2Fgame%2Fsocial%2Ffriends%3Fjoin_code%3DOTI2MDoxMjk6Y2Y5NTkxODA4OTkzZWYwZDE3YmUyZmIyZDgwZDllZDExODA5ZDE3ZDBjOTVjMmRjNWMxZjcyZDI5ODA3NTI2Yzox%26utm_campaign%3Ds17%26utm_source%3Dfplfamily%26utm_medium%3Dcreator%26utm_content%3Dvid1&amp;v=TZyDMplsXWg">https://footium.club/game/social/frie...</a></p><p>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:</p></div><ul>
