<p>A huge result for Arsenal against a stubborn Everton side, gives them the edge in the title run-in... especially when City drop points away at West Ham. 16-year-old Max Dolman becoming the youngest EVER player to score in the Premier League - what a moment!</p><p>Elsewhere, Chelsea's pre-match huddle antics couldn't prevent a defeat at home to Newcastle, Brighton get the win Sunderland and Liverpool labour to yet another last-minute equaliser, this time from Spurs in the FPL Family Derby!</p><p>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!</p><p>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:</p></div><ul>
<li><p>Exclusive FREE Podcasts every week looking ahead to the next GW</p></li>
