<item>
  <title>S9 Ep29: Sell Haaland?? Bruno Captain comes in CLUTCH!! FPL GW28-GW29 Fantasy Premier League Hints &amp; Tips</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8868056</link>
  <itunes:episode>29</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>Sell Haaland?? Bruno Captain comes in CLUTCH!! FPL GW28-GW29 Fantasy Premier League Hints &amp; Tips</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>9</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8868056.mp3?modified=1772408615&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="91351679" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/42921105.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>5705</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>The race for the Champions League spots is hotting up, with Villa dropping points this weekend, while Liverpool and Man Utd both grab wins at home. Elsewhere, City grind out a 0-1 against Leeds - Semenyo scoring again for Lee and Sam's teams. Set-piece FC are at it again, with a well-fought win against Chelsea. Burnley and Brentford play out a crazy and controversial 4-3 at Turf Moor and Everton score three at St James' Park against Bruno G-less Newcastle.</p><p>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!</p><p>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:</p><p>- Exclusive FREE Podcasts every week looking ahead to the next GW<br>- Manager of the Month Competitions  - MONTHLY PRIZES!<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers</p><p>Join for FREE or Support the Channel!<br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>________________________<br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>5162cw<br>________________________<br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br>Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes,  Deezer.<br> __________________________<br>Stats, Season Tickers and Player Ratings provided by Fantasy Football Scout Members Area.<br>Become a member here! - <a href="http://Bit.ly/FFScoutFamily">http://Bit.ly/FFScoutFamily</a><br>__________________________   <br> 🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter, Instagram and TikTok! - Just Search 'fplfamily'<br><a href="https://www.x.com/fplfamily">https://www.x.com/fplfamily</a> <br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/fplfamily">https://www.tiktok.com/fplfamily</a></p><p> #FPL #FPLFamily #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLTips</p></div>]]></description>
