  <itunes:title>SELL HAALAND? Ekitike, Joao Pedro IN? FPL GW24-GW25 Fantasy Premier League Hints &amp; Tips</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>9</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8855581.mp3?modified=1769988058&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="93442876" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/42921105.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>5835</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>After saying last week that we had no forwards to choose from - Joao Pedro, Dom Solanke and Hugo Ekitike took that personally - all hauling for their owners! And with Chelsea's fixtures still looking good for the foreseeable future, can we trust their defence in the same way we can trust their attack? And despite an assist, it's now 1 goal in 7 for Erling Haaland - should we actually start thinking about selling him??</p><p>Fresh from the Spurs game, get Sam's reaction to that crazy game of two halves in North London tonight - what on earth did Frank say at half time??!</p><p>Elsewhere, Arsenal make a statement win away at Leeds, Kroupi Jnr comes in for his owners against Wolves and Verbruggen owners lose their clean sheet points at the death at home to Everton.</p><p>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!</p><p>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:</p></div><ul>
<li><p>Exclusive FREE Podcasts every week looking ahead to the next GW</p></li>
<li><p>Manager of the Month Competitions  - MONTHLY PRIZES!</p></li>
<li><p>Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam</p></li>
<li><p>Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers</p></li>
</ul><div>
<br>Join for FREE or Support the Channel!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEZ4a2lTLVc3SnJocTctdkNVWEphRVBEX2U3Z3xBQ3Jtc0trUXpzbmRodmRVY0g3cXVRYjB2UEJDVmQ0SHRHUzBqMVZ5MTlHZ1FONDNoeXVXc3RnSEdnSWxWS3F1aUhEX0FMSmZxb1NBZFRwb3RYN3NERFJ3Y2FYRFVJbkQ5MzhUdHJLRGhXbUlPZkxLcEIxOW9Tcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=6dMRPpAuKl0"> </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEZ4a2lTLVc3SnJocTctdkNVWEphRVBEX2U3Z3xBQ3Jtc0trUXpzbmRodmRVY0g3cXVRYjB2UEJDVmQ0SHRHUzBqMVZ5MTlHZ1FONDNoeXVXc3RnSEdnSWxWS3F1aUhEX0FMSmZxb1NBZFRwb3RYN3NERFJ3Y2FYRFVJbkQ5MzhUdHJLRGhXbUlPZkxLcEIxOW9Tcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=6dMRPpAuKl0"> / fplfamily  </a><br>________________________<br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>5162cw<br>________________________<br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3N1THp6M1RfdmNybTR0M1gzcHJuWGg5Z0pxd3xBQ3Jtc0tsdFVRSktIVk01T1dfS0U2bkNXa3Etb2lSZ2RIZThoaUpQNDFieXdyaHpMMW5iUmU1NGRhNk5jZVlBQWJGSEdjUF9HRkt5YzNMQkVNY0lNWE9KcmJEa3puX3FjSlNGZkVlaUNjOHFybGFTRkJZSHc4TQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsoundcloud.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=6dMRPpAuKl0"> </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3N1THp6M1RfdmNybTR0M1gzcHJuWGg5Z0pxd3xBQ3Jtc0tsdFVRSktIVk01T1dfS0U2bkNXa3Etb2lSZ2RIZThoaUpQNDFieXdyaHpMMW5iUmU1NGRhNk5jZVlBQWJGSEdjUF9HRkt5YzNMQkVNY0lNWE9KcmJEa3puX3FjSlNGZkVlaUNjOHFybGFTRkJZSHc4TQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsoundcloud.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=6dMRPpAuKl0"> / fplfamily  </a><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXFmUWlGM001UGlmc3Bad09sVV9VODRsYlN2QXxBQ3Jtc0ttcUJGOG03MzA4X0tSWlN3dWZVNS1ZWmhreTlSTjVObGdUUmFkRUpPTWRrOWVhLVNFTWRwcnF6VkRBVy0xYlZUTmViMGE2QjMxSWY2U1JLVGVLWnRSRFpqdTZMb1NpVUd2MkVFWmRMbDNmdUFwY2w3NA&amp;q=https%