  <description><![CDATA[<div>After last week's 16-point haul, Haaland captains have eat some humble pie as the big Norwegian blanks for his owners. Also well-captained Hugo Ekitike outperforms him with a single assist against Wolves, but it's Wirtz in midfield that steals the show and the FPL points this week.<br><br>Villa's excellent run continues with a win against Chelsea at Stamford Bridge, so we look ahead to Tuesday's clash with Arsenal in anticipation of a mouth-watering tie. elsewhere this week, DCL just keeps on scoring, West Ham lose again (miserably) at home to Fulham and Manchester beats Newcastle in the clash of the Uniteds.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br><br></div><ul>
<li>Exclusive FREE Podcasts every week looking ahead to the next GW<br><br></li>
