<item>
  <title>S9 Ep15: United Win at Anfield!! Slot got it WRONG!...GW8-9 (Fantasy Premier League FPL Tips 2025/2026)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8793494</link>
  <itunes:episode>15</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>United Win at Anfield!! Slot got it WRONG!...GW8-9 (Fantasy Premier League FPL Tips 2025/2026)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>9</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8793494.mp3?modified=1760911486&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="86796386" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/42921105.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>5420</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>With wins for Arsenal and City, the onus was on the chasing pack to keep pace with the two front-runners. Arne Slot's Liverpool though, lose their third game in a row at Anfield to Manchester United, while Bournemouth and Palace play out a superb 3-3 draw, with a hat-trick from Mateta. Chelsea breeze past Forest and in doing so, sack Ange Postecoglu. Spurs stutter at home to Villa and Brighton beat Newcastle at the Amex.<br><br>We look back at all the weekend's action and discuss transfers for next week, including a possible Bench Boost.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br><br></div><ul>
<li>Exclusive FREE Podcasts every week looking ahead to the next GW<br><br></li>
<li>Manager of the Month Competitions  - MONTHLY PRIZES!<br><br></li>
<li>Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br><br></li>
<li>Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br><br></li>
