<item>
  <title>S9 Ep14: SAM'S HUGE GREEN ARROW! Saka, Kudus, Semenyo! GW7-8 (Fantasy Premier League FPL Tips 2025/2026)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8787037</link>
  <itunes:episode>14</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>SAM'S HUGE GREEN ARROW! Saka, Kudus, Semenyo! GW7-8 (Fantasy Premier League FPL Tips 2025/2026)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>9</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8787037.mp3?modified=1759701248&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="88331149" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/42921105.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>5516</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Very contrasting emotional states here at FPL Family tonight! Lee has to watch Liverpool lose their third game in a week, while Sam watches Spurs grab three very good points at Elland Road. Palace lost their unbeaten run at the Hill-Dickinson, United cruise past Sunderland and Arsenal get the job done at home to West Ham, but lose their captain to a knee injury.<br><br>And in FPL, Lee's had a week to forget, while Sam's week sees her climb the ranks with a massive green arrow.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br>- Exclusive FREE Podcasts every week looking ahead to the next GW<br>- Manager of the Month Competitions  - MONTHLY PRIZES!<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br><br>Join for FREE or Support the Channel!<br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>________________________<br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>5162cw<br>________________________<br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br>Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes,  Deezer.<br> __________________________<br>Stats, Season Tickers and Player Ratings provided by Fantasy Football Scout Members Area.<br>Become a member here! - <a href="http://Bit.ly/FFScoutFamily">http://Bit.ly/FFScoutFamily</a><br>__________________________   <br> 🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter, Instagram and TikTok! - Just Search 'fplfamily'<br><a href="https://www.x.com/fplfamily">https://www.x.com/fplfamily</a> <br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/fplfamily">https://www.tiktok.com/fplfamily</a><br><br> #FPL #FPLFamily #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLTips</div>]]></description>
