<item>
  <title>S9 Ep13: Erling Haaland Triple Captainers in DREAMLAND! GW6-7 (Fantasy Premier League FPL Tips 2025/2026)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8784055</link>
  <itunes:episode>13</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>Erling Haaland Triple Captainers in DREAMLAND! GW6-7 (Fantasy Premier League FPL Tips 2025/2026)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>9</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8784055.mp3?modified=1759096233&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="73924721" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/42921105.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>4616</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>So BOTH Lee and Sam's Wildcards played in GW6, so we'll ask whether they were a HIT or a MISS? And now what in GW7, what went right on Wildcard, but also what do we need to fix, if anything. Haaland came in for both of us of course, but that also meant that we weren't able to use the Triple Captain - those that did got a huge 90+ minute HAUL from the big Norwegian. <br>Elsewhere, Liverpool lost their 100% record against a very good-looking Palace side, United stumble again with Bruno missing yet ANOTHER penalty and Chelsea fall to Brighton at home.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br><br></div><ul>
<li>Exclusive FREE Podcasts every week looking ahead to the next GW<br><br></li>
<li>Manager of the Month Competitions  - MONTHLY PRIZES!<br><br></li>
<li>Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br><br></li>
<li>Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br><br></li>
</ul><div>
