<item>
  <title>S9 Ep4: BRAND NEW CHANGES for Season 25/26 in FPL!</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8751457</link>
  <itunes:episode>4</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>BRAND NEW CHANGES for Season 25/26 in FPL!</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>9</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8751457.mp3?modified=1753051859&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="31243887" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/42921105.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>1948</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to Season 9 of FPL Family! Big week over at FPL Towers and they're ringing the changes ahead of the new season. We've got twice the chips, positional changes for the likes of Bowen and Marmoush and a little bit of extra help when it comes to navigating the African Cup of Nations in the new year. <br><br>Some we like, some we don't, but as ever, we'll be giving our opinions either way! Let us know what you think of the changes in the comments!<br><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>Manager of the Month Competitions  - MONTHLY PRIZES!<br>Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>Exclusive Podcasts every week looking ahead to the next GW<br><br>  / fplfamily  <br>________________________<br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>[TBC]<br>________________________<br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br>  / fplfamily  <br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br>Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes,  Deezer.<br> __________________________<br>Stats, Season Tickers and Player Ratings provided by Fantasy Football Scout Members Area.<br>Become a member here! - <a href="http://Bit.ly/FFSFamily">http://Bit.ly/FFSFamily</a><br>__________________________   <br> 🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter, Instagram and TikTok! - Just Search 'fplfamily'<br>  / fplfamily   <br>  / fplfamily  <br><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/fplfamily">https://www.tiktok.com/fplfamily</a><br><br> #FPL #FPLFamily #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLTips</div>]]></description>
  <pubDate>Sun, 20 Jul 2025 22:48:57 +0000</pubDate>
  <guid isPermaLink="false">tag:audioboom.com,2025-07-20:/posts/8751457</guid>
  <itunes:author>FPL Family</itunes:author>
  <dc:creator>FPL Family</dc:creator>
