<item>
  <title>S9 Ep3: We will ALL BUY this Spurs player in FPL! - Sam's view of Spurs ahead of GW1</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8743930</link>
  <itunes:episode>3</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>We will ALL BUY this Spurs player in FPL! - Sam's view of Spurs ahead of GW1</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>9</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8743930.mp3?modified=1753052185&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="36983494" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/42921105.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>2307</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>**Recorded before the devastating news about Diogo Jota. All our thoughts and love are with their families and friends at this terribly difficult time. RIP Diogo.**<br><br>After my voice note Podcast a few weeks back, Sam wants the right to reply! We get her thoughts on the situation at Spurs, with Ange out and Thomas Frank in. We'll discuss who we think are the top FPL targets to go after in the new Frank system, what indeed that system might look like going into GW1 - and the one player that Sam thinks is going to be Frank's new 'poster boy'!<br><br>Enjoy!<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br> _________________________         <br><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br></div><ul>
<li>Manager of the Month Competitions  - MONTHLY PRIZES!<br><br></li>
<li>Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br><br></li>
