  <description><![CDATA[<div>So despite delivering the Spurs fans a trophy for the first time in 17 years, Daniel Levy has decided to let Ange Postecoglou go - but was he right to do so? And who next to take Spurs to the next level? With Thomas Frank looking odds-on favourite, i'll discuss the pros and cons of that appointment as I see it. Enjoy!<br><br>- Lee<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing the Podcast!<br> _________________________         <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily Sleeper PickEm League - WEEKLY PRIZES!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHZhcnVENkpTYUxYa0lfc3d3eVExelAwVGZHQXxBQ3Jtc0tubFZ4VmN0SWMwbVlqZUV5ZnBrdzNjdGM0Y0x2Wmpqbkk2UXl3NmF1MUhKWUpRQ29McHlwREpQRF9HR2NKVG9scEVCWms2emczeTdqRC1jTk5UZGc2NnE0Wl9tbjVzeVNqZ19DOEVxWHRwOGprMXdlSQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamPickEm&amp;v=H4rTdcdcxy4">https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FP...</a><br><br>Download the Sleeper app<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHFCeXllb2NXTTVteUZMb2NESUdoWV9abFRXd3xBQ3Jtc0tueDlBcEt3UlBiRktyaW9sREcxb1NPRm1RUFhpOGdIT1lPcXJBZkFpUE9acFlyUGs0WDgxcUQ3T05NMWlzS3FJbmJPLXoxWHRySXlRdEJ2SjUwRXlCQVIxdFYzb1FoUUpYU2pyS3JONkViTG1oa0hJZw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamily&amp;v=H4rTdcdcxy4">https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FP...</a><br>__________________________<br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br></div><ul>
