<item>
  <title>S9 Ep1: How will FPL price Florian Wirtz at Liverpool?</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8733673</link>
  <itunes:episode>1</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>How will FPL price Florian Wirtz at Liverpool?</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>9</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8733673.mp3?modified=1753052198&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="10254290" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/42921105.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>636</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>With Florian Wirtz looking set for a move to Liverpool, I couldn't be more excited! A genuine global superstar with Balon D'Or potential... Arne Slot means business this summer! <br><br>So if he does land at Liverpool, how will FPL price him? I'll tell you where I think he'll come in and my theory as to how Liverpool can afford to pay the monstrous fee that Leverkusen are demanding Enjoy!<br><br>- Lee <br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing the Podcast! <br> _________________________         <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily Sleeper PickEm League - WEEKLY PRIZES!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHZhcnVENkpTYUxYa0lfc3d3eVExelAwVGZHQXxBQ3Jtc0tubFZ4VmN0SWMwbVlqZUV5ZnBrdzNjdGM0Y0x2Wmpqbkk2UXl3NmF1MUhKWUpRQ29McHlwREpQRF9HR2NKVG9scEVCWms2emczeTdqRC1jTk5UZGc2NnE0Wl9tbjVzeVNqZ19DOEVxWHRwOGprMXdlSQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamPickEm&amp;v=H4rTdcdcxy4">https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FP...</a><br><br>Download the Sleeper app<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHFCeXllb2NXTTVteUZMb2NESUdoWV9abFRXd3xBQ3Jtc0tueDlBcEt3UlBiRktyaW9sREcxb1NPRm1RUFhpOGdIT1lPcXJBZkFpUE9acFlyUGs0WDgxcUQ3T05NMWlzS3FJbmJPLXoxWHRySXlRdEJ2SjUwRXlCQVIxdFYzb1FoUUpYU2pyS3JONkViTG1oa0hJZw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamily&amp;v=H4rTdcdcxy4">https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FP...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br></div><ul>
