  <description><![CDATA[<div>What a week it's been here at FPL Family. The PL season is over and both Spurs and Liverpool has e lifted trophies, meaning we are both in WONDERFUL moods. For one of us though, it was a very narrow defeat in the FPL Family <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/teamlee">#TeamLee</a> vs <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/teamsam">#TeamSam</a> season head-to-head, what a finale! We look back at an incredible season, our eighth in FPL as FPL Family and look forward to our ninth. We'll also reveal our Pre-Season Predictions - who did we think would win the league, get relegated and win the golden boot, back in GW1. All is revealed tonight on FPL Family!<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily Sleeper PickEm League - WEEKLY PRIZES!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTFoemVyYXFLb2xLUTdTdE5IdUcxeEhZYV93Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsWWdTSWlTaWJBODFJQzU1YmN0aGZaYU1HcGxxVWhpbU1WN01pYW1pVHpJY2UyT215QlV5eWJFZnJMTmNWV195M2dxbU9RX1BLV29sb093emZiaXF4eW5JekJyTXZPdkRJX2dTN0FiSkNOWkhNSzkxUQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamPickEm&amp;v=zxPcLecHl7E">https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FP...</a><br><br>Download the Sleeper app<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVc2QzJWbGpnQ2RCTDZmZ0xQZU8zdUtLNW55UXxBQ3Jtc0tsNURqVVB1VjZ3NjFJZHFLRF85MWtRM2prWGMtUUxsUjNZRkZGYUQzdFNISXFMVmxPZUQxMGI3Mmt2Vl9pellOa2xadWFKTzRvWmppOEpqb0JKRjBaVjIzRmdkbHhjcXhMS0tfY0dxYzYxVG9SQVluaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamily&amp;v=zxPcLecHl7E">https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FP...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br></div><ul>
