  <title>S8 Ep34: Man City held at Saints! Advantage Newcastle! -GW36-37 - (Fantasy Premier League FPL Tips 2024/2025)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8718654</link>
  <itunes:episode>34</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>Man City held at Saints! Advantage Newcastle! -GW36-37 - (Fantasy Premier League FPL Tips 2024/2025)</itunes:title>
