  <description><![CDATA[<div>Just two weeks to go in FPL and the race for Champions League football is hotting up. Villa squeeze past Bournemouth despite being reduced to 10 men and Newcastle beat Chelsea. Southampton hold Man City to ensure they're NOT the worst team ever in PL history and in doing so, keep Erling Haaland quiet on his return from injury. Elsewhere both Spurs and Man United lose 0-2 at home, demonstrating their focus is clearly elsewhere!<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily Sleeper PickEm League - WEEKLY PRIZES!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbm9JeVVhdHFvNXltNEZQTDltXzczR2dhSXdjd3xBQ3Jtc0tuY09VaGI1bVByTVhlQmx4bGd4NW1sbzVIT3VqY3Q2VGtORl9iWHY2eWJTMHpYTmM2YmxtM19UN0xUVy1GcFZYRHZCMUV6NEtvUUxHMmNKN3praW5jc0dHaXlCTnhFVXAwbnhlN1BFRWd0U0Z4aDZoZw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamPickEm&amp;v=u4pMnzJEMyE">https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FP...</a><br><br>Download the Sleeper app<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFJscjVYa0VOUFBfNjdWeVlmb1dQUlVEbl9wQXxBQ3Jtc0tsV3VJQnZ1MlJwWlVPbTZHbjl3MUVKM1dlc2h1cUhfdko0Zm5GUEdKWndYS1k1VzlHU3h5bzFTUUhUa1dNSll4QVN4UVdPeGRxemhQSGFUcF9nUW9nSzZEcTNTaWJVX01GWDBnUDFiVlhmY2hWamxIUQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamily&amp;v=u4pMnzJEMyE">https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FP...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br></div><ul>
