<item>
  <title>S8 Ep30: Sam's Wildcard WIN or FAIL? Bench Boost? GW31-32 - (Fantasy Premier League FPL Tips 2024/2025)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8700965</link>
  <itunes:episode>30</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>Sam's Wildcard WIN or FAIL? Bench Boost? GW31-32 - (Fantasy Premier League FPL Tips 2024/2025)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>8</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8700965.mp3?modified=1743975903&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="73525427" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/42336273.png" />
  <itunes:duration>4563</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Long time, no see! Great to be back on the other side of the international break. So much has happened, as is still to happen, in FPL - Sam played the Wildcard this week, so we assess. the fallout and ask in which GW she should use the Bench Boost - GW32 or GW33? Lee can't Bench Boost, because he played the Assistant Manager in GW31, so is it stick or twist for him going into GW 32? We look back at all the weekend's action, including a rare defeat for Liverpool and another disappointing result for Salah owners. Spurs relegate Southampton, Villa's put a dent in Forest's Champions League hopes and Arsenal drop points at Goodison.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br>***************<br>*Sam Featured on the Official Spurs Instagram Page for International Women's Day:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVRtcWpiMXNOZVVzS3FuWEs5ZU53TXJfbzduZ3xBQ3Jtc0tta3UzWUNoVktIUVl1MHlXeW5OcXJ0eGVldUFJTE5BZDFMdVJwWlR3SFlBNGRId0dlQTF4aUJpUUhsMkZRbEZyN0RHRG1obmlkWk1aZDIxcGVnRndDSXh6WV9nbmNicmk5bXpYaTdza3otNmk4Zjl6OA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Freel%2FDG7qCdHuedg%2F%3Figsh%3DZ3pwcjB2Y2h2NGo1&amp;v=XYgGJjsER7Y">https://www.instagram.com/reel/DG7qCd...</a><br><br> _________________________         <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily Sleeper PickEm League - WEEKLY PRIZES!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTFDMGVod01sWEtDV1I0VFZUWGhfTnRkUzRid3xBQ3Jtc0ttQTJ1U1lQdWdzM3Y4a3dUS2VDUnRDZWh2Zk80VHB2RDVxaU1MOG91SkRyNWI1X2dHc3BMdFRXcjJnMXh5R25HMFIwb3UwYnNnaDd0aW8ycE9hYk5LbHYybVVFbXVYb2I1cnREV3hRZHdOTjVVdTRrWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamPickEm&amp;v=XYgGJjsER7Y">https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FP...</a><br><br>Download the Sleeper app<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVpjdXZlbTc3RHVuLW9ITEpkam10U0tUUUlPUXxBQ3J