  <description><![CDATA[<div>As we go into the International Break, both Lee and Sam stumble through Blank GW29 largely unscathed - with Sam owning a debt of gratitude to Forest's Anthony Elanga, as popular FPL captain Chris Wood BLANKS in game with six goals! Elsewhere, Newcastle beat Liverpool in the League Cup, City labour to a draw at home to impressive Brighton, Fulham brush aside Spurs and Arsenal squeeze out a 1-0 win over Palmer-less Chelsea. We look at our teams, scores and players to consider now over the International Break.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br>***************<br>*Sam Featured on the Official Spurs Instagram Page for International Women's Day:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGNQNGVKQjRQVWt1WUdnT2NkVWpQSmNNQVRNUXxBQ3Jtc0tsX3hIR1VraFR6aVBpQmRfaUdOZ0pxdHBHRVNUNkNCR1ZHZVY1T0ZkWUw3S000TTRwdzVwbERPdjgzcFFWRTNwRzRTR2t5b2VvWmUzbkROMkpWWUN4dlVJZUtOWElhOFRuS2JWTjNjaFE5Zk1xYllYNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Freel%2FDG7qCdHuedg%2F%3Figsh%3DZ3pwcjB2Y2h2NGo1&amp;v=G1_ZNox2K8g">https://www.instagram.com/reel/DG7qCd...</a><br><br> _________________________         <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily Sleeper PickEm League - WEEKLY PRIZES!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjlGSll1d0N1WlFDbm5mODRPcG12UmZkaWQ5UXxBQ3Jtc0tsWUJtQnpfcHhUVHRHbEdjX1dQWEhMX2EwRlBNZmIxb2Vxem1fZHJualIyMENHY053M1I1elRTVkpGR0tPT01zWWlTVmIwVDBYNDhsTFRNczY4QkVYbXc3X0FadlpIWjRlSnZJc3NRWGpzRDBXMUNqaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamPickEm&amp;v=G1_ZNox2K8g">https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FP...</a><br><br>Download the Sleeper app<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmswTUtUd0FLTTZpMVV2elNycHRFdjZ0cG9UQXxBQ3Jtc0tudFRScjBvTXVHOXhtYkJ6bmhlcFpkWXVYa2t0U1hMRnhWVDRRZmtjSlJaSFFPUElTQld4clhJOFlTWU9hV3M4TzZEcFY4RGh5OVdRR3NvU3B2NFgxcnVHLV