<item>
  <title>S8 Ep27: FPL GW26/27 - Bowen HAMMER blow to Arsenal title hopes! - (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2024/2025)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8658273</link>
  <itunes:episode>27</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>FPL GW26/27 - Bowen HAMMER blow to Arsenal title hopes! - (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2024/2025)</itunes:title>
