<item>
  <title>S8 Ep22: FPL GW20/21 - MAN UTD GRAB A POINT! THRILLER at ANFIELD!  - (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2024/2025)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8632523</link>
  <itunes:episode>22</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>FPL GW20/21 - MAN UTD GRAB A POINT! THRILLER at ANFIELD!  - (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2024/2025)</itunes:title>
