  <description><![CDATA[<div>It's FPL Family Derby Day so we give our hot-takes on both Spurs and Liverpool from this afternoon's action. Elsewhere, United lose again under Amorim and Newcastle find some form. Arsenal make light work of a trip to Palace, but it comes at a cost with Bukayo Saka pictured leaving Selhurst Park on crutches, nursing a hamstring injury. We'll talk through possible replacements and ask whether Nottingham Forest are actually IN this title race??!<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br> _________________________         <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily Sleeper PickEm League - WEEKLY PRIZES!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbU5qTU9tMlM0Nk9CaEN5OGNMOUd6aXRKekRJUXxBQ3Jtc0trTnNKR1JkNGxjblRFLXRKVHhfeFdmRzJjRWJtdGprcHVEYlJiWENCaWlYRFg5LXN0LXlYYXY1VHhEeGZxTDFHZXN2NUpFMzg0Sm5aM2dHTDU0WXh1M3NNRXBVazhoc2VWZERIdEdWY2VnTWcyQmVIWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamPickEm&amp;v=i3avkPSOfq4">https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FP...</a><br><br>Download the Sleeper app<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkJqUEZqcG9qWHJrcWVLZEs5Z19hVzZWdEtxQXxBQ3Jtc0ttMnNBbEt6R3ljUlE1ajhVUEdQWFB1MHMxS1hESGsxQjhxcjd0Q3M2cjc0QURsempmd0xXbWpHaUd5Mmdqb2Ywa2FsUWdhMnNpWHhuNVdTckJHdmphMGdtVW1IZGg4NkZPUXhjeGYycFM0eV85NF9Obw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamily&amp;v=i3avkPSOfq4">https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FP...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br></div><ul>
