  <title>S8 Ep18: FPL GW15/16 - Man City &amp; Arsenal both drop points! - (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2024/2025)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8620837</link>
  <itunes:episode>18</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>FPL GW15/16 - Man City &amp; Arsenal both drop points! - (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2024/2025)</itunes:title>
