  <description><![CDATA[<div>What a mad week of FPL - Goalkeeper assists, red cards and goals a-plenty for our assets - but none for Mo Salah and Liverpool as the Merseyside Derby falls foul of the weather. We look at a bonkers week for Lee's team, leaving him with a conundrum with Bryan Mbeumo - keep or sell? - either could happen this week to be honest! We'll look back at the weekend's action and ahead to GW16<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br> _________________________         <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily Sleeper PickEm League - WEEKLY PRIZES!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3lRZm1wZXZyaUp5YUhoUkxmMGx5S2t4M1VpZ3xBQ3Jtc0tteVFQX0s5S1pQVmdpNWpQOEZLSW5COXdSelhZR3JmeF9UX2VkMEhhMVlFT2FGLUZ6aTlvRVRDdkFCaUN4b1lrUHVwV1NnWUdXX3F5Z0FfNjlYbVhYUUhaQkNmV0JMb0k0Nzh2bDAweDJzb2xnSmJCVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamPickEm&amp;v=mWiOl141cLQ">https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FP...</a><br><br>Download the Sleeper app<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVlIb0lQM0d6bHVjZG9NU2hFa0NiVHRZV2hsUXxBQ3Jtc0tsUGNZc1hrSDItby1fY0M2MEtaRXl1cTZBZlRYLUhYbEVDenBQbDhCb1J6VzdLb2FjY19UZndDbW1kb2FfLW9kcmYydkgycF9ydFZsQkFCR2hxTmduUTc1MTJyaUFNbXB0WnFTUUl0eVFxY0RWNWU3WQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamily&amp;v=mWiOl141cLQ">https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FP...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br></div><ul>
