  <description><![CDATA[<div>After defeats in GW4, Lee and Sam are in MUCH better spirits this week as Liverpool and Spurs both record home GW5 wins! LOADS to discuss in this weekend's big game at the Etihad as City leave it late to salvage a point against 10-man Arsenal. Elsewhere, Villa and Morgan Rogers leave it late against Wolves and Chelsea breeze past a woeful West Ham. We'll look back at all the weekend's action and plan ahead for GW6.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br>_________________________     <br>Support Sam on the Shine Night Walk for Cancer Research UK!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblFjR01ZUXR6VFNIZ3hocmRSTzBlWFBmbnRIUXxBQ3Jtc0tuQVNvT0hlaHZBR0dDQVBpX1pNR2xfRWh5VElVR01IS1IyYk05VXF4VzdLRGJpdll5bmJrX29MZDdlNXA1QUZlejVqUUpyTDd2anhiR3Jqb21GRlphbGpLR3lRQlVhWVQ0TDNVODFYNklFUnJmMWF5RQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffundraise.cancerresearchuk.org%2Fpage%2Fsams-giving-page-35351&amp;v=0lBbC59IWI4">https://fundraise.cancerresearchuk.or...</a><br><br> _________________________         <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily Sleeper PickEm League - WEEKLY PRIZES!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjRqbWRfSkdJcnZtV3ZsWVg3WVM3ZDZDSUNMUXxBQ3Jtc0ttTHl1MVBxN05WcUFBZ3pCeE1USUxvbnNFVGRYUHUxMWtGYjFrblpQV0JZUXFPZU1iQ2h1QmFDZHR4NTlPajNVUmR0ckF5djNQa0x3OW95cGdBbGw2R1pMVncyNktPY0JsNE1ER2NkTC1QQ01MTzFRQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamPickEm&amp;v=0lBbC59IWI4">https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FP...</a><br><br>Download the Sleeper app<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFVoNWk4ZnpiTEJIb1lUc2V0NDE0MV9wRzNwZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttYWtDNkR1MUFub3V0QzA5bU9jNE51REI4WThhUFpxcThTNFFVRU1UWlM3Q0VYZzVDTThqRkFDbWVNT1J3VTVLYXFBYTZQU0NjZER4dGZnZjFyLW51dmo2c3Y5S3l3dVE0MTBNYzBPZnJ1UW1CUkowTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsleeperbot.onelink.me%2FKdzJ%2FFPLFamily&amp;v=0lBbC5