  <description><![CDATA[<div>After a spirited comeback attempt by Spurs in the FPL Family derby, we're just about still talking to each other! Spurs looked poor though ahead of the big DGW37 and with plenty of injuries to deal with too, we'll look at how we're set up for the penultimate GW of the season - the last big double - and we're both Bench Boosting.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWRNcVpKSFFROFJZb3VkbEhISU8zTVZZVXBNUXxBQ3Jtc0trVXUzaE5jT0YyV0w0QlExZU9NU0NqT0lPZEphSUd4UVJVZUxVeW8wMlVWWDhCVFh0bU9hRmhfejRKblhvSkVQNUtEU1phNUtCUS1Cc3R1bHMwNURmc1BheXRzTWNGaUxBVHdtZ2lSRHgzU0phTkNRTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=5A-SwQbuXgc"> </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWRNcVpKSFFROFJZb3VkbEhISU8zTVZZVXBNUXxBQ3Jtc0trVXUzaE5jT0YyV0w0QlExZU9NU0NqT0lPZEphSUd4UVJVZUxVeW8wMlVWWDhCVFh0bU9hRmhfejRKblhvSkVQNUtEU1phNUtCUS1Cc3R1bHMwNURmc1BheXRzTWNGaUxBVHdtZ2lSRHgzU0phTkNRTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=5A-SwQbuXgc"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmQ5SmVQdDFKdjRuSkR4MjJxa29jekxRNzNtZ3xB