  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>We look back at the weekend's action, which saw (most likely) the end of Liverpool's title challenge and an interesting spat between Salah and Klopp, suggesting not all is well in the Anfield camp. Elsewhere, Newcastle relegate Sheffield United, with Isak and Gordon in superb form for Wildcarders that bought them in. <br><br>Sam gives us her view from the stands at the North London Derby and we check in on scores and Overall Ranks ahead of the last three GWs of the season.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWY1QXZ4cUh6QXFiYjRSdlpoX0V0SVZfU2l0Z3xBQ3Jtc0ttT0FxQk9CQlFsNU5yVEpqMkR6YnFub1lNQkxnRFJPMFFWTm1DRm16RXE0alNKa25sN01kQXJDRHJvakJJWlU0QVo4cXJNc3Z2UTA4RnVYTEhicHp5djJhb3ZJWmFXam1UODI3aGhDeWdDZ2Fhel9qRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=vwsryQz6iwM"> </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWY1QXZ4cUh6QXFiYjRSdlpoX0V0SVZfU2l0Z3xBQ3Jtc0ttT0FxQk9CQlFsNU5yVEpqMkR6YnFub1lNQkxnRFJPMFFWTm1DRm16RXE0alNKa25sN01kQXJDRHJvakJJWlU0QVo4cXJNc3Z2UTA4RnVYTEhicHp5djJhb3ZJWmFXam1UODI3aGhDeWdDZ2Fhel9qRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=vwsryQz6iwM"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br