  <description><![CDATA[<div> Tonight we find Sam and Lee both in humble moods, after defeats for Spurs and Liverpool this weekend - compounded by a challenging FPL week - especially for Salah captainers.<br><br>We look at all the weekend's action and look ahead to how we're shaping up for the big DGW34.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbG93SUNGaHZzcElGY3MwRklJQ2lnb3A1a0ViQXxBQ3Jtc0tudTJ1Szg4S1BfbEpVU1FQQjRHZG9iczYzeksteGxxanRtYW5KcjM1Qy1UTlZ0Y3VVdVV4N204b3lmdzFweTZjTGVfeGpuazFET2pVSlhRcW9BQUdZcG9vTmNwUmlYNjFBeFVILWhEc2ZoZVA5MHlfdw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=TeKNxSkyU3k"> </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbG93SUNGaHZzcElGY3MwRklJQ2lnb3A1a0ViQXxBQ3Jtc0tudTJ1Szg4S1BfbEpVU1FQQjRHZG9iczYzeksteGxxanRtYW5KcjM1Qy1UTlZ0Y3VVdVV4N204b3lmdzFweTZjTGVfeGpuazFET2pVSlhRcW9BQUdZcG9vTmNwUmlYNjFBeFVILWhEc2ZoZVA5MHlfdw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=TeKNxSkyU3k"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbE5tZUZRdlBXU1N1eUFDYkxxTTM0a0toaXhad3xBQ3Jtc0ttMVQxaHlpQUNIemxrd0ZFWjRLNG5pQzBnVFEwMzk2S25pdV