  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>As the full-time whistle blows on GW30, a week in which many FPL managers hit the Wildcard button - we take a quick breath and get ready to go again in midweek. GW31 rolls round quickly on Tuesday and there's flags and injuries everywhere! Gusto, Lascelles and crucially, Ollie Watkins might be facing some time off the pitch, so could that force Lee into Wildcarding earlier that he would he liked, particularly as he's got no Liverpool!<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/an">https://support.google.com/youtube/an</a>...<br>________________________<br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br> 🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter, Instagram and TikTok! - Just Search 'fplfamily'<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/fplfamily">https://www.tiktok.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br>Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes,  Deezer.<br> __________________________<br>Stats, Season Tickers and Player Ratings provided by Fantasy Football Scout Members Area.<br>Become a member here! - <a href="http://Bit.ly/FPLFamily1">http://Bit.ly/FPLFamily1</a>‬<br>__________________________   <br> #FPL #FPLFamily #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLTips</div>]]></description>
