<item>
  <title>Voice Note: GW30 Transfer Dilemma! Son OUT...?</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8480180</link>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8480180.mp3?modified=1711626209&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="9763519" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/41133983.png" />
  <itunes:duration>590</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>With GW30 Wildcard's active all over the place, Lee's knee might be starting to jerk - but for now he's holding firm and waiting until GW35. Which, for his team, means transfers become pretty precious between now and DGW34. And this week is no different. Salah in sounds nice, but the sacrifice is potentially huge...<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our Podcast!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEFQM0U3eGZyS1k2WmJBY3RUaFZEbW9RWHZWQXxBQ3Jtc0trcWNfRlBSdFFqNlNXTVBMTmpVWEV0cS01LVFGVFBkVUlyQm04eHNJSGJrR3VSYU03a2d0NkFBZGc3VDFqbW5aNHlOOVdKSjJUWk5pZnlUb05wOXpJOUVCcktHVWx2UnVZSGdFX3ZGR0lRclJsT0QwOA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=wKo5Yl-Duz8"> </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEFQM0U3eGZyS1k2WmJBY3RUaFZEbW9RWHZWQXxBQ3Jtc0trcWNfRlBSdFFqNlNXTVBMTmpVWEV0cS01LVFGVFBkVUlyQm04eHNJSGJrR3VSYU03a2d0NkFBZGc3VDFqbW5aNHlOOVdKSjJUWk5pZnlUb05wOXpJOUVCcktHVWx2UnVZSGdFX3ZGR0lRclJsT0QwOA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=wKo5Yl-Duz8"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa29EWWFCWXFpN3JDTVhCRE5CQjBad2Q4ODNDUXxBQ3Jtc0ttY2VC