<item>
  <title>OHANA - How the FA Cup Results Are Changing Our GW29 Thinking...</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8466181</link>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8466181.mp3?modified=1709210406&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="27924469" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/41451453/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>1742</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>We've made this week's Patreon OHANA Podcast available for all to listen! 😎<br><br>**For access to these exclusive Pods every week, check out <a href="http://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a>**<br><br>The FA Cup 5th round results are in and most of the top teams are through, meaning that GW29 looks, to say the least, a little sparse.<br><br>Only 8 teams will play, and of those, only a handful have FPL assets that we would want - Spurs, Villa, Alfie Doughty, Toney and maybe Charlie Taylor!<br><br>So questions is - are we dead-ending to 29 now, wildcard 30. Or are you Free Hitting in GW29? <br><br>As ever in FPL, you play your own game - so we'll discuss on today's Pod what we're currently planning, but for sure it's subject to change.<br><br>Green Arrows!<br><br>Lee and Sam x<br><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="http://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br></div>]]></description>
  <pubDate>Thu, 29 Feb 2024 12:39:41 +0000</pubDate>
  <guid isPermaLink="false">tag:audioboom.com,2024-02-29:/posts/8466181</guid>
  <itunes:author>FPL Family</itunes:author>
  <dc:creator>FPL Family</dc:creator>
</item>
<item>
  <title>S7 Ep22: FREE HIT or WILDCARD through BGW26? - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2023/2024)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8459836</link>
  <itunes:episode>22</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>FREE HIT or WILDCARD through BGW26? - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2023/2024)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>7</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8459836.mp3?modified=1708293857&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="71653380" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/41133983.png" />
  <itunes:duration>4458</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>With plenty of action still to go in GW25, Lee and Sam start thinking about this season's biggest Blank GW to date. Liverpool, Chelsea, Spurs and Luton all take a Premier League break, as the former two teams face off in the Carabao Cup Final. We also discuss Haaland's blank in the first of his DGW25 fixtures and Liverpool's injury-ridden win against Ivan Toney's Brentford, with Jota and Darwin Nunez both question marks for the second Liverpool game of the double.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVhOY3dFT21CdzVhaHc4UDFOV1phazJVVHpqUXxBQ3Jtc0tuWG5HeXhNa2wtM1MzeGJoY1dqaUZZejR6eFBFR1lLekc4NS1xVVh6TV9yWkJMUk95WU92NlZNd3RZSkhNVVVBaFBUNk9PTW1mNkxueF9UOXlCYWl6YnV3d0FuYUkzTkJKZExrcmwxZzhTeUlWM2d0RQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=EW6kahaAM_Y"> </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVhOY3dFT21CdzVhaHc4UDFOV1phazJVVHpqUXxBQ3Jtc0tuWG5HeXhNa2wtM1MzeGJoY1dqaUZZejR6eFBFR1lLekc4NS1xVVh6TV9yWkJMUk95WU92NlZNd3RZSkhNVVVBaFBUNk9PTW1mNkxueF9UOXlCYWl6YnV3d0FuYUkzTkJKZExrcmwxZzhTeUlWM2d0RQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=EW6kahaAM_Y"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here