  <description><![CDATA[<div>It's that time of the year that sorts the FPL wheat from the FPL chaff - it's blanks, doubles and chip season! And with a big DGW coming top for City, Liverpool, Brentford and Luton, there's plenty of picks to preside over and the first real opportunity to use the Triple Captain chip. <br><br>We look at how Lee and Sam's team are faring and plans for GW25 and beyond - with differing views on when the Free Hit chip should be played.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa09IdWg3ZjBweGh3NGF2ZG1rMG5FMGZRRm1WQXxBQ3Jtc0tuWDFXVmtfVDJkQ3pud0pXdFFfUXJNeURZRmppd0lQdnBkREdTWUF1cTV5cEcxSHJuNWlRdHo2S21zUE8zVjJDUzU1U2J5dG41R2hsejZ6eHJkNjRNOXE1RUNtRmpseU4xeDFpbHJ2cWV2Y1BuSl9raw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=dpuhNN75B6w">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazlqejQxYTRFQWRmejRPb1U4YlFkaTY2VFA3UXxBQ3Jtc0ttXzgtazhseElJMl9KX0J6OHhQNXJZTXRId1BQSmRoMThhWW9yU1VEdUdyaUs1WnppNTRLUEtiS0dwc1BwTWhmb0NaaXlqQkNGOVhrTGFWOFZLOGRzVzlUU0VwVDlTNS1zMTMyRjlPWU5LaXFsdUM2MA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.google.com%2Fyoutube%2Fan..&amp;v=dpuhNN75B6w">https://support.google.com/youtube