<item>
  <title>S7 Ep20: BACK TO BUSINESS - FPL GW22 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2023/2024)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8447863</link>
  <itunes:episode>20</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>BACK TO BUSINESS - FPL GW22 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2023/2024)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>7</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8447863.mp3?modified=1706483907&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="73145634" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/41133983.png" />
  <itunes:duration>4552</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Carabao and FA Cup fixtures over (for now), we're back to FPL business for GW22. We look ahead to Tuesday's deadline, as well as get Lee's reaction to Jurgen Klopp's decision to leave Liverpool - and what that might mean for the rest of the Red's season.<br><br>We check in with our Overall Ranks going into GW22 and discuss strategies for the upcoming DGWs and blanks.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEF4VnlEdHBRcEo1MnlkRDNWZURPbUhCaTM1Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsVzNGUHVDc3k2b0ZVU0U0ajdtbGtlTGZhN240UklyUUw0S0FWaEpab0ZwS1U2MmtqWmg1UFdnd3NBQXAydnRPSWxvMkF0M1p6emFrc0dyWW5DX2UyS3VvR2xCVzhPdTBDakRsYU9IZFBPRmJqaWdTUQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=qNBNe-msgMc">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVZNQ0d2US1lVnZmMEZtXzhyZVB4SmloLVR3QXxBQ3Jtc0tueTlZMXlObl9LSHAxT2NQUFdYT3JFV19PWFB4dV9zR0tTazI1alJOUU5CM0pZdDNRbzZzRjhqRHN4eFk2Vi1QckpkOUsyY0ZsRm42Tkg2Z1hLS1JiaWFLQmNlcUM1S203VFpmdlVvLUZBR0ZKT1dSbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.google.com%2Fyoutube%2Fan..&amp;v=qNBNe-msgMc">https://support.google.com/youtube/an..</a>.<br>________________________<br> 📺 Subscribe to the chan