  <description><![CDATA[<div>We check in with Lee and Sam's teams part way through a tricky-to-navigate GW21. There's still Premier League and Cup games a-plenty before we reach GW22 - but nevertheless, we look at some early possible moves, including a certain Belgian, who exploded back on to the scene at St. James' Park.<br><br>With a Double GW also being announced for City and Brentford in GW25, we look at Lee and Sam's strategies for maximising that GW's potential.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWVpNjk0bUQ1LWI2VllBMnBhZE1EVzZuQzIyZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuTjMzWnZlbU52TUNwaS01bDhqc1BsWFRXaHlsRmVPZ2FTbHRiSGQ3UGIzTWhvcTN5cm0wRXNfcDg3NzF0NmM1ODdPYXJJemN2Z0tTQllmXzVsaV9VdW9wajZWUVBPLVJWenpwbjFDRm00YmQwOUtSTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=yjdNXhHvimo"> </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWVpNjk0bUQ1LWI2VllBMnBhZE1EVzZuQzIyZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuTjMzWnZlbU52TUNwaS01bDhqc1BsWFRXaHlsRmVPZ2FTbHRiSGQ3UGIzTWhvcTN5cm0wRXNfcDg3NzF0NmM1ODdPYXJJemN2Z0tTQllmXzVsaV9VdW9wajZWUVBPLVJWenpwbjFDRm00YmQwOUtSTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=yjdNXhHvimo"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://