<item>
  <title>S7 Ep18: GW19 - ERLING HAALAND READY TO RETURN? - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2023/2024)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8421547</link>
  <itunes:episode>18</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>GW19 - ERLING HAALAND READY TO RETURN? - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2023/2024)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>7</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8421547.mp3?modified=1703456334&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="77081305" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/41133983.png" />
  <itunes:duration>4798</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>A Merry Christmas to everyone celebrating this festive season! Join Lee and Sam tonight, with a drink or two, alongside some decent-looking GW18 scores. So what now for GW19 and Boing Day? Is Haaland ready to return and if he is, not many FPL managers will want to lose the man they bought in for him - Dom Solanke - who posted a season-best 17-pointer and hat-trick in GW18.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjlSZ1dwY08zZjN0dTQxWF93c2xVWHp6X283Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsa1ppUjFLbFRQbUdrYURpb25ULXpRbmxPa3E1Zkg3bE83Z0VIRkhjeW9ZQ3ktV3JmVEIzNTd5SGNlMUkwdS1iSkdpYjVaTW1zSUdKbkJkVFZCUHZUZ1c2aVdYSDJINVNzUFBhT0RGNmJCcmpnU1hIRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=I9xFqN2AkuY"> </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjlSZ1dwY08zZjN0dTQxWF93c2xVWHp6X283Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsa1ppUjFLbFRQbUdrYURpb25ULXpRbmxPa3E1Zkg3bE83Z0VIRkhjeW9ZQ3ktV3JmVEIzNTd5SGNlMUkwdS1iSkdpYjVaTW1zSUdKbkJkVFZCUHZUZ1c2aVdYSDJINVNzUFBhT0RGNmJCcmpnU1hIRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=I9xFqN2AkuY"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUF