  <description><![CDATA[<div>After a rip-roaring week in FPL, we can finally take a small breather before we go again in GW17. We'll look ahead to see what we're planning to do with our teams and we'll discuss whether GW16's Haaland (c) to Salah (vc) is the jammiest points we'll get all season.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkZZSUIteFFnZEFWSnhhMFR1UzNvQnhJbEVWUXxBQ3Jtc0tudDZpNWlRM1cwNFdSbTE5WHhEQ3hWeWVyamhIdU5sbnlpZUE1VlJ6QlFuLWxyTkdFSkxLVzV5aDJnWF9pQmdmV09tcUtoTVFwQXpxMWE3Z2loZ1Q3amZjZkdTMktYVFBnMlVlSzNQb3M0VXVhZ2hnOA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=Wa-27cNSTGg">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbE8yaG04OHZ6dEdEa1luMWM5M1ZyeXJLV214UXxBQ3Jtc0trUXRJeHMwemZuVGY1eGFvTDZVVUllMTEyNUxYMndLVThJbmtLcU80X1NDQzdIcGI0c0V5a1lpeENfODltRWNqVE52akhrUjhnSUpsX2RjTzYta0RWMlRqeFFST2trT0dhYUtUd3pUSlFvVkotYWlhNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.google.com%2Fyoutube%2Fan..&amp;v=Wa-27cNSTGg">https://support.google.com/youtube/an..</a>.<br>________________________<br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="https://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br> 🏃‍♂️ Follow us on T