  <description><![CDATA[<div>No time to draw breath, as GW14 comes to an end, we quickly get into a midweek round of GW15 fixtures on Tuesday and Wednesday. We'll look back at the weekend's action and ask whether Dubravka should come straight into our teams, who should we get from Arteta's table-topping Gunners and are Sheffield United now confirmed Premier League whipping boys.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbThQd0NaUjZHODY3NTc1SEZuNVVkaEJUNU9Hd3xBQ3Jtc0tuRXJfSm1hOVdjNE1vT0J5a3VnbkZTeF9vXzdjN3VXOWVNLUVWSnNzWm1XcnM2LTNLVDZRdjhCa2FJRUF4VzZfcUxEcXhhN3hfcU0yZlR1eGl5bFB2Z3k1NU5xRkhwaHJjYWNEWEZ6M0V1MXoyRTYwWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=KA202-Rsmjs">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnowTW1SdFp6TG9BS21fQ3VWY1gxUHhuMmFnZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuYXNiZjE5WVZWT25iNHNUUHFsNl9MMXFOb3g0YVpscUtLb1lDWGdEbVhFOGNNRVJvcVFvMW5vOV9fVC1YdWwxMVJrRGZPNkVwc05aTFYtVmxITWZ6OEhROGZZZEIzQXNwSTZKMnIyRGFfeEVkaTdRWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.google.com%2Fyoutube%2Fan..&amp;v=KA202-Rsmjs">https://support.google.com/youtube/an..</a>.<br>________________________<br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="htt