<item>
  <title>S7 Ep14: WILL SAM SELL SON FOR MBEUMO? - GW14 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2023/2024)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8406493</link>
  <itunes:episode>14</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>WILL SAM SELL SON FOR MBEUMO? - GW14 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2023/2024)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>7</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8406493.mp3?modified=1701035630&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="72645866" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/41133983.png" />
  <itunes:duration>4520</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>City and Liverpool play out a 1-1 draw at Anfield, with both major captaincy options, Salah and Haaland getting an FPL return. Ollie Watkins and Aston Villa pile on the misery as Spurs make it back-to-back defeats in the league. Havertz comes good for Arsenal and Newcastle bring Chelsea back down to earth after a couple of decent results of the Blues. We look at all the GW13 action and look ahead to GW14, where Bryan Mbeumo is bound to be a popular transfer in.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmhobjJZV0JQdzJRa2lzRVNXQ2U0Q180MnJwZ3xBQ3Jtc0tucm5JRC1ycXVXOWtSc2hYUzFTSzVVWThySEdQREVyTnNXeFZsakF5TmNrUk55QzFZa3J1VjBWTU9KRHpxOGhTSlBzUWx1MGhDZGlCOTZ2R2VCcEZ6LWpKd2UweDhlUWZpNVc0Q1BiZmpqc215Uzh1SQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=iRIBdoKHfuY">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVBUZjM2Q01QUm5MUjI2YlNqeklzUVdjYlY0d3xBQ3Jtc0traklwUDJ4Wmx3V01NNFAtcllQdWFQaDNWaTFFQzdNeExOa1c5eXJOM2xzX1pYWk1LblhDS2haMG1mc01PTEl2bUFhcGhrUXNNSmt6Y21kN3Fib05ycTFjVzRHWmxvMGZ2RzZoclo0RndNUVlKM1hURQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.google.com%2Fyoutube%2Fan..&amp;v=iRIBdoKHfuY">http