  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>In a week very short of points for many FPL managers, we wade through the wreckage with higher hopes for GW12. With Chelsea v Spurs still to play, we saw Newcastle edge out Arsenal, Villa crash at Forest and City romp to victory yet again - but with Doku the star of the show, not Haaland!<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1FaRS1LY012dXlxM1VSY1kxWFZLWFVlQ193d3xBQ3Jtc0tsSXJhRlZKbXpMUzJ6czBzeXZWZmZwWWROUWs5NmVGRnEtaWtDNVprVEpCRS1QSDYyNGZnN29CcU9UcHEzZVFMOGlLS01MWDZKdFJhdzhUSHV1OGpsbzZYOGhzQ2lOTTNIQTNIR29xV3JnVkFCb3hBdw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=Hqw5nHT1lM8">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDdheGhiWHdHNXNpWUJjTFVKNlJVSVBRMEo4d3xBQ3Jtc0tsNUNWQjZISVNWeC1HbXcwd0dwR0V2NUlUeHFkV0MzSmoxRjZJWEhlMTFncW1hS3VFUDBpX2haaU1HVjl3d0prSEZWV21Rek5wc0dUU0FHRzZjTXl1VXA2UXY5NThPbTcyRW92M2s5T0ZVR2hrQW51MA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.google.com%2Fyoutube%2Fan..&amp;v=Hqw5nHT1lM8">https://support.google.com/youtube/an..</a>.<br>________________________<br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="https://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <