  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Liverpool 2.0 is really cooking under Jurgen Klopp so far this season and I'm a firm believer that it is largely down to one man - Dom Szoboszlai.<br><br>I talk through a tactical analysis of what I've seen so far from the Hungarian at Anfield this season and how he and other Liverpool FPL assets are really great picks - especially Kostas Tsimikas.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing the Podcast!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjY2OVJTbDZSczVqRVpGd0FjMjhuNTVVaUJXUXxBQ3Jtc0tsY2Z1WUZpOGR1Sm13cTZabGtlUnNYTTZldjN3TGlXbURwUWQ2b1kyZFF5eGttV3JXTERGZ3VEWW9jcncyQ0hfdkJ1WXN5MzJKX2RnQTBoWDdsMlBBTnhoLURYMTk4RE9IcXB2S3lta2dzSHhfQ21HNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=rsEi7eA3_zE"> </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjY2OVJTbDZSczVqRVpGd0FjMjhuNTVVaUJXUXxBQ3Jtc0tsY2Z1WUZpOGR1Sm13cTZabGtlUnNYTTZldjN3TGlXbURwUWQ2b1kyZFF5eGttV3JXTERGZ3VEWW9jcncyQ0hfdkJ1WXN5MzJKX2RnQTBoWDdsMlBBTnhoLURYMTk4RE9IcXB2S3lta2dzSHhfQ21HNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=rsEi7eA3_zE"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbS1jdmlIVW1EWERBWVp