<item>
  <title>S7 Ep11: SHOULD WE STICK WITH SPURS? - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2023/2024)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8392030</link>
  <itunes:episode>11</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>SHOULD WE STICK WITH SPURS? - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2023/2024)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>7</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8392030.mp3?modified=1698616932&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="84149220" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/40823423.png" />
  <itunes:duration>5239</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>With Spurs and Liverpool both winning again, Lee and Sam are in buoyant moods! But with Spurs' fixtures getting tough, should we stick with them? Brentford pull off a shock (?) win at Stamford Bridge and Villa win AGAIN at home. We look back at all the weekend's action and ahead to GW11.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHNCWlBadHNLVzZkLU9na1hLOGVxeVBtWUZpd3xBQ3Jtc0tuNEQ4WTJTOXlFSkNuaXJlTkpzX2JreTRjdGRwcGpzaWtzM1ZuN093U2NtUlNJV0FBb29EYXBIYm01aWxqQ1lVaktQYlpEMTFZdlNjOHJoa1pJOE5jUUlfd0pGTng1RDVXdmE5ZlpjN01hWnVYaENPZw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=rsEi7eA3_zE">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1R3ckxNZmppZHd6My02MFpsWkZvbUVzWXdCQXxBQ3Jtc0tuRGtwY1Ria3k3aFp1V3NZaWpEMVN5RmtoS2pnR0tWLUJ3R2hBQ3NwRHNPVlBZT0UzWDMyZkliY2lQTEhYRXdSUmp0M2otNTE4eXlocFFrSjVBemlLbXR4eGdLN0ZTOFJqQk05eEk4WGdMb2ZXcS11RQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.google.com%2Fyoutube%2Fan..&amp;v=rsEi7eA3_zE">https://support.google.com/youtube/an..</a>.<br>________________________<br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="https://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <b