<item>
  <title>S7 Ep10: SALAH BETTER THAN HAALAND IN FPL? - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2023/2024)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8388534</link>
  <itunes:episode>10</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>SALAH BETTER THAN HAALAND IN FPL? - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2023/2024)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>7</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8388534.mp3?modified=1698008063&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="76984621" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/40823423.png" />
  <itunes:duration>4792</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>With Haaland somewhat underwhelming and Mo Salah scoring yet another brace, is the FPL tide turning from the Norwegian back to the Egyptian King - particularly for captaincy?<br><br>We analyse all the weekend's action, albeit with Spurs v Fulham still to come on Monday night - and with yet another decent haul for Trippier, we discuss wether we should go there, even with a tough looking fixture list for Newcastle. Arsenal and Chelsea play out a 2-2 draw and United sneak past Sheffield United thanks to a worldie from their full-back - in a week where the football world pays tribute to one of the genuine all-time greats. RIP Sir Bobby Charlton.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes<br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjRpSEhvUVZDODdWYm5YTU9RemYxdElzOGJoZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttQkRpeEhXdXdfcnRpcVloaW9ZZ2V6VXhyTW5lTFJJOEZQdUdwcVhaTmZNTjFrQnk1Wkt1M01Sek5tMnFnOURaTnZ4QVpjUFdUcklVWVlyd01Iblp0RW9BRkY2MzVtMFNOdmNFTkZyR0t2NDUxZlV6RQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=wrGpwNcdfF8">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHNucVlXLW5tbHVRbXprejdUT25adGVpM0k5QXxBQ3Jtc0ttX3Q5bXg1WkN1TVB