  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Another weekend of trials and tribulations ends in Sam hitting the Wildcard button! We'll talk through her first draft and get her thoughts on who are the key picks going into GW8.<br><br>We'll also try to unpick all the talking points from the FPL Family Derby, with Spurs taking all three points against Liverpool. Haaland blanks against Wolves, should we take all our Man United assets out and just who is the Arsenal penalty taker??<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVN0NnRKbUFuUUI3WXBXekZPbmg5ZEVFU1gwUXxBQ3Jtc0ttaUlVUVNnX0xLMEFicWhkdUpIeGs2Q05jMEJIQnlpckd3d0p5T19CNS1FcFRQTFZQanQtZnphLXZoTTJfMmEzUzZhLXBHZGhCOTVJejlSSGRPcWVTLXdXYnpZaGZIcGlNczgwUzVxOGExQkdLZ3hkYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=agL616t1L6I">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmNvNHVBOFYwVU9CS3dHYlprR3FmaEVuR3UzZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttbmJIbllqek94bnhBZXU1MkREYmJDZ01qS0FpVmYwWkFaVDJ0czhHWWdJV0UzYXZwZlYxZ043Nl82OWlSV3RuV3pTSlJjSXAwLUxxUkRPUndiZDY2c09GXzRoM19sdGIxXzh6cEdfMy1iRXFaVkRDbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=agL616t1L6I">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>_________