  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee's wildcard was a roller-coaster of emotions in GW5, so we'll look back and what worked and what didn't. Was also look back at wins for Liverpool, Aston Villa and Newcastle - all high on the FPL radars for the coming weeks.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDdUX3B4bVNEcFZDcWNPeXFiNHIyVUNsenZsUXxBQ3Jtc0tuYjl0Q0FPVmcyT2xnM1JMQ3JnelhSaEU2LVhTSnhsWDdrRENILVdldkUwWmFzSHlqVzl4b016dHhiaGpJTWRxTlJHMkc3ZFpjMGh5NlAxenY5TzFIcnVJRVl6SlFiTm5MSjlmQXVWUjdaYXdCMDF4WQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=OzKpCC51PLk">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbU5idUFfbU5QUDZSaE1PaEd4dEpYdjY2dTE1Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsMFhkOU5ndl95Zk4zR002aXpjY0Ruc2RPUVR0OUloU3l0RlVTcEIxc1BQQTNqZXpzM3RQRkp2a1ExaU16Z2RXbFlUQXp6RUpyNFByQVR2aFd3YTVrWHJhZnQ3QnlmYWFVbGEyeEgwYUVfT1dnUlhiVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=OzKpCC51PLk">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXhBWDVmeS1VOFVu