<item>
  <title>S7 Ep6: Chelsea and Man United OUT, Spurs IN? GW5 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2023/2024)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8361601</link>
  <itunes:episode>6</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>Chelsea and Man United OUT, Spurs IN? GW5 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2023/2024)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>7</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8361601.mp3?modified=1693774171&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="69841928" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/40823423.png" />
  <itunes:duration>4345</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>With wins for Liverpool and Spurs, Lee and Sam are in a collectively great mood after GW4. Hat-Tricks for Haaland, Son and Brighton's teenage superstar Evan Ferguson, were backed up with plenty of eye-catching FPL performances. Szoboszlai and Nunez come in clutch for Liverpool,  Bryan Mbeumo scores AGAIN and Arsenal nick it at the death. Rice, Rice Baby!<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0VpcmxOZm9LdlZfZm9Hd2J3TTRzMzkwZ0JBZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttZlJMSXNJUlJoUk9GanFMcEY1NkpZUG5Db0tsYW9WcmF3WlIzaUdGYmpwUkQ4VnBSSElXYThBaGdmbFQ4ZDlBd2dlcjZ0dGgxelZmYzV6SmcyeEMzYkNrY1NOTjBkN1Q5bEtNd2puZ0tENXFfS2Zocw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=U03BfArARPQ">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2V2RGZJVER2cTFvaGRMaG53WmIxc211Wjlnd3xBQ3Jtc0tsU1BIWDRKNkxjRFZPTmlaNVF2YXBzQWswT3JaTlpwV2ZlaFVUSUpGQUV2YkFsRFNvZGJtSlp2czczZEl4X1prdDdwaDd0SjVXaGlYbzZncUNkWURqMFd1MGI5dTdGVmVmU3NVXzlWMENVTUcyR0NTUQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=U03BfArARPQ">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCH