  <description><![CDATA[<div>Please vote for us in the Football Content Awards! <br>Vote now! 😊👉 <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbm1WWnpyeXFMdjBsdWxzdGdWcDVCR2JxaDN2QXxBQ3Jtc0ttcjg2VEhCLXh1ZDgwSlN1MHhLVEVBRkhfNzRvcG5naXNRU0NRSG1WSms4NGw0aWl2bGhQVjE3QmNUZVZJSE8zcVRvelNyU1ZVODJVRmNhTWhJSFBhYl9ocEJoQ0d2dzlGcDFJUXFjM1lwYjlqRmpJYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffootballcontentawards.com%2Fvoting%2F&amp;v=N6a0fnU_2cM">https://footballcontentawards.com/vot...</a><br><br>📍Head to ‘Best in Fantasy Football’<br>📍Find the ‘Video’ category <br>📍Type ‘FPL Family’<br>📍Hit Vote!<br><br>**********<br><br>After some unexpected results in GW3, Lee and Sam look ahead to GW4, with Spurs and Chelsea both on the radar - particularly in those midfields. Could a Wildcard be looming - particularly for those with only one transfer? And just what did West Ham get so right against Brighton?<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjRwZGhjOFhhTDBrVEF1VEpRcFduaGJQY0RLQXxBQ3Jtc0trOVljakp0Q3pHbUpTTk5GR3ZoWjE0TkN0VjAtVXZqN3N2ZVhiQXl5eDZzVXpVRTJ3X1VZYnVuRzFSeWxTTDhtdkZKSXpDMTE2Z1dyOEVhLXl2QWJBb2ZjN2h3NDVyTTBSNVRvTnoxRHZvZGVOMlJ5MA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=N6a0fnU_2cM">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by