  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>With two free transfers going into GW3, I'm considering using one of them to sell Mo Salah! I'll discuss who might be coming in as his replacement and what I'll be doing with the resulting windfall of cash in the bank!<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing the Podcast!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa09LYlV1TXRxTXNEdEFJbndZdl9KdVYzSEE1d3xBQ3Jtc0tuQ0VCQWFMQ1V2RlExa1dKeWVRWE5yU3plc2F5WFBEVEo1V2VFVy15X1UwWFdrY2FpQ2ZhV2JsaEUtUzNJMmJRazhVQVlsblBPcHlYUVBoN1l5OUtBZTQzbW1TQVVMcWJZZHVPdTJTbXl3VWxxTVhNZw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=mk4PCuVtqo8">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnRBMzBDbnBob2x2Z1ZMVG1EZUZmTVQ3R1hVQXxBQ3Jtc0tsSTc4U29hMkQxTjJNX2F0bXRZbWVtbmlZbUFrYlVwMml4RXNVdUY1bUVlaEc3WnNBQVozWU0xS09sdGs3T29MQmNRLURkdkdRZDg2Uk1sNEJrcm5Sa1UxTlROT1BDRmhWVUZqTDdHMUxMZTBoam4wNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=mk4PCuVtqo8">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0dMTWtxdFpzWFZGS2hIUlg