  <description><![CDATA[<div>Moises Caicedo is worth the money and makes Chelsea title contenders. It's a big statement, but I explain why in this latest voice note and the impact he will have on Enzo Fernandez, Nicolas Jackson and Ben Chilwell.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our content!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblp5OUlwbUw5WTVpcG81a3Zla1d6ZWFHZm5Hd3xBQ3Jtc0tuWEdKVXVfaV9rWjNXdzJLa1VJdGJRODBsRkg3dTJMeXhNak5ndl9pX09fS0FkM2NQejF2N3hYbnNjRUxKRHJhbmVUZ2ZKV1FHbV9rNFdyRS1zaG45cGZQblVac2lYUHNOU0hnbVJTRzFyT2lobVRRbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=mk4PCuVtqo8">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnFycXBrSDJFZDdEU3E5QjFqb000YW9SZFlTQXxBQ3Jtc0tubjBtWWlCajRzRlE0TFRXTzVuQVhuWm1saTdDdHlyNUdhZDh3TktuNDZXLUYwOEZGYmxjS0Z3U1FDSTV1LXBTaG5NSE5zcHprbDJ4MDJ4ZWxpSHQ4eTZJcUNNU2poeGcxY2RDcUJwS0dBQkx3LUJ1Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=mk4PCuVtqo8">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWNWcFlLaEF2eWRkUnpBbUZFc