  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>So after a long summer of FPL draft-making, GW1 is in the books - all bar the Monday night game between Man Utd and Wolves. Lee and Sam look back at all the action and discuss which teams and players stood out - and who we might want to bring onto our teams for GW2.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEN2UnZRVFhHc3FJSHVYUS1wR0RJSDhuS2FWUXxBQ3Jtc0tuNEVYNnpLNzJCNFZWeWg0T3l5VGR1ZkNOX1VwYm80TXVxWXUtU3RSR29VSXNwc2gtLXh5VjBmRlo4NUkxdm5kZ3lNdXZOUGpCS1F5NTVxRHVoM21ETkRwTVdYNm1tTzd6Mld4SUkzdHBnVHF5c2M3TQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=mk4PCuVtqo8">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDFfeDhLWVdOQ183X2pSUHo1cy1GUUhDVmozZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsOUh1VnZkVTJlOHpDVzJKXzcyZ1Jhd0pTWjZTWDhWcVRqWklheWptZ1VjeWdWTlNhUmtVUnJCQ0FfTHlhbjY1RnJaem5hSGs2S3dOa3ZoUmdZTnZVbElsRmpGM1dkSWcyaFpMc0VGdWl0V3RRMW1Obw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=mk4PCuVtqo8">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&