  <description><![CDATA[<div>Saka or Martinelli? Rashford or Bruno? Mo Salah or No Salah? The time for talking and drafting is over, Lee and Sam attempt to lock-in their teams ahead of next Friday's GW1 deadline - with Lee in particular trying an interesting 'money-in-the-bank' strategy.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbW1IQlczR0lGZ3pMVk83MG1GSFNFdHhKTC1mUXxBQ3Jtc0tsalZyQ2JZVDNsNlJ2VzM0cFd0YkVFRGg1NGtQdUkxU3NWUnVLV193eHRXeUd1UjBWNUdfR2xna2k4dDU1UWowUVpmdC0xWFB6RHdJbER5WXRvNlB1SlluMURrQ3VsNS1LSzlFQmttTHdFdmtqQTh6dw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=ZMQHmf4Tx4w">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblhETlRDNjBkcWRWbHVvdXpCeGllWlFpRVo0Z3xBQ3Jtc0tuYWJHUmJLcXVaNkY1anVKd1FxWnNva3NJdklpeURsYVJ1YjVyMTgycXZ5dlRUZU5MaTNIanhfWFdKTTNzUjFURFBpS25ZakljR3BKNGpBZkxoaWdLSDhhajFwendHOVBTalZHRHFlbzVjajNGclVWbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=ZMQHmf4Tx4w">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;red