  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>GW1 edges ever closer and we have a lot more information now about incoming transfers, pre-season friendlies and some crazy-good value FPL assets.<br><br>Lee and Sam ask whether anyone can truly be locked in at this stage though and discuss what we've learnt so far in pre-season.<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUlnMTE0eWxmUmNXQlhVMFMtT1dqMldiTWhMQXxBQ3Jtc0ttUS1KV2E3eDZwaXVZNk5aQUt4VGZPYTBrUGp2NVJHbW1rSFI2T3lLMDlfRnRPeFdrY1g0NXVUT3h6dWw2WHRUQmUxWnFGN2FQb1VJNXM5SXh5WHA2TzFqQzdydTl1Z1VFS2VkakdfRVlfQk9iUDZGdw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=WINF8NUf_Yo">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUpXeXlEVkZmQnhVeWl4YmdwdG1vaHpkd3JUUXxBQ3Jtc0trNEFfLVNCZHZaWGVHOGdlUEJKX2kxdFhPcHJWSmZkUGp1a0J3QlgxMU9qNmt5ZUtuclpsNzlObXJIa184bUZ2UXRMVmlrSWY2el81TTFzdHRGT0U4UDluODkwUHBabTNLWWN2dWVxZzNYU0kwTEpDcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=WINF8NUf_Yo">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=vide