  <description><![CDATA[<div>FPL is BACK and so are we for our SEVENTH season! It's currently 5-1 to Sam in terms of seasons won since FPL Family started, so how should Lee adapt his game to finally get another score on the board? We'll also look at both Lee and Sam's first drafts, who the key players are - and is anyone nailed on for a GW1 starting place (other than a certain Norwegian?)...<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>lhszjd<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/fplfamily"> / fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHl5UzJacUloUmt2TW56ZFM0UkRGanN6RlBYd3xBQ3Jtc0ttWGEwR3hsX19EQl90aDlaUHUxQXpqekZNTTUwalZTOWpsUlRSa0dMTTdSMlJvcWw1cVpLcThjQkpWVXlxNE5NOWtBVGpNdzNOcHJxMlppdUdselFYbmxxbmJYNTFOeDBrZHJFVlBfWngwSnFvRWtXMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=0TEyNNL_nbc">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0paZkhVU0xPY2hmRnRRZklUN0hITG4yRkVzQXxBQ3Jtc0tteFpLU2IwajQ4aDZaNnhJVnN1NFg2NndmZkl1b2lQTUwwa0tLa1B2NlJiRXRLWHFkdk0wOHh5TjJZNVc4V0NIMVRQNFFEejVqVkJVVThJY09pUDRwNGNWS3h0UnZDRUpfS0Z3cVlMNWpmSmptVGN0Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=0TEyNNL_nbc">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send 