<item>
  <title>S6 Ep35: Who Won? Lee or Sam? Final Overall Ranks - GW38 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8308367</link>
  <itunes:episode>35</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>Who Won? Lee or Sam? Final Overall Ranks - GW38 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>6</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8308367.mp3?modified=1685305493&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="46585983" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/40082066/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>2908</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Well done to all of you for making it to the end, the finale, of another brilliant FPL season! We find out whether Sam keeps the Wooden Spoon trophy for another year, or does it find it's way back to it's natural home on Lee's mantlepiece.<br><br>We also reveal our GW1 predictions. Who did we think would win the Golden Boot, who would be the highest scoring FPL midfielder. It's all revealed LIVE on tonight's FPL Family!<br><br>A massive THANK YOU for all your support this year watching, liking and sharing our videos!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblFWOWN5OUhEQW1fOWtuUldTZnQxWWN0TTYzd3xBQ3Jtc0tsTnMtTGtyUTVYMG5nVlF1TUExSkZpbmdtVDI3R1dyRnNpcy0zOGFwTWViYmZfNmx1REdOVnN2SmJRN25FVXlBZW9sQmNUSktiQnBrVHRHRkJUbk1PU2pzM2tDRm9UY2hfN1MwcWdjc2kzZkhhaWNpZw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=Mip_TsVQ9F8">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2wtNFpqQlN5NThmeEFBRkRIU0pBS1UwOV8tZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttTERXdXR2NVRYNDV2d3dQTTU5SEI2R3dsVHRJbGRFSlBrNVF5dGd5SGRZTlJQTzdScTZlMjVwSTloUUI4bTRmN1d2cVdfeXg1QzVBWHRlTEdaMk5oaC1YbXZPd3dzLUpPTkNtdGR5N1JSUzFiZWplcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=Mip_TsVQ9F8">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 1