  <description><![CDATA[<div>With just the United game to go in GW37, it could not be closer going into the finale! It's likely that Lee and Sam will be less than 5 points apart going into GW38, so a goal here or a bonus point there could make all the difference! Find out who Lee's eyeing up as a differential in midfield...<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbklZZ3FVTEh3LXJ3dXExZHJXV1pETjQ2cVhjUXxBQ3Jtc0ttdGV3alRRc3lqNjhyUGJ3aUstbmhLM211ODhxeGdkMWIwWVlLTmZiT1l1TThxMHNQUWNLVUZIbVBEdm9hd0RYbGNZS2JDdkdwZ1l0Q3M3UHhJSlZoUmlUU1pxUm9icnBGdmY2eUtERnZqWEppNUFuUQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=fq4LpPU66dA">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0tjLVI5LTZjVG9HQkk0emZSSWtzM0ktNzU0QXxBQ3Jtc0tuY1BIWk8xYUJYdzdBZy1vZEhpYzFHZ0wwR0ZmNFRmMm9sWHBVRFRCT1Z6N0JscGFBeHJoeVJPSmxXdEFYTjdMVFppZzMydnNMNFp1ZWRXODF2M0lycTE0bjE2bHpmaTBPMTdVQjEySEE0cWRLNXdlVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=fq4LpPU66dA">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect