<item>
  <title>S6 Ep34: THE FINALE! - #TeamSam or #TeamLee FTW? - GW38 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8304498</link>
  <itunes:episode>34</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>THE FINALE! - #TeamSam or #TeamLee FTW? - GW38 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>6</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8304498.mp3?modified=1684701949&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="65907096" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/40082066/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>4116</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>GW38 is here! Without even kicking a ball in GW37, Man City are crowned Premier League Champions. And with a draw at Anfield, things are looking good for Newcastle and Man United for the Top 4. So ahead of GW38, should we focus on those that have got something to play for? How badly do Aston Villa want that European spot? Can Leicester or Leeds survive? We look at what's left to play for and discuss the FPL assets from those teams.<br><br>It's also very close between Lee and Sam for this season's FPL Family household bragging rights - we look at who's going to make the difference in their teams!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHQ5bk5yXzJNUHZUNElMbFVLUmlQd3JNQks5QXxBQ3Jtc0trcUNkYmdWS2tSVzl5enM5bk9Cdk5aX2xOR1pFbm55dkRmZFBoVEFZNWJTQXBfQTZyc1hRMTBIcGdmcVN3Mml0UnFQM3dxMUkzblQ3cWd3SkRHaUswblF4cW16Z0N3aHhkM2FncWVfWXFiLVhXalVPNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=fq4LpPU66dA">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnQ0SGktbThKSHo2cUFhRXdYSHNTLVlnSDhFUXxBQ3Jtc0ttT3VtX0JjV0FZTkloVUV5TE12aXZEc0ZmcGRaVEpDeW91ZlZQTF94YkZGNUhRM3FaYVc0Sm9DTHFjTWlwWXFSRUZqMFI2bmZMWkZ6OEotVzVvZWVWMlMtc0RiaWNEZG1VRGdSb3ZQWVdFei1lMHRCSQ&amp;q=