  <description><![CDATA[<div>The last big double game week is here! Could GW37 be the last chance to make up ground on your mini-league rivals? If you're chasing, there no point sticking to the template, so Lee and Sam will talk through a few of the differentials punts and talk captaincy ahead of the penultimate GW of the season. <br><br>Its also hotting up in the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/teamlee">#TeamLee</a> vs <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/teamsam">#TeamSam</a> battle, with Wilson Captain coming in clutch for Sam!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbV91THhDR0hKSk5LVnp3TWFaemwtVHIxc2ZFd3xBQ3Jtc0trRlVXY0xGWmlZQlZJbU5ESlF4dzhkdWtodldjcHh2UWNXVFdvc25XNTNYcnNWbS1rVDlOeU9SSnN4RnpJSExHYkpBUkdlZUV2NkVCTTVHeGU0ZVNGNGtuMUFPQ1pTa08xUkxkZ2ZTX1JfeHYyYTczNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=vxl3uy4U89A">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWtJbl9RRno0c3I2eFk2X2lVSVZHbHM3Ql9VUXxBQ3Jtc0tuYWpWV0p2ZGlNclFSbGR5bXd3VlpnMm5zaXBfYXNyYms4dUNiMmZfLU5pWHNkSndlZUx2dHZ4ZlJZclpURkNhUFdyMDU4Vk0wY3ZsUVJmVXpLQXZZb0JmWThQQ0xIU1Jrai1TeFpCeDJGaGdvQ0xQMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=vxl3uy4U89A">https://kickingtheballss.