  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Sam goes through some of the detail around the Newcastle FPL assets for this week. She's got two free transfers in her pocket and tight now, only has Trippier, so she reveals how she's going to invest.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3pUeFEtNGIycHhpN2g5a3ZSR0JQOTRzOVo3d3xBQ3Jtc0trVXlnXzByOHk2S1VLUFJYd0dkNU1tWVl2YkdBS2FGc3lQM2dURWVXUGtuc21rREdEakFfelE5Um11dno1VFA0WWM0UGwyX0o4aFh3dHVHZUxTQzhFcm00QU41cVhadEJpelF1NDBSY3hzaTY4RGhtZw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=UWP1glrx-Zc">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazZWYm4xaHQ1UWotTGxLbE5pcDhEbFlyeVhod3xBQ3Jtc0tseVdjM0xsMFNTV3VOSl8zVnc3a21nS19fZ3VpNkFlMTVBeXVOWGdsUWtUaG40dl9XMC1vTEVZRUhfcWlobGF0b2xWRExnREdFcXpxUDlVM0tXVDlGcmhXbnpHVEVscExIUzJTZjlZTEtSSndEcVRscw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=UWP1glrx-Zc">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDkzQ25fTDlpeFBScjBYdXhhejJYMVY3dXpmQXxBQ3Jtc0