  <description><![CDATA[<div>Only three GWs to go, but plenty of football to be played - not least in GW36, where both Newcastle and Brighton have a DGW and both with plenty to play for, as they set their sights on European football next term.<br><br>It's hotting up between <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/teamlee">#TeamLee</a> and <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/teamsam">#TeamSam</a> too! Who'll take home the fabled wooden spoon trophy this season? - and Sam has a couple of differentials in mind to close the gap.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWZ5c0RDdjlWOUJrYmEyQy1FQW4xcEtnV0FlUXxBQ3Jtc0tsNEhEVjVfcjFBMlFrSlc2VHZsbi1XZFhBWDhJb0Y2ejF6WFBXOUZTM2VqZVBUQW5aQlB0REc2b0tCSXIzN1dBek5SNFJGVC1DUjRKc0VkdHB5VDFjNGpmNEdjc0RCQVhsZDExS0pUbS1DN0FmTF94QQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=UWP1glrx-Zc">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnRVY0NzVDZ0ejl5TUFZRHdveHhDZC1oYVBxd3xBQ3Jtc0tuX3RiaDRyN2RlVWV4QTU0aTBXUmUwODlkVVBmbWNfblJOb0tqVHYzd3hxUVd2M3gtSGJ0WmdDSE5jMjN4OW55eWR2cVVqNWxSVjV3OWQxQTZhMk1aT2Q0NGRpR0JqMWRWdE9QcGhPNzhhNkZmY29URQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=UWP1glrx-Zc">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Us