  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>With many FPL teams stacked up on Brighton, Man United, Newcastle, Liverpool etc, it's difficult to know where to go outside of the 'template' for those differentials that will make difference in your mini-leagues for GW35-38.<br><br>Lee shares a couple of quick thoughts on teams and players to target, with one in particular showing good form recently, with good fixtures ahead...<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmt6emhmY0gxbWktZkFrbjh4Vjh2SWViLWFBQXxBQ3Jtc0trcU1DQ3Z1dmZpTkF4alVpY0FoamljdEp6ek41VFExSDJtTW5NWW1HZWRmUHBHckgxbkItdGhRN2RkTFFSbVFfZ3ctbXl1aHk5dGlUY052S3hHVlEzZDR3ZThUYURGZlNtZUpKNGdveDhJM0I0Q1hHZw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=YpoEYjYo7E8">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTVibkk1U2VCOFVBczZZc2RFZzd5M29RWS1zZ3xBQ3Jtc0tudm0teTNkMTJUZHNXTnZhYVJ4ZWlIbmtmUkF5ZlMyQ0JjOFQyTnVsYkhvajJGQ2NWSkpaVndrNXB2b1plaWlJaWlYOWFPakpnb0JCbG5jQ1NQU2VtLURDZGRadm9mb0RYUWhWbm1rcGVPRlI1T1V2RQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=YpoEYjYo7E8">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the ch