  <description><![CDATA[<div>With GW32 in the books, we'll see whether Lee and Sam's scores were Free Hits or Free Misses. Then, take a deep breath, because we're diving straight into GW33, a mid-week kick-off, where we've got arguably;y the most important game of the season so far at The Etihad - but what should we do with our FPL assets from Arsenal and Man City?<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1pfRGx4Z3hVM1pfdkFPcERMUzIzZDMyME9KQXxBQ3Jtc0ttUWk3SXhUcXJmcWNOZk5tclJhYjVSM1pKbldpOU9yd3J3cG15TmxRc2M4aXlxSjJoc2h1M3NHZVFkcE9TVGRQMTd4SHZUQnZlZUkyQWljMHFQazFOM014ai16LW11SnAyWlhhbVJpMzd1ZnNIdU50bw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=aPuG-t1sDVE">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDZJY3RoVTgyZGtqOU9xdlUzVVNPNHh1aGZRd3xBQ3Jtc0ttOU5QMERma3dMWTB4WTBHVGtsVkRaVHJOV1NqOEFsUUZVeFdpSkNyaEV3eTNzaTFfeEp3UkdWWWFkc1dfV2pud3lFTW4tUTZ3Z0FEd0dybmRZVjNXc1BRRmZZMml3TVA0VWk1RFBISVk3VnlLREJwdw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=aPuG-t1sDVE">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: