<item>
  <title>S6 Ep28: BEST FPL PLAYERS TO BUY AHEAD OF GW31 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8277976</link>
  <itunes:episode>28</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>BEST FPL PLAYERS TO BUY AHEAD OF GW31 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>6</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8277976.mp3?modified=1681072354&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="54976520" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/40082066/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>3433</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Sam and Lee look ahead to GW31, with a keen eye on the future schedule, with both blank GW32 and double GW 34 on the immediate horizon - and we'll see how Sam's Wildcard panned out this weekend. Was she right to hit the button?<br><br>If DGW29 was the storm, GW30 was the calm that ensued afterwards - but with clean sheets at a bit of a premium it was down to the forwards to shine. New favourite Ollie Watkins scores AGAIN, while old favourites Harry Kane and Erling Haaland also get amongst the goals.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUxiNVNqSDlCdjI0YlE3SlJQOVByQ2h3bE5DUXxBQ3Jtc0tuZWplb2N0NW1MLWg4N0xzVmh4UmpYZEdoaFJYNXdyLWZ4SjRUd0RkR3FVTVgtb0lDYkNEU0JBR1FUaXYtRGZqTjBwVlhsN1Vvc2phaG90WlFKR01WZnVZNkpKTTA1ZHZZRGpwVFREY3NDeGhuNXpUQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=DrqR42SgUg0">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2V5eW93NWtndndvWm5ta2FJNGp4Vm41UGxFQXxBQ3Jtc0ttWW9GLXpwdG9RamROVF8xSVVqNGQtdkpWbXNBRHlTMmxBUmQ5cmJTTFNESnptLVNCSGhkYzRvajFrbnItX3F4ZEE1ek1sT2V3SmhwTEFpSEpBNjBFam9UVTVucUVIUjAzRTZlWUJOc2NVbHloYm9TRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=DrqR42SgUg0">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use '