  <description><![CDATA[<div>After a slightly below par GW29, Sam's fighting back with her Wildcard in GW30. She'll run through her draft, key differentials and plan for the doubles/blanks ahead.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2o3U21Yb3ZDeUkwOXRvaGl5N3RWMDhWQXc5d3xBQ3Jtc0tsNm9PN2JVaDVTSFliWlNCWlEzMnZmdC1wdzljd0F1Zzk0NXB1OUg1cjR4ajQ3U19pbG01R2FUU1hrczJ4RWR3YkltVGNvUmlITC1KaktEeE1Nb1JCWlptd29xV2lnbU5aT0RpVHliVnY5c29nNEw5QQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=dOOZVauzwKM">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2ZVU2w4QUJmR3MxdmpCanZnNkhqWjNmNmpvd3xBQ3Jtc0trckNMdmQ3bXQ5cFpZMm1yQWpDdjBjcEgzbG42dV9TSzR5QmMyeU9nZXV5Vjd1WXhteUEzam9SRm4yUWZGWGNtWTREUlAwazRjSXpvX3FUOGc0bHpRWU9ZMzZxZDhPYW5tVExfTGhONzBGejR0WEFjdw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=dOOZVauzwKM">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmhhTWNJQ25LUkpVaTR6aDVTQmlZd080NVVqZ3xBQ3Jtc0trRTFqYmRmclE2WW1JN1B2UWctYk4yV0hBb