<item>
  <title>GW30 Voice Note: Going back in on Man City...?</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8276523</link>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8276523.mp3?modified=1680770545&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="9023685" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/40082066/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>561</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>DGW29 is done and dusted - and it did not disappoint! A big green arrow for Lee means the pressure's on to back that up with a decent GW30. Lee talks through the Man City assets he's considering getting back on for the next few weeks.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFpxRWZidS1yUU1vSWd6T2JmTGtabFFXUzM5QXxBQ3Jtc0ttd3ZBelhiN1JSVjZqWkotaU1CQWJUV3V0WTJ2Mk8wbnpaZmxkTFBaRTlpWVkzUWhPdEhfQmhva1ZtYVJZckJwS2hhaDI0M1RYVzJMNFlNSElFTlFhODFLWDRWZ0dHcUpnUWJya2ZiaFRVUTlUVFJ3Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=dOOZVauzwKM">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHlUYlRBMjZLT0FuWGd2YzhSeVIzbndsWENhUXxBQ3Jtc0trZEdBdVNtYmh4UThScUFhelpPa1VicVUwZzc4dVNzS215SkZadDBlZk1CMkZEZ244NmFKM2Y0TnZhYzVrSklpcTE5MHFSb3ZjNjV4RmM0aU5KMFo1a0FGMmViRllSdjFDNm1GZVBRQ1lKVW8ySUx2RQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=dOOZVauzwKM">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3BmMUQ1SXB6T