  <title>S6 Ep27: SHOULD WE BUY HAALAND BACK IN FPL? - GW30 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8274319</link>
  <itunes:episode>27</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>SHOULD WE BUY HAALAND BACK IN FPL? - GW30 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</itunes:title>
