  <description><![CDATA[<div>With the big DGW29 still in play, we'll asses where we're at at 'half-time' and where we think DGW29 will be won and lost in the next bunch of games in midweek. We'll also start to look ahead at the next few GWs in FPL and who we should be looking at for GW30 and beyond into BGW32 and DGW34.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazF0ckZmeWZzampXUjdaWnhHTDhxUUE5cm5SZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttNFM3bDlxV054UkhoNzVRaU0xMGVqYW1BNUUxancwUXpiTWtkVzJtUzRjRVBBdTFDRDYwbHlpb3cxOUI2QklpT1NZcGJBLWJ2ZVNoUU55dzk5ck1HamZuN1FoMjdkMzRmSF82WmEwZzFDbVZUMEhMOA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=dOOZVauzwKM">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazBKU3NQZExDd2NHRm5DOEJLa3p0LTZVR0ZVZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuQXczZDM0OGlNLUF4UlBqNDk0YXpNRWZkWlpsanNiQjVxVGRYWW9yOWx2RVBfUS1HSUtZSmZQX2VLOFF3dmxRWGk5aFBxU00teGl1Q0l5YnZUT0Z0TU1fZmNFaTRiQXVqRlM5WkRwUEZfVUgyYjVTNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=dOOZVauzwKM">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?eve