<item>
  <title>Voice Note: Sam's take on Spurs</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8272697</link>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8272697.mp3?modified=1680179215&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="9215086" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/40082066/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>573</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>With Antonio Conte ranting his way out the door, what's next and who's next for Spurs? Sam gives her view on the current situation, whether Stellini and Ryan Mason can finish in the Top 4 and who she would like as next manager.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnR6ZF94LWdaemtFUU9nZ1BDN0xhOUJibVlFUXxBQ3Jtc0ttbks5LWhkOTdNZ2FOVXlCTjY1QlBoYXB5b18zX3hQY2dKbDV3a3VXemZleXc0RzFiTEt4ekxhT1FBZ1V1RFJLY0lLNXd4bTQ2cllrQUV5ZjRVOEYteHU3eXhNVzZzQ0NRYXZzNERTeG9naUpmaHJaQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=fsbMkz9ayCs">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTVqcWs5R2RrY3diel9wbl9GankwdGY1VFB6d3xBQ3Jtc0trY1RrNFNGWEw0ek9NZ3V2azlsV3N2cEQ3S1lxb2RJelZRcjBEeXFiRGNSZ1JjVi1qSVR4Y0RSdV8weDl1RENaN0xocmRJbnNELXB6ZDRUbkhyNTBjcGE0VTdHUlpkbE9tWnFreHJuSVh1UVU3RjdhZw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=fsbMkz9ayCs">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFBJQS1tbDE1a0pST2ct