  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lots of good captaincy choices this Gameweek, but in this next voice note, Lee narrows it down to two options in his team - but neither is Salah, Nunez and the Liverpool assets - could that be a mistake? <br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFF4VVNiTzRHRERNQzlLS0lfclRyZzRDUkdXZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuZ2kyVzFxaEt2dHB5ZlVOTWRRZ2U3M0hjY3JpQ3o3aHR6NkZBbVpZTWtRc3ByMVVqMTZHcndENmcza0pZM3NHMTMyV3FWOWZJVWh4TFE3UW9TRURxMlc3TkpxLTJjV19KQ3h6NVdxa3YtS1ViNVYtUQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=fsbMkz9ayCs">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2REV2syYmVJbmNFNnFrX2NpaXZBNUpaOGpGd3xBQ3Jtc0tsRmxPekRIaU0yQUttYW5sbWt2TWtmbEdyZkZlUkdSMHNpd3phdXRrdHhwcnBfc2stMkpMcXZFb3RaSTJSTjVJUXEzSHBIOENqSEx5cXRZdG1XSUY5TlR1SENNc1JOT1dKWnNDRjBqb0FHR095RG9IZw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=fsbMkz9ayCs">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjZUdkhHMjJRLThDMjZCM2U1RFFKUXRRQ3kwZ3xBQ3J