  <description><![CDATA[<div>The BIG Double Gameweek 29 is almost upon us. Lee takes a look at how his team is shaping up, playing the Bench Boost chip and thoughts on where to spend his single free transfer this week.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbU9EMXExTEM1YnBpVXNvbEZEOVdNdzd3YTVId3xBQ3Jtc0tscUd0YkxRa1J3QUlROHZhZGRLTzFkV3Mwcmxzby1DaDBwQXU2MDl1MjU5TUV6OW5TVXRoX1Y2bU56cjR3MGZmWl9kbXpPVmxCYms2ZmJvQThWMXBLWE5iYW5tR2JoOG1odjZHdEtSUTJhOGFqbElIQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=fsbMkz9ayCs">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnJhaWh2Sk1ZUGNrN0ROR3d5WjFSQ0dJWjd3d3xBQ3Jtc0trZlE2aUdnTU1TRlVIcGEwNy03VXNRdVc2T0pXZzZUQjUyM1pwNmJlX0ttQUk0SThlMXp4dzk3QnlBNmlfbEhaSHpFdVFPb0wteHBBa1c0cFZDU05adHZlZ1pRSEJJNHlNSDVVZHIySUpNME9ERjAxOA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=fsbMkz9ayCs">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkkzWnZ0Q3dWSWdfTWNiMUZsMGNJTXBDUVlKQXxBQ3Jtc0tuWWJwQnlHXz