  <description><![CDATA[<div>Can't believe I'm saying this, but I'm pretty set on selling Erling Haaland this week - but the question is, who comes in? I'll look at Havertz v Felix v Watkins as the Norwegian's replacement and tell you who I'm currently leaning towards.<br><br>Thanks for listening! Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFE3OTJqekdqam51RlkweGFRR0JhNmJWeGJvUXxBQ3Jtc0tsRjEzZzZ6QjVpVmZlbjNUWUoxM1NGMVRGZFFIVlNtNDVuTnc3MzFKZ3NBX3Jqa05rdGlNMnpwNElKS1I1V1ExZFpld3Zsa0Z6UlViajNraFlLamstYmRzNFZLTUdLX0VYQ3BEYjBxLTNkU0lLSTQtVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=fsbMkz9ayCs">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTVab0g2VDkzRWhFbHRaMjNSTTB2eHpucFQ1QXxBQ3Jtc0tuVkh1U0lsTTI4VVRzSWhMLTJEQUtKN0p6VzZaaVNQVld4Vm84VC1TQzJ2VGxtaVMwTjBTQkIta2Z0RExRTk9HLUFCdzJXQmptenRULXJQTGw4dzFlcURkQTBkbjUzY3dXY3JTLWpzOXYxa2kxUWMwTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=fsbMkz9ayCs">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_