  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>As we approach the difficult Blank GW 28, we check in on Sam and Lee's teams - with Sam currently on ANOTHER green arrow, as she continues to storm the overall rankings. Lee reflects on another bad away day for Liverpool, Arsenal put Fulham comfortably to the sword and Solly March owners get very unlucky AGAIN.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblM5bWkxbE5tbDI3MHFxS0daVDBTTktGcjUxd3xBQ3Jtc0trazVSb2w5eGdCN3F4R01mbEJCaGNKel9lVDY4ZExUNV9JYXZyN2Nwel9EUUxELTdTTkdoQnk4c3FZWnoxUlhaRDBiZnNRQ2FiTmV0V29JSExUQ1J5RXM5bFRPbEwtMFlNMG5obTkxM3M2QUdpRzlSWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=fsbMkz9ayCs">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDM3c3dGOFY1TjFsbVRyUlBibXU5cnJTcm54Z3xBQ3Jtc0ttN2R0eGQyTmZDdnJ6MzYyVWpDYzU1TnA1WFp4Q2ZkVHFjbFNmcnBlbGlVUHNFSTdTSnNlWTdlYjFtdHZTWW5Ga01xeTh0UXFjeDBiaGQxbW5ud2t3ck00ZGpSaE5LenF2YkV1OVdMdDltOXRLVnh0aw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=fsbMkz9ayCs">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.yout