  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee gives a quick opinion piece on why key players returning from injury has seen the tide turn for Jurgen Klopp’s Liverpool and should we now be looking to invest again in FPL?<br><br>Hit <strong>Subscribe</strong> and look out for more FPL Family Voice Notes throughout the week!<br><br>_________________________         <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblU4R3J2b0VFbEZnNGRjcEhPZ01qLThrZVhQUXxBQ3Jtc0tsWEtvNlFrdFBnYVZfRUZ4YnZzZVYwcWxQWEFoZzhIMTRsN3JsR1oxNXowaUJEbVk1c3NmRjdqbThQbThfMzh4VE1HamREZnFlRm9JMi1hQmdJUF94QUt4aHF3blNQS3VUUXdYUDgtQm4wNDZieXA3WQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=XakCRyfcs9k">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDVDNU5yVzVMS2R1WHU5c1ZvVlRDLW1DanlIQXxBQ3Jtc0tuOGsyekd4dWN2akR2WG43QVQ4WHNxckxGNlZ4cTdubzNvbkx3a1pZSkRhVHBIdnV4ZlVFSlp6eHA5bXNiWHBRUUlZZVBBTWt1dVBzcnI4QXFIM1RmRVdZci1lN1lhbzlaUjYyWlJaVml5bVU5TXVnTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=XakCRyfcs9k">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>________________________<br>📺 Subscribe on YouTube! <a href="https://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br><br>🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter, Instagram and TikTok! - Just search 'fplfamily'<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnQ0eHF3aFhRdXVjeF9RSG45VllZOFVVWXFmd3xBQ3Jtc0tsZ2FpaHZ2MFQxUElIUllRWllHcmlzdFVUVUk3WXY1ajVVVEM2eVJoM2dodjN3WkJoMm1SWXVyZ0lsR1MxZFVORFRzLTBTSVdfQ0NvLUZnU