  <title>S6 Ep25: LIVERPOOL (AND LEE!) IN SEVENTH HEAVEN! - GW27 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8258174</link>
  <itunes:episode>25</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>LIVERPOOL (AND LEE!) IN SEVENTH HEAVEN! - GW27 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>6</itunes:season>
