  <description><![CDATA[<div>It's Double Gameweek time again in GW27, with Brentford, Brighton, Palace and Southampton all playing twice. We'll look back at GW26 and find out how Lee's Wildcard went and ask when Sam plans to play hers. It also looks like captaincy for GW27 is going to be an interesting discussion with single GWers like Kane, Haaland and Rashford all facing decent-looking fixtures, alongside the doublers.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbm1tZVNvRTFMS1FvRFVmLU1OTjJyczRxdjJZQXxBQ3Jtc0trWjRIZWRDSEY2Z3pNRmhZTm4zMVY3SGo4bmlPSHZyS3p3d29nUXdwaWc4TkVIQ3UyU01jTWhtQXFjSVhjVFJKTDFldkhJSnhRUldCX2thLUpYVDhnLWRhRGE5NVFrbGtQUUxTa29KdEJzREVNRjRTWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=4yQAiTZlyU0">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVM4bTR3dGJ1cUJ2OXRrU0haMl9lY1FPa01xQXxBQ3Jtc0tuVEJYN3ZnNk9UNkNWdFY1UEhQaGthejJQTE9KeWQxUjA3LXlLMDVoc25wLXNrb0FaZlJYRzJ5WUluek5oX1pZU1ZwV0x5YjhvZEl1U3pCSDQtZVEyOV9xSzV0cE00bmpQSkN3Z2d2aklCOHhTNkI4TQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=4yQAiTZlyU0">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your 