  <description><![CDATA[<div>With a couple of games still to go in GW25, it's been a largely frustrating GW for FPL managers - with popular captains, Sara and Salah blanking (so far). Yet, as is often the case, the single GWers remind us that while our attention is elsewhere, the likes of Ollie Watkins and Harry Kane plunder the points.<br><br>We'll also look at our scores so far this week and how Lee and Sam are getting on in Overall Rank - with Sam sitting currently on her TENTH green arrow in a row!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWNOSUNaQjRzU1hIeW82VGtRU1BaWldmRC1OQXxBQ3Jtc0tudVpFUzBaYi1wRWUzUjZqeEY1STVwbWtVTlNFVkhkMndLNUxhb0hKSHZlWkZjM3NWWUMyMTZKTERCSU14ajNBZUxzRVZfVDcwYmV4V0lKMkJ6UWNzdEJFVlhrSVkzUURabEVzb013U3ZaT0lnendoSQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=Jc-DKlNzNME">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnNTeTl5MERxeDZaN2t2SFRSRWl4c2ItcFFCQXxBQ3Jtc0tuSUlkRU5hV3psdVdJZnpqODNvaW9XR2FoaGtIdmFzclA4RTBSQzJtX2RnTXQ0TVB2TU02QjJrUklFZnZiU1k0Z0pwbFF2b2JuazlQM3lQd2ViMmhBbzNIQmxoTTNpWlVQMW4tQzVqM3NrU0FFQ0JJVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=Jc-DKlNzNME">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all pr