<item>
  <title>GW25 Voice Notes: Help! Lee's Team in Crisis!</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8251518</link>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8251518.mp3?modified=1677063666&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="7761430" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/40082066/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>482</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>With the news that Pep is "unsure" as to whether Kevin De Bruyne will be fit for GW25, Lee's FPL team is thrown into full blown crisis! Even with 2 FTs, that's now SIX players either blanking or a doubt, meaning luxury transfers are off the menu and it's needs must to get as many out as possible for GW25.<br><br>Sam joins Lee on this Voice Note to give him some "friendly advice"... :)  <br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDIyekJMQ2lLc1FacjB2WTV1Vlo1cUVZSV94UXxBQ3Jtc0ttMktoWEFxbTJtYXIySjZ4Z1FISUlyOXhFODZIVnMwcGNHeF81VzhVZWUzVXZwX3hPTnNHNDI1NktTZ2JfRkc2R1o1MUtrNkhmMWZ6eDdWVGw3RzhXdEd0VXB5R1AtSGF5YW1ITjhSdXZnUHdmUHJ1dw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=pSxVQEo8D6U">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHJGVHp3TFJKdTN6UEpjSUU3ajVHUDg5RVpmd3xBQ3Jtc0tsYjYyQ1FvMmktRzY5cnBhZ24weWNMU0tULXpoT3VnWUV3MXJ3ZjNNZEhOTGViMFVwMGVzS0xfZm9Va2ZhVGJUdEE4VV9mblZ0Ynpic0V5Wm1YRmJjaEItX1JOUUNTeERoVWVtTnpCT3hMMFhXYTJTSQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=pSxVQEo8D6U">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in