  <description><![CDATA[<div>A 'standard' week of 10 straight Premier League fixtures comes to a close, with plenty of surprising results - and good ones at that for those battling relegation. Liverpool also find some form just in time for DGW25 and City drop points in the race to the title. Plus the FPLFamily TeamLee vs TeamSam battle takes another twist!<br><br>We'll also look at our teams, scores and overall ranks!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">  </a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join"> / @fplfamily  </a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDhuSW5PZk5OcHBjTUlTMEJQWk1ad3NGZU5OQXxBQ3Jtc0tuU3Y0eV9ocV9TNlh4bFpTQjhUeHMzcktndGdSUl8tU3Y0MEx4bTNXLTZkc0kxZGdvSkZ6WmZVbDBuRnZTc0p0V2ZxNVVmYlpkS0VFcVRoTU51ZUxzeWlWX3QtUnFlT3NDdnlKMDRyQjUwZU1ZRDJGaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=pSxVQEo8D6U">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmJZTzNnaFhvVWFLOTVXNlB3VVZXcnFMWmQ3UXxBQ3Jtc0tuVXhrenU0c092cnF2OWxmZkxYb2llNVdlVVJnY25TUzVpMGFpWmtnd0RrVGpkWHFwcUp5SmlHck42VVo1RzZ2bGpTWm0zWUt4WUd3V284cTFYZVFUWXVZbW9zWGFfUWhDRHFFVUNDcTh1elJxUDFWTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=pSxVQEo8D6U">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg