  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>The next few GWs in FPL will make or break a few FPL manager's seasons - with doubles and blanks galore! With chip strategy thrown into the mix as well, Sam looks at the medium-term fixture schedule, as she attempts to consolidate her position in the Top 100k and push to Top 10k.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0djMHd0anlUSWtJdllrNDZ5V204UW1zazNsUXxBQ3Jtc0ttNG5FNmhCRTliVmZvUWVieDFwX2daaS1vV1dqb1RoZU1lSWFaS2ZZZ2dJa1hYV0o0X1JsenZmaHFRczc3Wm9OU3V0ekdDU3B6ejdtTzdIcTI1bnpkcm5QSTl3dzRCdWNfSmFBbHQtRWxaVW5zMThOMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=_HBH2MkhiXA">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXpUcXZaTlJvZV9wRU15bG1rZlhoQ2Z0TUpJd3xBQ3Jtc0ttVmluS28zWGdHTU96VWRIdWJjT3d4ZzNuVHpkdzc1czM0YWVKTXREOUU5cnBoV0JUTFlnejVJTDNoWm1kbkRRUWl0WmlHeFVPdnh1dWgwYmNrZnR4cXllTjQzZjZPa0w0SF9iVEVHVmJsMEJVVHFoQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=_HBH2MkhiXA">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEV0UXh3YVB4amQzeUVk