  <description><![CDATA[<div>A pretty under-whelming GW23 might just prove to be the calm before the storm. With FPL points at a bit of a premium, we look ahead now to a turbulent few weeks of blanks and doubles. We'll look back at the weekend's action and dive into a new-look Chelsea's performance at the London Stadium. We'll also ask Sam what went wrong for Spurs and so right for Leicester.<br><br>We'll also look at our teams, scores and overall ranks!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2IxdGx5V3hXdVNmblI2b0JvVHNqdmplUTJ2d3xBQ3Jtc0tsS1dTQXZpbG41cU05eTF4UGhKdlRpYXgyYXdBZVRfMzZJQXhRUFJDN0MtZENuQm1OYndSQi1MTXltcVR0X0ZVcV9VNDFnRzZOZDRoYXNXeFpCN1hpNmx2aDdTNkcxRFVmanNyTGQxTjYtNWV0d1Uxbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=_HBH2MkhiXA">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0ZPdzlDcUNPa25zd01IaHpXelNCSVJDNUhIQXxBQ3Jtc0trbUhBMXdUTW9pelQ1ZHFEM0h4c0NvOXJMSTQybHJlZGZpZXpCMUhmcG9JWVI3V1ZFak9MUHFZaUlBZl8xUVdDMlhEZWF2OG5CU1pEUkZWbVlmazQwSkF1WVFvdDg4MUotOEp5REJWVldzbXB2NmlLQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=_HBH2MkhiXA">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and