  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>ANOTHER DGW lands in our FPL laps! This time, it's Brighton, Brentford, Palace and Southampton in DGW27. So let's pile in right...? Well, as ever in FPL it ain't that simple, as some of those doublers, could then BLANK in GW28. <br><br>Confused? Here's a few minutes of Sam trying to help... :) <br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbklCYmltTGk4cUxNVUViNDZ2bjlGWEhWVjg0UXxBQ3Jtc0ttbVFqckZBanIzU2dKbHM0OFVsUElPWWhBdVBlaVJGSERCaWlic0FJRWJ3YklUS2FRT0J1YjM3U0FPNnRPWG9iSzRkVXlFaC12RzN0UzgwWk5xSk0tNlhBZkstWDZwdktSdGFXSnpIVDdWNjNJcWdndw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=9cp1-Fa3sAM">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGNaS21CMVNiRTU5UUpFRndKXzlVQkpYTHI3d3xBQ3Jtc0tuVGFFc3JSVnRMLXNRQUdDR1FfNHRyNkhqVmdUWjRuMjNxd1BsN3p1VU5fX185b0VyTEs4RERzN2JUd1lHOUEybjRvS1RWY3JKb0JibmF3SlpiRThqUUFXYWVSSUxpeXhlOFg4XzhnXzlvRG1oS2ZaWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=9cp1-Fa3sAM">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbURiU