<item>
  <title>GW23 Voice Notes: Harry Kane...He's one of our own!</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8243380</link>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8243380.mp3?modified=1675784298&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="7873759" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/40082066/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>489</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>200 Premier League goals for Harry Kane - in a week where Lee sold, but Sam kept the faith in FPL. With a decent run coming up for Spurs too, Sam discusses why the Spurs man will always be an integral part of her side - and looks back and remembers some of her favourite Harry Kane moments. <br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazlCZjdobE93eEl2RTlQMWh4M2VtOE1MLUp6d3xBQ3Jtc0ttZG4wV3pVeHVPNnBXMFBUaHNwSHUzUHRjbllXdVpsQWE0LXpUS2dBYjNhY0VoRlpSZ0tZcHpkeW4yeWUtWDNfeEVVa3Q3Y2RPaTliSklOM05VS3dWdC1NTFA3Z1MwSDV3Rm43X0Y2SU5jakN0M3g4TQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=9cp1-Fa3sAM">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1g2Vm80VXczbHJ6X3hic3hKRWtqeU5TQ3Q5Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsQTBQeE9QR3doQWxWXzVjc3VfR2Ruc3NoemxUalR0eTNlejQwcS1ObW5ucC1WSmZLT1p4cDRuWnJoc2ljNHRfZnNyTWh1bXRFVlRTR29UYzlTR0VpNFZCNjdZVWlqTlAtUFMxV2ZHU3RXNXJ0ajlCaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=9cp1-Fa3sAM">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa291ZFlIM