  <description><![CDATA[<div>1-0 so far, to the Rashford Triple Captainers - a goal, assist t and 2 bonus points means that he's on a double-digit haul and with a game to go in GW22. We'll take a look at all the weekend action, ask what on earth is wrong with Liverpool and look ahead to yet another double game week in GW23 - this time for Arsenal and Man City.<br><br>We'll also look at our teams, scores and overall ranks!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGllakFSSnkwbGl0Tk1XZU1VX2hCSC1MWHExQXxBQ3Jtc0ttVlRaQ0hPbG1wRWNTZ1hodVFSLTRsTnZRcUd4Mi0zdVFiREszakd6QWR3bHphcTZGUlktM1FRcTdTOHktbk9CN19ZUk9sV21remkxTnRuMjNOcHFLOFFjYzk3c2VSczh2WFlobjZfbDdxdnVxM1J1NA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=9cp1-Fa3sAM">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0ZWRnQ1ZlJLdUlYVHBHS1ZyWmxOcGVuek45QXxBQ3Jtc0tuRktuUzZtZEZuS2hBaElTdzU3dExkZXY0TlFrMmYwTHd2ZWNoOEtzNlJYOGNldlJnNk1DbVNVbVB1NEpOOGVqVUlCd1NweEFjQ3UtZUxfYmVTTmJEOUVGdlM1LXUwNG81UkhLUXFvNVNNa0dHZTNNTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=9cp1-Fa3sAM">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s