  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>With many looking to use the Triple Captain chip over the next couple of week on either Rashford (this week) or Haaland (next week), Sam talks through why she's going for the Man United man in DGW22...<br><br>We'll also look at our teams, scores and overall ranks!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa18yR3hqUFF4NUg4YkxzR1JQRWNXRS1UalFVZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsckVjT3dRdEt1TnZYaEtTMGxLNFBfelBZVjNRblB3eWFPaHh6dVNiWldnRUh5Y2pDUW5LTGtfLVBYbTloUkVfQlJERWdjQmVlR1hUSTBGR1YtX2FaNmVwR3Ixc3BjeFJTX29yRWpZWnFFY2tobC1Cbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=wdKot3Ajc9s">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHgxZHRHbDVEd0s5U0ZPbXZGQ0lXcjhuVmVjd3xBQ3Jtc0ttWExxQVIzdEJ6a2pJUEpJNmliRXlIT2x2WUxhZVhZb2ZQY0FhMmFFMTU3TE5qSV8tc0xXSklfMFUtaFFXa0JfdDhhNm9veDJvNmlfRDYtOXBNNEJUeUtrYTZvQm5ZcUhfZ1FNWC0xUXJJcHh2VkZvNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=wdKot3Ajc9s">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVpVcUVtQTNyM1U2ZjlIUTRDQXRHeXJPb0Uz