  <description><![CDATA[<div>A frankly pretty chaotic Transfer Deadline Day saw Chelsea splash the cash, United get their Eriksen replacement and Spurs rip up Doherty's contract at the last minute dues to an apparent admin error!<br><br>**RECORDED BEFORE THE PRICE ANNOUNCEMENTS**<br>Enzo 5.0m<br>Porro 5.0m 👀 <br>Sabitzer 5.0m<br><br>Lee talks through the big moves and who he's got his eye on in FPL.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTVraE1Hd3hfNWNLM3N4VDV3Y1dKdVBzSWY0Z3xBQ3Jtc0trcVk2VEtWOXlxUnFKVGppcWwxQ0xRRWlsZ0Q5b1d0S1hHaGU5bENTTHIyU2hSeFAzX05PQkl5N21pbGZfVHpFZGpJZzU5eFFSYTlzM0xxRGpWbW9BdHF1RzJxenBQOURYdUMwTkg1dm9vSndrOW4yNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=wdKot3Ajc9s">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbG9yaHVSeUx5cVUwaTE0VDYtYnZyUFRGQ3lhUXxBQ3Jtc0tueTdsaThpd3dEX05rRjFDTHBiYWlnQVQ0NVpjcnBhVlZZbVpvc1FhQ2VELU9lM3VtV1o1aWhCbUlBSlEyYVBaT19FYWNYY25ZX3M3Um1qQzNMZ2hhNzFLTlFiRXUteVJyUk81VkRGRklZZGtpa2d4QQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=wdKot3Ajc9s">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://