<item>
  <title>GW22 Voice Notes: Cancelo off to Bayern...?!</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8238654</link>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8238654.mp3?modified=1675084467&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="10252877" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/40082066/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>637</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Somewhat out of the blue, Cancelo is off to Bayern. Something's not been right between him and Pep for a few weeks and now it looks like he's exit stage-left...!<br><br>Lee gives his thoughts on possible replacements and looks back a t the weekend's FA Cup action - and what it means for the upcoming FPL schedule.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWNiYmlfeVN1NDR5RjlqcFFzY0E1VEdFNnhXZ3xBQ3Jtc0tueE9MaGVQSGxsYUZLM21VZmRTMEgwUEJOTFV0bENTR0lIRjVmMU9JLVpkNzhvMnIwQUhTNElLaDZZSFF2TGlZVWwxbU4yRnpBVUlWNFVwaTlhRUh6UVhVX2dJSjRBdFV0NC14MktDMldodjh0bHZRVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=wdKot3Ajc9s">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblUxSWt6eDBwV01CTlhrVFZDYzBrMjdmb1RfUXxBQ3Jtc0tseU56elRHZkVuWWlmZWJlTWFxbWZSM0h3Y0R2bXFhRG14WS1KVEE5WkNTdnRaZXl5ZG9hT05tMzY3VE1SX0F1YWpNYl8takVVTENYY3ZTYnVYaktmYnRQUzYtakVEb01sdUtBb1kxS1dhYWRPeE9WNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=wdKot3Ajc9s">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_