  <description><![CDATA[<div>Those that used their Triple Captain on Haaland a couple of weeks ago (like Lee) are now enviously and possibly slightly nervously looking over at those that didn't (like Sam) - because Double Gameweek 22, throws up a delicious looking double for Manchester United with Palace and Leeds at Home. Many will be looking at Rashford, but should we consider Bruno Fernandes and his new-found form for the TC chip?<br><br>We'll also look at our teams, scores and overall ranks!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0RrRjQwNmoyS0ZIMXFXcTlObEVja0ZGdDN4UXxBQ3Jtc0ttM1FONTg3cDlMd00xRmktWFFVejRlT0huZXZHMEd1el9ISE1MdzZKTFVyX2I5c1hrREFodVpwUGhWamlhSU15c3l5Ym1jLUxYdjlZMFBUeERDUWVjT1dEb0x0TFpsSzh6aGgxbUh0QUJKYUhZV3FSMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=wdKot3Ajc9s">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbU5YRGdaOXM1SEpnZ3RCUlJEV1lRejNTNWdkd3xBQ3Jtc0tuSzB4d0dEVVNTYXZINDhZN1ZvWk13alFkaWxrbzJUOWxxbnVfUlBYcFZVQlhFbUtLVEFIak83T1M0U2tqdWZhLUtwYlNaS01obnotOVRNMWZMSmxCdjFoZWFpblVva1RNZUEyNHE5UmVCT0tkTHZvSQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=wdKot3Ajc9s">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 