<item>
  <title>GW21 Voice Notes: Double MAN U and LEEDS Gameweek 22 Announced! </title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8233617</link>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8233617.mp3?modified=1674247503&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="7825789" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/40082066/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>486</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>DOUBLE GAMEWEEK KLAXON! It looks pretty likely we're going to get a Double Gameweek for Man United and Leeds in GW22 - and having not played the Triple Captain chip on Haaland last week, Sam looks at the possibility of playing it on Rashford in GW22.<br><br>We'll also look at our teams, scores and overall ranks!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmg4OEY2UjhnLUdsWnpXX2luUnpQdGJPanZwZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuakloN0xyRVB6anVxQ2RsMTU1UWx4VmNWdVVzdlZwaFJDREVPSkVlUzR0N3EzV0tOQzhHd0pyWGFLSGJ6TGZFRG81VUpGdVlnTHVFcXRPYXUwWXVlXzBBNkVhQThCY1oyYlpIQ29WMS1oU3plVVBVSQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=oEBqzaXdPvY">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3pXMUlvN2Y2c1IwSy1mLV9OYllCV1N0c1VLd3xBQ3Jtc0tua19nM0JOMXY3U01xZmxVdzJSRkRHcl9WRHFmRDN3VWF3WHdnS2ZGb3NkSXduT3FZQndBaTBJWUdPbjBGbTI1Y0t3ZkFrOC14OXc0NHRhNW4wZnFkc0UtaFlZMTREN1RReEpta2ZQdXBBeElTWGdCMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=oEBqzaXdPvY">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_t