  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee gives a quick download of his thoughts after watching Palace vs United at Selhurst Park - and the reaction of the Man United fans he was with to Casemiro's yellow card and subsequent suspension for the Arsenal game in GW21.<br><br>Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWJDbkJfTjk3SW1vY3FXcW9mNXE2ZWVBVEk4d3xBQ3Jtc0ttZHllSDNWQVV0VHZ6aGhIWUdwQzhidWZzaDR6eGlkRHBXZlRwUjZiOF9ERkhMX3NzNm04ZW5WcFVGWVFwX3NYVkdjSWxfUXNTT3R0aU9BaTd3LTBOWUxPX3QzOExOVHpuTzk3d0NNb1drTzNlREo1UQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=oEBqzaXdPvY">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1lLazZ3Uzh2VkVDNkx1Nlp0R0c0MG1rRmJCQXxBQ3Jtc0trbnFDMnBUV0ZUS2Zjb1JqTmxVOEVZdlBsQWYteGYweHh4ejhDX0FVc3Nmb1MzSlNka1lzQmlCdXpyVFVFWkxzeEEwc3lMOE45bF9WN19nY2h3WDJvZ19lcU9lRzNYempTbFdSZXdMalJJYUhnbkpHaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=oEBqzaXdPvY">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXZmTWt2ZDlfVWszbEpQNmRISGpqZmNVVUk3Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsdGh4SDJ5SHRXNmdNVTFZakxtdj