  <description><![CDATA[<div>With DGW20 still live in play, Sam and Lee look back at a bad week for Spurs and Liverpool, but generally speaking a reasonable one in FPL. Lee played the triple captain chip on Haaland with Sam not captaining he big Norwegian at all - so we'll take stock of DGW20 and look ahead to GW21.<br><br>We'll also look at our teams, scores and overall ranks!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3ItT2lSVXIwNk9oWVRuUnpZQ2M0QTZUNzBuZ3xBQ3Jtc0trbjFWN0ZVXzVBUnlyOVJ5blV1YkFTcEIySThHWUE2X0dvQWFXelFaZW9ZZDBGOThtM2ptRUJoUV9IS2ZoZDRDdjcwbmVINDFBejh2MndOSmNNcTV6OXVLc25zVFBHV1FkSjUtREMtYW5XZS1LY1FGMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=oEBqzaXdPvY">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2FNOHRtU1QzUmVZNF95R1pmWHlKeVpZMmhfZ3xBQ3Jtc0tra3lldXFsWlVtSUp3WExTMmRiZE9MVE9OX29BZm1leENsdFVNdUNkdXpNQW5WdmtxSEhnZWJCdzFnZ2szYnZRVnQtbFc1aGduMU1qZVljdXZvVWRQc3RSekZoMlA4STJ4X19MSWVBeW1fT21MZjJiQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=oEBqzaXdPvY">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redire