  <itunes:duration>615</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<strong>Welcome to FPL Family Voice Notes!</strong><br><br>In the FIRST of a new series of mini-Podcasts, Lee looks back at last night's action, including Mitrovic getting THE dreaded booking, United looking good for fourth and what's up on Merseyside - with both Blues and Reds looking out of form.<br><br>Hit <strong>Subscribe</strong> and look out for more FPL Family Voice Notes throughout the week!<br><br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblU4R3J2b0VFbEZnNGRjcEhPZ01qLThrZVhQUXxBQ3Jtc0tsWEtvNlFrdFBnYVZfRUZ4YnZzZVYwcWxQWEFoZzhIMTRsN3JsR1oxNXowaUJEbVk1c3NmRjdqbThQbThfMzh4VE1HamREZnFlRm9JMi1hQmdJUF94QUt4aHF3blNQS3VUUXdYUDgtQm4wNDZieXA3WQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=XakCRyfcs9k">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDVDNU5yVzVMS2R1WHU5c1ZvVlRDLW1DanlIQXxBQ3Jtc0tuOGsyekd4dWN2akR2WG43QVQ4WHNxckxGNlZ4cTdubzNvbkx3a1pZSkRhVHBIdnV4ZlVFSlp6eHA5bXNiWHBRUUlZZVBBTWt1dVBzcnI4QXFIM1RmRVdZci1lN1lhbzlaUjYyWlJaVml5bVU5TXVnTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=XakCRyfcs9k">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event