  <description><![CDATA[<div>HAPPY NEW YEAR! Salah and De Bruyne both blank it what was a largely frustrating GW for many FPL managers - particularly those that owners Ben White, who was subbed on 59 minutes for a 1-pointer! We look ahead now to Double GW19, whose deadline is MONDAY at 1600 (UK time), so we have a very quick turnaround and almost no time at all to think through our FPL changes and (possibly in Sam's case) chip usage, as she ponders a DGW Bench Boost!<br><br>We'll also look at our teams, scores and overall ranks!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDZUUXRwZ3J0d1hEVlc1RnRILWNVRXVQN1VZd3xBQ3Jtc0ttYnNCQ1Flblo0ZEVSb1BWR0JTQll1alZNZmNpNWVGWFZLRTV3OG1GYi1vd3FxT3NWZ3RCUmNXVWMyTU1maUx0WWdUTFZ6WVQ0UTRwN2tIVEtVdzZZVWJuUzdQaDF2ME5iLTFvX2VJOV9CdEhTamNmaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=XakCRyfcs9k">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjBBZnNGMUJtWUNNd0IyU1JGdm5nMndjdDlNUXxBQ3Jtc0ttN0UzdTk3R2p5dWlWX3hyRld4MWNubS1CdVY4emVDTHM0Q01aeVdOLVpCQ2NJSjA4YTJYalNZSFlJeDM5ZFF2bjFUMVBOem83eWZrN3YwZTdOUFkwYmNsVDlZa1R2S0FDNXZCODlnSWhleHBuRFlVWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=XakCRyfcs9k">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<b