<item>
  <title>S6 Ep16: FPL IS BACK! - GW17 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8217053</link>
  <itunes:episode>16</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>FPL IS BACK! - GW17 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>6</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8217053.mp3?modified=1671400289&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="68702521" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/40082066/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>4290</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>The World Cup is done and dusted (Congratulations Argentina!)  and with England getting no further than the Quarter-Finals, Lee and Sam have been drafting a shiny new FPL Squad for the re-start. With the Unlimited Transfer window still open, we'll look at how we're both shaping up for GW17 - with Sam having some making up to do, if she's going to catch Lee.<br><br>We'll also look at our teams, scores and overall ranks!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa29IMDZoNzlWRlJTc3dNUHo1ZlRxM2VVUVlTZ3xBQ3Jtc0trbUUxMlFkYjNYbTc0LWY3X1ltLVA0Q0ljS0loX2VQcjZhOGRwd0J5YnJGLVdBanZnSGdMNmt0by1pdEFqN2tudTRDMTVOZGRMQVdoWDA1U0hoUDQyVUlLT2RFSlctU3paMWRPU0lERHJiZ0dWYzJjOA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=zrHyDuuhJkw">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjA2NzBuVWl3U1ZNZU10MHdmZjNaQ05xWkxCUXxBQ3Jtc0tuZmR0VTZIT1dUVDlfMFFqS3laNWx1MTIwRGpFUkNudkQ3RG9FOUdTZmxtVTI2cW02cFZCdllXSTgtS2FHdm9hbTIyN3FucldKdVBNV0EzR2sxMzRMWlk3aWotQnI1QVVqMjFBM0ZlWWVyZEdpelI1SQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=zrHyDuuhJkw">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a