  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>With only one week to go before we take a collective breather for the World Cup, Lee and Sam look at the best one-week differential punts for GW16. We'll also look at our teams, in what was a chaotic week, particularly at the deadline, for FPL managers.<br><br>We'll also look at our teams, scores and overall ranks!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br><br>**NEW CHRISTMAS CODE @ <a href="http://KICKINGTHEBALLSS.COM">KICKINGTHEBALLSS.COM</a> - USE XMAS22FPL FOR 15% OFF ALL ORDERS OVER £95!**<br> <em>_______________________</em>         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br><em>________________________</em><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br><em>________________________</em><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazMyZzlocnNGOXJwbDV4WjF1NXBfcy03cFN4UXxBQ3Jtc0tuZHF4cGdvbV9CV1J5b1R0Qm83YzAxSFZqZ2VSc3preGI5NjVJcXdndGwwbnJnSlM1V0FBZzBTb1NOdFBZNmRkQ3Z2ZFhEOHFZd2VveTF4SjllQk9tVnpxN1VLalMydTVqWlY4cVllTmdnRmlYd1E3bw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=cJ3quJfgLVU">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDEyQnpPajRhQVp5Zmg4cjlrbjRmUEhOeC1QZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuelEzMG84aVJ5WVZ3Y2xtOGk0c0YwUWpvVkd1cWFHbXRPbmMxaHpFcGJvTGQ3cnZPMVlRUlBVQjlpWEVab0hSalNqQXBWUkI4bmw5MVUxUXVCV2tHOGdFNE1kd242ZGNSWm5YYi1MaVFGcWVPVGRoUQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=cJ3quJfgLVU">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>**NEW CHRISTMAS CO