  <description><![CDATA[<div>Haaland, Saka, Kepa injured, Toney suspended - it's flags all round in the FPL Family household this week! But with only two GWs to go until the unlimited transfer World Cup window opens, we discuss whether this is the perfect time to turn flags into riches, with a couple of differentials for GW15 and GW16.<br><br>Both Sam and Lee have 2FTs - with Lee having already spent one of them - Lowell look at who we think are the best low-owned players for a pre-World Cup punt.<br><br>We'll also look at our teams, scores and overall ranks!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> <em>_______________________</em>         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br><em>________________________</em><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br><em>________________________</em><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkVDUHRPenVjdklUc2xOUmRRYlJxeUJmSnBzZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsZV9CaDl1MFd4bGV4ZU4xbEJKbE9fV2N4OTRYa0w4bnFLdDlvU04zdWdKcUZ1cS0tVjZFUmIyY1dlUF9hb21kRk01S1FGbDBlZjR1bVNicTZmTU8zVWlnS25EN1YxMUJuM3FIOXllaVVRczl2UGNtWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=HPUD1rnkw9M">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEFzdU1RcjB2SUl3UGluOVhiM1RsRGd2OEZTZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsMTNtSGtXR2Zodzl6MENmdUl4ak9XTlJ5THNFbjFaSnlOLVhsR2RDYzNDd3ZtSGRSOU5zS3lnZFdDZ1pGemFiMHNxRXZrUkdkbERMaFlaWnZfQzAybTJLWUYzeUZ6cTNha0pBQ2JkQl9xTHdqbS01RQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=HPUD1rnkw9M">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use '