  <description><![CDATA[<div>GW11 in the books, but no time to rest on our FPL laurels, with GW12 only hours away. We'll look back at Spurs putting Everton away with a professional performance at the Tottenham Hotspur Stadium and Ivan Toney hauling for his owners with a brace on Friday. <br><br>James Maddison was also in many FPL teams ready to appear in GW12, but a 5th booking for a 94th minute dive this weekend, means he's suspended for the upcoming GW giving us yet further issues ahead of an already difficult GW to navigate!<br><br>We'll also look at our teams, scores and overall ranks!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> <em>_______________________</em>         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br><em>________________________</em><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br><em>________________________</em><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblVwWWQyWmlmcThocHJFNFFodDlVbHl4SGZQUXxBQ3Jtc0tubk1FV291ZkIzS3h1NjNxQ2hILTdsTkFhNWxqNDREQklXdUhybllBaWcyMThmSS1fSWIzTzgxZ01NbGZSc2VVM1lGTHRiVV9vNVFralQ3NEFqcFlxTGRyOFdxTTMwRDcwUWtXS2FBeHI1Q29yX2R3MA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=j7j1ZxAMXsM">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUVRMVU0Sl9pWG9mTGF2VldfZTFsa2lKSDlvd3xBQ3Jtc0trTkxoaHRZSlJBR2JGcHVGUnplbVVRTE5HX2laVWFCRGNWOUp1NThiSzFYMHZiOWxUNzB1a3p5cllqNXZscXBaV3RvcUdhbENMbjBIZlFKeDBCZ1ZiN0ZlZ0hVenNGdEprM0o5RXVDN0E0MzZ2SlV0OA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=j7j1ZxAMXsM">https://ki