  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>GW11 is with us, but we very much have one eye on GW12, where both Man City and Arsenal have a blank fixture. We'll look back at GW10 reasonably fondly though, with many big FPL assets returning. Kane, Haaland and Foden all in the points - as well as Trippier and Cancelo making the case for continued investment at the back.<br><br>We'll also look at our teams, scores and overall ranks!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> <em>_______________________</em>         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br><em>________________________</em><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br><em>________________________</em><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa08zbG02TGQ0YU90QXdVQy1tLUdJcHQ2bGhqUXxBQ3Jtc0tuT01SazJGNnoxVGdfZVUtaF8xNThPeGEyWElrM0ZjaDZQN0ZnTlJWZWNPQjd1TGZTal9jSG5sc1FxN3NaVjFrNUVvRHBCYmRhMHNSajR0REhmQ1RIWnpYYXhhRUxlUFA3T0VqdUJ5UUlfZWNlbDhlZw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=f0a5yXfynGA">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbng1WlNlbTYxUFpSQ0l6Y0NQMkJoaFFpTzVzQXxBQ3Jtc0trRTBuWlF6b0NKSE85d1Vrc0ZwYVFnckhUVmhYUTZHVTFNNkp5N0ltNk5wajRzRXVOMTRVam00bDI2T0owa1ZkRXpVWlhxYklJM25YY3ZlYi11SmFPLXJXLVFJVEtVUzQzRkZKd0Z3OVFRdnh3UVlhTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=f0a5yXfynGA">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><em>________________________</em><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPER