  <description><![CDATA[<div>Having decided not to play the wildcard ahead of GW9, we look at how Sam's team finished up and whether she closed the gap on Lee this week. On the pitch, Arsenal's great start continues, 10-man Fulham are humbled by Newcastle (and pick up an injury to Mitrovic) and Liverpool's poor form continues as they ship three to Leandro Trossard's Brighton.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> <em>_______________________</em>         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br><em>________________________</em><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br><em>________________________</em><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbU0zNEVJa1dSVXZvT2Jwa2U5WGx5QlZGN2I3d3xBQ3Jtc0ttYmQ0SVBHVW5HeG1KLVlfTnZyUE4weDdPVHM4Zk10SG1hZHFkTkZQRC1nN3VVVFVFeENqUlFybnVBTjJTS29wYkNXUVBZb0t5ZkgtbzZiQmlIbGdrRDdTOVpVdDU3OEdrMlEwVVhBZHpKZWhNckU4MA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=pNGXFdbIyhQ">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWFmMmFFaDVmS0owR2Q2blFLbUtDajNZWml5QXxBQ3Jtc0tuWGdCTU5lUkQ3VzJYdWhzcjhBMVN2cE1yVjluT240YUFiY2MxMG5pTkdWN1FqRUNDUTJ2eWNaUDhzcWE0ODNYOF9tSDVWcF9aVGVNM0FaX1JMb2FWamNlYnlSaktycFpzV0V2N3NqN05ONGVnZWpzYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=pNGXFdbIyhQ">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><em>________________________</em><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="http