<item>
  <title>S6 Ep8: SAM'S WILDCARD ACTIVE! - GW9 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8159711</link>
  <itunes:episode>8</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>SAM'S WILDCARD ACTIVE! - GW9 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>6</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8159711.mp3?modified=1663534282&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="68175246" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/39408555/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>4258</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Form is temporary, class is permanent as they say - with Heung-Min Son firmly back on our FPL radars ahead of GW9. But does it say more about Leicester's defence than Spurs attack? Elsewhere, City and Haaland march on, Fulham score three but Mitrovic blanks - and Isak scores from the spot against Bournemouth.<br><br>We'll take a look at the key targets over the international break and a first look at Sam's Wildcard draft. We'll also look back at GW8 and find out whether Lee's Wildcard was a success and how he's set for the coming weeks.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> <em>_______________________</em>         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br><em>________________________</em><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br><em>________________________</em><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFVvaHRocGUzb2k4c3dOcTlxWDRMUkd6c09Kd3xBQ3Jtc0trZE1BSDBZcjdya3JyanZ5R3dyZ3VEOXMtSTBkb3dfMFRXS1hWSEFESTM4aERsVUVpSF9rY3YxWDhKUGZKeW5iWEpJYW9YTmZyWWc3TldYYmU3TEJFeHFucnRNMm9TakU0NnhFbko5Yy1LT2liOVpWUQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=ARr-x2bo3hw">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnBfX2ZuZ0dWT3gtaVZ2UURvY2QxaG9ybnhUZ3xBQ3Jtc0trMUxLSkluN2RwREdJeFk0dUZlWWNMX1N5cHk1aVBhYXlyRjBrTVMzVVVWektZR3Nicmg4NHAtWHJzb2FSOG5xTjNRUEU5LTFTdTZsNDNUQ3JnUnN3RC1fMjFNNWh6WTJLUTVaU1o5Q3luOHZ3UlZ4cw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=ARr-x2bo3hw">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br