  <description><![CDATA[<div>Sam and Lee look back at he weekend's action, including stalemates for both Liverpool and Man City. Sure take advantage with a win at home to Fulham and Ivan Tony owner bag a Hugh double-digit haul.<br><br>We'll also look at our teams and OTs, with Sam maybe, possibly, potentially considering a wildcard. <br><br>Maybe :) <br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe!<br> <em>_______________________</em>         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br><em>________________________</em><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br><em>________________________</em><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkhjTlR4NmZTNWlYc1dwWVppWFZCUG1BN0F2UXxBQ3Jtc0tsMXFvYnBUMXhVSS1EM0dLUExYUFVkS1RHQUhJNFdDVkdKTmI4Nl9fd0cwek1XeWVMQjQ0SF9rNmxZRUJKSm4tMWtWajZGWjdjUGlHbkZ0dm9sRWtoQnFlbkVDN0dsakRFTFpuZGcwY2dqMFIzZEcxTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=1hWDZdEGgKM">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXBXdXFaSXp1SG9VSzlnbHpiNVNTMWR4VDl0QXxBQ3Jtc0ttMDY1RjJrNE5hYndfVm5xZnprVm5PTnptMHk4Y3hMeDctVFVmZDBXZnNaM2RVcHFQTERpazBVUFQwWTMzY1dVeXB6LUxhTGs3dDJhQ3ZtVFk0bng4UmVmLTl6YjZtMGJxeFBZVHJMMDJQQmU3U3BnSQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=1hWDZdEGgKM">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><em>________________________</em><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redire