  <title>S6 Ep6: CAN STERLING OR BRUNO BREAK THE TEMPLATE? - GW5 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8147377</link>
  <itunes:episode>6</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>CAN STERLING OR BRUNO BREAK THE TEMPLATE? - GW5 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>6</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8147377.mp3?modified=1661720696&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="81911400" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/39408555/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>5116</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam look ahead to GW5 in FPL and ask whether Haaland has earned himself the 'essential' tag after his. hat-trick against Palace. Luis Dias owners are on Cloud Nine as Liverpool break records at Anfield - as Salah has a rare off-day for his capatiners. And Arsenal march on undefeated to the top of the league.<br><br>We'll look ahead to GW5's fixtures and look at how our teams are shaping up - with Lee having made one transfer already!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> <em>_______________________</em>         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br><em>________________________</em><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br><em>________________________</em><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1E0eW0zS1BJY2VRMEw1bzJxUGhvZFlJN2Z1d3xBQ3Jtc0tuRi0zcThLa0xRV1VCcXM2UU15dmdBWnc4UF9Ub2FXU2Q1OGh2R0Vkd0lYVUhBVGJrc1NTSWowWkFpSlVGU2hiclRfYUs2cmF3eHpiOHpTNHp2T3c0SUVyTzczdDIydGVGb2VhMTBneFFPNGRYT0hMNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=xUyEl6xn8Fo">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXFPYlZRT0lidk9INDBIbVBOSTk1b2JtcU1mQXxBQ3Jtc0tuOXBnS3N3d1VhM0dGc0U5UWlLYkdDcWhCUE1Pal9QQVZ3RjJNRG1VbTFKVWtwUXh4OWtJMFNITmhBNEdXcEJoNGFDWGNWRV8tNzkxbWVrX1JJdWtaV0JiYko5cGJfRmUwbE9fWmZTbGlUb1hXdjN1Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=xUyEl6xn8Fo">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><em>________________________</em><