  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam look back at GW3's action and share their teams for GW4. <br><br>Lee shares some thoughts on Ivan Toney's superb start to the season and who else might be the 'template breakers' that bring this season's game to life. Sam regrets not bringing in Perisic, despite Spurs grinding out another good win. Arsenal also continue their blistering start to the season, with Jesus captains unlucky to get just the 4 points.<br><br>With United v Liverpool still to come on Monday night, we look ahead to GW4 and ask when is the right time for the first wildcard.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> <em>_______________________</em>         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br><em>________________________</em><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br><em>________________________</em><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2dYd2hhdW1kaVU5UXNZV1hJU2dreE5rb3pud3xBQ3Jtc0ttVk5jd0lxRUxEQzEtNFlMNFNudzdWdlVsMm8zS2Z5NGxBUmd1MkdWdl9NT0pZTURUTm5zVXQ0YlZoSUhPbHh3V1N0d1VlMnBSemVrRjZ2YzBUeWdiZEs3X2laOGpvdVhIZ3Jwc2IwcGVVR0V4UEg3MA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=U5xSqehVQ0s">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVlzUlE5TnlxTTdEM21RQS01ZGYzNmxLYU9Ed3xBQ3Jtc0tuV3lWYWk0cFgzRk5UcFN4SFo1aXlHMVFIVnJsckdYeFlqUXFRV1o3ZjQ5Z1pMZDFFRzl4VXZaMnB4RGdCaV95Z2xFWFN6NVZSMkszcjJNaXZ5YnBqb0ZhM3RoOHB6Q2xfRlM1WThKbDktQVFIbE1rYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=U5xSqehVQ0s">https://kic