  <title>S6 Ep4: WERE WE TOO QUICK TO SELL HARRY KANE? - GW3 - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/2023)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8139116</link>
  <itunes:episode>4</itunes:episode>
