  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>With many of the big hitters delivering for us again this week, it's getting no easier narrowing down which are the best FPL options ahead of GW3. Arsenal continue their good start to the season and City trounce Bournemouth as expected - although Haaland captainers will have expected more than just the solitary assist.<br><br>We look back at all the weekend's action, knowing that Liverpool are still to play Crystal Palace on Monday night.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/an">https://support.google.com/youtube/an</a>...<br>________________________<br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br> 🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter, Instagram and TikTok! - Just Search 'fplfamily'<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/fplfamily">https://www.tiktok.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br>Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes,  Deezer.<br> __________________________<br>Stats, Season Tickers and Player Ratings provided by Fantasy Football Scout Members Area.<br>Become a member here! - <a href="http://Bit.ly/FPLFamily1">http://Bit.ly/FPLFamily1</a>‬<br> __________________________   <br>More on 'Match Insights', Premier League's new Partnership with Oracle Cloud:<br><a href="https://www.oracle.com/premier-league/">https://www.oracle.com/premier-league/</a><br>__________________________   <br> #FPL #FPLFamily #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLTips</div>]]></description>
