  <description><![CDATA[<div>So we're off and running in FPL - and as expected both North London teams are off to a flyer, as Spurs and Arsenal both record wins in GW1. Liverpool stumble away at an impressive Fulham and United falter at home to Brighton on Ten Haag's first game in charge.<br><br>We'll go through all the top talking points ahead in GW1 and look at how our teams are set for GW2.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbk9KTW9MTDJlaTVnR2E0M0plLWs2TkRUUVAxZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuNmx0emxLVDZuN0NVcy1zRzJYbGs4ZHA3VzFFcjk2RXFNRERHVnhBWUlxS2ljeU9taDlwNEhYVjhndDZDTlVWQnBtWXZod1ZUX2VHVmhrRjhtbW1uaWtZaTBzcTdqSlB4SDRBZGFLWlpCUTkwdF9nQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=0b48ocOZxko">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazgwcE1VREZXblJVUm5oRUV4ZzRhSDk0TUpjQXxBQ3Jtc0ttLTQxd0wwMEVrWVlTRGNDQWFBb3M0SEFtWHc5al9WOWVzNnRHcjNPOVQ0YzVmMTd3VERUMDlVejRVS0xwRGNJSTBmS0ZQNE9rSHZlTUJodHNNSXhVa09BNkJyS2FRenR3SVFIaEZsQkF0T1FCVlFIRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%2F&amp;v=0b48ocOZxko">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www