<item>
  <title>S6 Ep1: WATCHLIST PLAYERS &amp; GW1 DRAFTS! - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League 2022/2023)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8117953</link>
  <itunes:episode>1</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>WATCHLIST PLAYERS &amp; GW1 DRAFTS! - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League 2022/2023)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>6</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8117953.mp3?modified=1657490511&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="77325535" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/39408555/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.jpg" />
  <itunes:duration>4830</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>We. Are. Back!<br><br>FPL 22/23 is LIVE and we're back with our first stream of the new season.<br><br>We'll take a look at how the game has changed this year - with every manager being afforded unlimited transfers for the World Cup in Qatar, it's effectively a three-Wildcard-season, which will have an impact on how we manage our teams. We'll also look at who's on our watchlist and our first thoughts on a draft for GW1.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> _________________________         <br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>pzj0a0<br>__________________________<br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join</a><br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam<br>- Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers<br>- Exclusive Podcasts every Friday looking ahead to the next GW<br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/an">https://support.google.com/youtube/an</a>...<br>________________________<br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br> 🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter, Instagram and TikTok! - Just Search 'fplfamily'<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/fplfamily">https://www.tiktok.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br>Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes,  Deezer.<br> __________________________<br>Stats, Season Tickers and Player Ratings provided by Fantasy Football Scout Members Area.<br>Become a member here! - <a href="http://Bit.ly/FPLFamily1">http://Bit.ly/FPLFamily1</a>‬<br> __________________________   <br>More on 'Match Insights', Premier League's new Partnership with Oracle Cloud:<br><a href="https://www.oracle.com/premier-league/">https://www.oracle.com/premier-league/</a><br>__________________________   <br> #FPL #FPLFamily #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLTips</div>]]></description>
