  <description><![CDATA[<div>Congratulations to Man City - Premier League Champions 21/22 - and congrats to every one of you on another completed FPL season! We'll reminisce about the highs and lows of the season, as well as casting our minds back all the way to GW1, to look at our pre-season predictions! We'll also crown the winner of <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/teamsam">#TeamSam</a> vs <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/teamlee">#TeamLee</a>!<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>***New Titles by @FPLRob182***<br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGZnck9iNDVoMXR6Yk53Y1BObkNubVgyYU84d3xBQ3Jtc0trMkhuaURudmk5Tk5QNU1KY0xZbjYxWXpSMmFRTGZzSE95RXBZLUVUN1VEX1FtX1FULVBlYkkyTWxRTGhXVWJwZnlMbklNenZ2bUpBcC1FYTdVZWk0LVZtOURuYWd4dFpGeW9Ib3phd2otNTNCU0VUSQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=AKMlRc1MQlA">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTBubTdHTWF2bG1RbjFOOGZoTHVBMHlHcV9VZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuUjc0NkxhWU50ZmNFVUduemZXdXNiVEtDZHl2b1lpUWoyTWdFYWZlY3BBWHhmQ0FGOGdJYUI3a1U4U2FVTkxTWDdKZXdfTzU4