  <description><![CDATA[<div>With only two weeks to go, both Lee and Sam have a Free Hit Chip tech in-hand, but are currently looking to play it in different GWs. We look at Lee's Free Hit draft for GW37 and we ask Sam why she's waiting to play it on the final GW. We'll also look back at the weekend's action and ahead to the final couple of GWs.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>***New Titles by @FPLRob182***<br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1laMDhJa0h5bzFWZ3NNZXFQcDJFTFQxeXBJUXxBQ3Jtc0tueDRrNW5zZEZ2RENsRzU0YkxDSUxTTThVaG81d2VTZjF3dHJYbDYwOVp5U0haeTRVd0pJdngzc2hxYkhvMnFuak1GN3RwNGRNZjlUbmJnZGhFbWd4dG8yVnY2dzB0SDI4U3p3dUhKUnhVYXFZVnJzbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=8DZcMBI9oKc">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3pvU2VyQ0Rqbm5fenZqWFc3aHJFdVdMSUlMd3xBQ3Jtc0ttbG1WOHpSYUFUNEF2SnVsLUFqSTFYN1BrcmxINVltNmhFWnhUM1l2T1VzakZyWmZnSTJ2WUd3Smh0TjVhSm5pbnRDWDJKMHBGcnJMM1djSHFQM1hBZ3Z0SHN4d2RfVUJOQ29UWVM2NlBqY2R1WmhhOA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com&amp;v=8DZcMBI9oKc">https