  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>The battle for the title, for fourth and to avoid the drop are all hotting up - and so is FPL, as we enter this season's biggest DGW! And with Bench Boosts, Free Hits and Wildcards being played all over the FPL Community, this week's gonna make or break some seasons. Lee's also some 30 points ahead of Sam heading into GW36, so we'll find out how Sam plans to claw her lead back in the next 3 weeks.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>***New Titles by @FPLRob182***<br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWg1akxBWXBjTW10REticGR0TnNudUlQcTY1Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsUC1QZHdwbjlNc0wzUHhWX1dmS2tsQm9jNXRPNXBUTEFDeXBlYnNEY1FndFAxYTl4bzg1OHZ3YTZYVUo0SWNLYW9EU3BJQUJNQ3ZOUFVuQmR1aVBJVlc3TFZQeFlfYmNhNWJTTy1kQUJxeHp0SzVGSQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=Zxi_5yLPSCo">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHBqM25peEdkZWZ4LV9OWEotandjTzNTRWRrd3xBQ3Jtc0ttZW5saUI4c1lkQ2w3V0JIZ0tGMVdBazlaVlRHRXBFMmc4NlJQQlhrMk9nZTZjT0