  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>City march on in pursuit of yet another Premier League title - but it's Gabriel Jesus that brings home the FPL points, not Free Hitter's favourite, Raheem Sterling. We also take a look at key Chelsea assets for the upcoming DGW - with options up front as well as at the back. Elsewhere, Arsenal also take a big step towards securing fourth - and we ask what to do with Son and Kane now Spurs have hit a dry patch.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>***New Titles by @FPLRob182***<br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg/join/join">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1o3WVNmTmdqWTNHendZOExWTlp2alVZT3Nnd3xBQ3Jtc0tsdmtta1J0LWVOR21KdzlPSWhkUW9JdjlTU1RRTW1wLVBTNmJuOGp5MkJ3Q05ORTdrYVZranhXN2hXNl9XRXljc2RITW1TelNkamFPaG1MVVRCUzVYVC1qdVJuZzVTbzJrYWVLeUVpRVdXNkczeFVzVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;v=eQtr_Luw7xY">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWhGZFNaTk92ZExnV1FQSU53LVB1cWxnaC1Yd3xBQ3Jtc0tuYzJlbnFER293VWJNalplUUJuOWFPZkExYktoR0lVSkljZVFxM