<item>
  <title>S5 Ep29: GW33/34 - The Other Bruno... - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8068278</link>
  <itunes:episode>29</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>GW33/34 - The Other Bruno... - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>5</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8068278.mp3?modified=1650231890&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="64838014" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/38500794.png" />
  <itunes:duration>4038</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>We take stock of where we're up to in the middle off DGW33, with plenty of football still to be played. With FPL points at a bit of a premium, unless you had Ronaldo or Bruno (no, not that one), we see how Lee and Sam's teams are shaping up for the run-in.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>***New Titles by @FPLRob182***<br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXQ2OWdxb3ZwQTZrWTJHaWZjR1BNOHk3dWZ4UXxBQ3Jtc0tsMk9HZU9YNVMwVXRIak9TMjVZZ0dIUGZ0azFwQWkzRWJ3LWhXcVNKWHRKVHJkLUlJRHFZdUs1SWNWOS1INGVFcjBreERuV2hjdlZmd2RZenZXMzB6SFRjbHpnYThBY2tsRDVKcDBMVHo1QjVJT1FZMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbENqTFZUVng5NGJZcmw1UXBvQnVJUkg1c0ROd3xBQ3Jtc0ttcTN5dGhFOG1DV1BSYXQ5alJMTWNsckd4SV9pS3lBck14V3U0c0tTa01Kb0lmOUxPM0VqY0U2bGV1aVVMNG1XNFVkQ05JWE54aF9qUktwRnd0bHRwMUNZc1FCMUw4SDNuUjFQZ1g4MDM5MmhoU0RuYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use '