  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>City and Liverpool go toe-to-toe in a thriller at The Etihad - we ask what now for City and Liverpool assets? Who should you invest in and should you sell Salah now for Kevin De Bruyne? Elsewhere, what now for Spurs assets as they smash a sorry looking Villa for five. Arsenal slip up at him to Brighton, but now have a DGW and Chelsea don't double, but find some form at St. Mary's to remind us their assets are still worthy of discussion.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>***New Titles by @FPLRob182***<br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblJXcGxVRThyTEVYUlZiaFFLLUlmeXBSbGVEZ3xBQ3Jtc0tscEtIRVp0R0xnS3JfY1c5MXpjUWRFcThRR00xMWQyNG11bmh4bGd6ZFhwemxaaE9QUEVFWlNtbmhzZmwyeFc5c19uM2pHbkdTakUzR1ZBZWQtbUxwMHFIdkY0Qm9HQkd0NnVZR1RLMDhXdDBISmtDaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3A1WmRjRkFwNTZuNzI0YVpjSXBGRE9MZnFyUXxBQ3Jtc0trcGFhbXgxRnBRZTZEX3RQN2JSeXd5WUktdUpiZXpfU284WW1GYk