<item>
  <title>S5 Ep27: GW31/32 - Title Decider! FPL Picks from Man City v Liverpool - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8059777</link>
  <itunes:episode>27</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>GW31/32 - Title Decider! FPL Picks from Man City v Liverpool - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>5</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8059777.mp3?modified=1649022767&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="59686369" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/38500794.png" />
  <itunes:duration>3716</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>In a shock turn of events, GW32 actually has 10 fixtures with all teams playing once! And it's the possible title decider no less on Sunday as Man City host rivals Liverpool. We'll look at whether you should rush to bring Trent back, why you should target players playing against Everton and look back at Brentford's sensational win at Stamford Bridge.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>***New Titles by @FPLRob182***<br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnVLTld0T1QxRFdMVlNtWW84OWcyZF9nWldQUXxBQ3Jtc0tuak94STQwOXQyZDJjMVp1YzRSV1RGTWZ0VllFeS1ZN3ZyUlc1VGJ4cnYxSVZLV3BvcnJCQlNydV94bjV0M3FQeTdxUGNyOFcwbGdkeG9hY3NmSHRsMjRsZENyUDdWSmRSeGQtcy1PTGd3YXN5LVRHdw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1k0b2FOLWF6RlVYdDNhWXdOeE95a0pDbzJQd3xBQ3Jtc0ttZnFnU1NZbzhmZi1pdDNnN3RPSTJWY25zWWUzN090dHBmRkN1U0RSS3Q0MXJUTUZyYWQzODRGcHNPNy15UXh3UEhERFZtalN4bUEzRDRSLVMyTWlQeUhaNFpEME9ldlF3RmRiMndrX2