  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>We'll look back at the weekend's actin and DGW28 so far. With lots of action still to play, were our chip strategies a HIT or a MISS? And what next for DGW29, Blank GW 30 and beyond as we enter the home stretch for this season.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>***New Titles by @FPLRob182***<br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br><br>Join our channel to get access to perks:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWVNMHRuWEh2d3RmWFA3TXFKLTEzWGlTZnl1QXxBQ3Jtc0ttM09yYnpacU1ZZFkyNlF2eUtvYVNYQk44OG43N1BQQktLVC1aLXpEdGp4NXhfS2s5eENjdEx4U0RfRUVGZDJhc3VsM2hFNk1Ed19OdDRieC1vVXoxRkVHUjFiNWdmZUFtNWpQbGNkWVpuR01RaGlqMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTJ2YnM5UElzZGF2a3EyRnNVSW1rNkkyYzlDZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsOEtxYWJ4MUo0Mk5qdVRJWVlmNEVDTHR6QUNOR0psaGNhd2dad2UxYlJNVzZIcnV5S1Fad3pzWDNxcmV3QnljMzNOQnNNTXFwRGF6YXI5dDdGNnUyYjJkbk5HRVBwLWZucFpzQVpScVRNR0hzRklsZw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all produ