  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>With Burnley vs Leicester still to go in GW27, we waste no time in looking ahead now to another big Double GW. We scout the best players for next week and ask who the best captaincy options are - with the likes of Wolves, Southampton and Aston Villa all with decent-looking doubles.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>***New Titles by @FPLRob182***<br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnlCVnJWWm1QY3NxTjB6SERmUXBCZTUwSEhvd3xBQ3Jtc0trX1V4SnUxNzc4VV9Qb2ZzdGN2QnpfdU82cmF5VU9keTNqNlphQ0FqR04wNHUxa3hBM3Z4a2FQOVJ3T05iRDRVVXhSaGpKbmhrWDZxWG5Ic3c2dlYxLXNOX2UtbnF5OThjdHlHWmluUldKV1pxdGx0bw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkhvbHdPcVRzSF93TV8tdWk0Y1phQmROcEpxUXxBQ3Jtc0trSzN0dGIxRGkxT0NxZjkyT0JmOEdsbWZWVXVsS0lEVjc0SzMwUnRxNzlURDJhOUVHSHNKRjhJSmRIVjJvaFByOVdKV093Q0pjUmxnMS1OX2lUTmRwRTk4TTdnQWxQaVJLNFk3dmlKNk14V3loWFlWYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s h