  <title>S5 Ep23: GW26/27 - Weghorst IN for DGW27?- FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8034865</link>
  <itunes:episode>23</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>GW26/27 - Weghorst IN for DGW27?- FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</itunes:title>
