  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>We're mid-DGW26, so Sam and Lee will take stock on where we're at so far, with Sam still buzzing after Spurs blow the title race wide open, dramatically beating City 3-2. United find a way to beat Leeds and we ask - are Everton too good to go down? We plan for a chaotic few weeks ahead in FPL, talk chip strategies and key players.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>***New Titles by @FPLRob182***<br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGFDUDdRelVsLXhtRTI4TE9RWjBIM25LcHZFd3xBQ3Jtc0tsN1VjdjBhZ1c4QUh4QlpqWDdVSjVaRVdyT0ZOTUo5ZkVIWW00bVl5RWt2UzdpX2lFMnFqbTI2ODYzSTE0b0V2MGhUeHFMY05XdVlFZ3pROUQ2dEJURHRsR0JXMEtJVjlRcmR6MFFzWHhUQ3VYbTFGTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkxCLS16NFBqSnFGc0tQSFUxTXpkQWlWZmhud3xBQ3Jtc0ttWXM5X2V2ZlVvZE1sMmEtQ2dxdHJKN3ljT2VZcUNWUS1ieWxES3MtajQtOXNkMWoxY3d1YUpnVGJNU3FqU3JQYUpUd0VXTXFvNjhQcE1SNjhGMHl5eFpCWkhlMDFpYjJVQXlVVWxST3lKZV91T0V4MA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg 