  <description><![CDATA[<div>With DGW 25 still on-going, we'll look ahead to ANOTHER double - Gameweek 26, where 8 teams play twice. Sam and Lee look back at the weekend's action and decide who to go for in the big double - with both of us pretty keen to sell Ronaldo and bring in Mo Salah with our 2 Free Transfers.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>***New Titles by @FPLRob182***<br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3NIVFpHWFZtVE53N3BQYkFEX1V3dWZlNk5LUXxBQ3Jtc0tuLXZiVnZ1LVIwSWdLcFlUZVFZRTUxT1ZDdUNwUV9SODdJa3I5ZU9ZNEhONFlEOUVuak93MkpRQURfUkdKUTZEMUpxN09Qa19HVWlkVk04UzJfUWxYQm9kdXprTlhFYU5nc2NCejl4UzV3NGFCbEdiRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVpuTGJOQmdVRnZzajVHTndibXFsem10WnN2d3xBQ3Jtc0tsOEhiX0s2V1FHc3BtdzhkbTF2TWxIdmJKN3V0VTd6MUtjclNwT1N2RzM2X1B0TTNtVm53YldPZmhVLWU3bzJ1UUs2MTFYa0ZSWFJXLUtvdzJ4b3ZJLWg2YlI0WjByeEV5MFZkalVVelMxM3BYZUU1QQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_descripti