  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>Friday's Double-Gameweek hype was real with the announcement of the DGW, but hype quickly turned to despair as much-captained Dennis is sent off as Watford crash to a 0-3 defeat to Norwich. City also drop points at Saints and Lucas Digne haunts his old team Everton with an assist and three bonus for new side Villa.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>***New Titles by @FPLRob182***<br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbElUbXAzZzV0ZVJ4VGFycU13SHV6aFcxUGVJQXxBQ3Jtc0trS1otbmFzU3BkOHgxUUR0VDNWeVN0dDR6Si1OUmRkWlctWEg2MUlubDc4VXdaWVl6RG4xYWxSMlQ5VE9wN2c2TjJObzZnbGtSRkhKTmxYYlNsMTBublZQeFZIdEszbUFLMjdDTlphbjZKOUkzMHFsQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0JPTTd4dzk4VmhmSTRGaU85elNzdnpja1dQd3xBQ3Jtc0tsY0g5TkRiNEtEVmNNZnhINUNGN1ViUHRFcTR0V3ByWWV4c2pkZ0RoUzMtcjNtNDR5TFFuRGtfYjZrSFh0alVERFJHcnd5ZzlleF92ZG5YTml0NzdyN3BlYjQyVkNlU1VMcEVaQXZsOGptYkxIODZucw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and 