  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>With plenty of football still to be played in GW22, we checkpoint where Sam and Lee's teams are at - and look ahead to key targets for GW23. Phil Coutinho explodes back onto the Premier League scene with a goal on debut for Villa - so we look at whether he's the player to own, or should we look at fellow new boy Lucas Digne - or perhaps both if Villa end up having a DGW?<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>***New Title Music by @FPLRob182***<br><br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3FndmlYUEtobDB0b2kwaVk3VkZGM09Rb3R2d3xBQ3Jtc0tsZG5XbDhoNnRXRWZDdnl6Ri04NjIzRE1xMXZEdzRGMldTY2J4dzhMOVlHUEIzcHRMQkVjaUZUQjZCZVBMQlhFV1Bqb3pYV2NnVTExa3ZvMExfZFp4OXVPNTRRT01Xd0FmUWR1VWR5TjZTaG5sWUJTbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazNkS0tBNndad3o1bkN1Qmdfb043ZW9TeVpKZ3xBQ3Jtc0traEl1T3M1el8xUWtXeGl3MzE3QzZpbGJhbjRPR0RUeXR5QmNWVUdVUkZsOFdSYTFDMXFXSnIxVDNSWVJ1ZDFVRm01cE1yQTVMeGtxVnFuWjhISnUyWU9zNkFwMm1nMTN4RkZWM3h0V1RLZ0xtazFlRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>_____________