<item>
  <title>S5 Ep19: FPL GW21/22 - Double GW Returns for Hammers! - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8006334</link>
  <itunes:episode>19</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>FPL GW21/22 - Double GW Returns for Hammers! - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>5</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8006334.mp3?modified=1641161814&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="79116559" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/38500794.png" />
  <itunes:duration>4930</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>We're over halfway through the DGW and so far, so good for those investing in Hammers asserts Antonio and Bowen. City also grab a last-gasp winner against an unlucky and impressive Arsenal, as do Spurs who leave it late to break the Watford back-line.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFoxZ1VMenZ4LUthUklBTTFCUjNZenVIbGVnQXxBQ3Jtc0tsdllBVWZhR3ZNRTV3VFZMZzNzQVY0cXFfMmZrTG9GalVYTkk0dE5yaTVJWWRrSVZIeWVqUWp3MG1MQnRfc04wY0VZbDVHbEdSa01IdWZTMGkxa2dvbHVRTFVrdmdPQmVkYldhV0xtV0ZHZEJ2c0Fjdw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWhaYjk3ckFxaHZKd28zZEwzdVZPS1RiSW1fd3xBQ3Jtc0tsMlFfc2JnSVJHdm0wYzR4SHJHb0dYdzM2R3IzYWdzX0VmOEY1VFJrRFprNndjRGRVcnJ0M3ZiQlNUekVUVmhaRVBEZGZXeE1ja1lkajk0NUdWUnljbzJVSi1OR2FtcEJ6aFVmSExlNFBCY1k0YXpNMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_descrip