  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>In a weekend full of cancellations due to Covid, many FPL managers struggled to get a full team out! Only 4 games to cover, so we'll ask the question - should we play FPL differently now? Should we react week-to-week and forget long-term planning? We'll also take questions from our Patrons and see how we both got on this week.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWh1aHg3eU9kcGFEa0lvRUhKUHA4THdEY25lUXxBQ3Jtc0trcU9fdWpJMXdpNkdTYUFjUFVpdllRMHF4bVRmR1VSV05hMUVjdVI0TDlzM2prYTlUdHpzMzlWbV9Bd1FPUXNrY19xMWZvay1IXzYxWkhEanJPLUVCOUQ0eEI0RnFrdlhVMEhoV3hRMU9jQl9NNFY0SQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkZaTlVUbXNHdDYyRGw0aHIxZkk5MzNLUDBhUXxBQ3Jtc0tsdmZWRXFVdVNSS0RfV05Uam5BeTlDd19WTmFXUTJPMC0zSnl1RGZ5VUhXVGZzMy1hVHp0cjhRRkNaSjI3dF9hRXVLbVRLUHlTcWg1XzZ6ZXR0Z0wwMWpxdlhZM2hwRlVpaVBkS2w2MXpRbS1JM0pJNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br>