  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>VAR and Penalty controversy was back with a bang this week, as Chelsea, Man City, Liverpool and Man United all win by penalty kicks. Elsewhere, Arsenal put Southampton to the sword and Leicester beat a sorry-looking Newcastle.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXZySDRXWUxjSGJONGlkcS1iOThhejZlQ2E3UXxBQ3Jtc0ttU0Nfc19hWVllU0VPY3RTQW1hdUNtOG1hZkNSbUpMY2ZXeVNjZkdlZTU3dlppUzRUWU95NmY1Znh2V1B6c25RVVJ1akFrSGNONDdmNDVWZUdEbTdVdEx1UzV1Z0pNMTR3NVRwSmgyNzhCdlJnSm5iWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTBKLUJ2ZU1UMHRBX1g3bmNsQmRUaHl5VjFBZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsV2N3elZyVlZGRXRBWDVxRDRtUHREZVl1OExueWtnMG51ZnhnLTVRc28wd2dRVnI4MVZ3SUpha0tDd2cxUUc1ckQtWlp5VTBlTjF5ZGpwbW41OXRPb041NURYOFdTdUhXY0FCQkJZb2N0OGNPY2licw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFF