  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>With a quick turn-around between the weekend and Tuesday, there's no time to waste in FPL, as we look ahead to GW14. Burnley v Spurs falls victim to the weather, Liverpool score more than 2 goals in a game AGAIN and set a new record as they go. City breeze past West Ham and Arsenal show Eddie Howe just how big the job is at Newcastle.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVd6cmN1SHh5X3V1QzQzSGdJUXlwNzhFY1BnUXxBQ3Jtc0tuTFJ1eVFFTF9RYmRGLWRpZWN4YU84akpxWTRodVZlOVVqaVpuU2loSU4yMF9WTXB6RTNINlJtaGdYVjlycmtiUnNoNFozV2M4NkpaSFUwcnlBbFdSTVRoRFJPYUxJTEhHekZiLWN0N0g5VzlhaXhVVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3h5Z0ZCUE02dTdDYVZubkJlRmVyZlVqWEtLZ3xBQ3Jtc0tucGhYNGtBR3pGa055TnV4UkhBM2RqQnIyenE5cllUUFNnbVJTQTM5YTI2WTFBUHgzRTl4eE9CdW85R3JUenVjX1pNNGdfQnBIcGRib2RhcmNRdGJQTlY3RTI1Z1Q1cHRxaTZob281MGcxLXNuSlo0aw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCH