  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>You wait all season for a win, finally get it and get the sack! As Daniel Farke leaves Norwich, this weekend also saw Dean Smith, in the real world, get dumped by Villa after a fifth straight defeat. City also outclass United in the derby and Antonio Conte's reign as Spurs manager starts with a stoic point at Goodison Park.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3lLdWJyX0oxSEJsQThORlhwTnpiLXBtbnRPQXxBQ3Jtc0tsbnNDa0RwN2ZGUFVDYlJFQmxoWnNmaUtzbnV0ZmROdFlIRlRFTXI3ZmJmZFQ4bFBKT0RFd1k5SWkzUnBzckJQejNyY0h3Nks2a3VINndIbjhyaGFDQWFLZW5KeF9tTl9aSEJYMFFfamtmekE4b3h2NA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDJaRXkxTXp4THZLSjhRbWdTNkNyV1hSQXNOd3xBQ3Jtc0tuMzhpaDVTejdZLVZRZGVFbXFLNmxXazhGdzZVTzdadUpTVGdTaUhFTU9aRzU0T05wNTkxYVI5MTJscXJpc0hpVlQyZ3p5VFVLcGxscnJrekhfbkkzOFJTbFZNUVNjeFNhYlZTdHVzRnJzTXdGeHR3WQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br