  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>Chelsea smash seven past hapless Norwich, to put their FPL assets right at the top of our radar - including Starboy, Mason Mount. City's own England wonderkid, Phil Foden bags a brace, Doucoure-less Everton crumble at home to Watford and Salah does what Salah does best - a hat-trick for his owners at Old Trafford!<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnhSMGtoZ3Bnb2NTV2llRXY0Vll6UkQtTnF4Z3xBQ3Jtc0tuQU95SC1QeE0zV0NGVS1NeU1lY2NDaktLSGdEeHJvMk9iVlhtNGNZZEV0ekNnZVIxQUlMTzRxTDNsR0trMFpZeGZWM0tlT1NBR2VaZ3c5WmZtdEd5RWdBLXpDc1lNZzRmSWV1UlJqSjhIU2JWVUFWZw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVhXSXJ5RWNnM0REWmJVaUk2bEtaYklQUzA4UXxBQ3Jtc0trVkNMQy1rdEw0ZkZPNDNGUXlmYzFtcWZHX0wtWGNBUndESUNxWFl4aWpGdmVrQU1zT2FVUHc0dFBRR0REb21NY09mbENmRERTX1ZfeHRUZjZIRmNkY2hKYmh1VEpibVRnUU1feDNGbjJ1c1ZldGxkNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s ho