  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>Dias benched, Jimenez benched, Alonso benched.... GW8 was a week that needed FPL managers to use their whole squad! We'll also look ahead to GW9, with the captaincy perhaps not so cut and dry as we previously thought.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblFVeGtIOERaT3RvajctcmY4c3BqRWZ0UE5NUXxBQ3Jtc0tuamZSZkFEXy1SY0p5YzE0ZWxxX1JQZ1k4eFB6cHhoMDUxemxXRjFIcm8xS0xzN2lBWHBaWGlFa1ZOSnlhYUdSeE1fRXVMMllCVGFIZllUN0Y4ZVlub0g1b3d1TDFFMGtqTEJ3enUyb1R0RGdodExZYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbU1xazF0OWkzS01NN1Q4bHo1bVdHNzNkOXF5QXxBQ3Jtc0trV1R2YW5XenF3SXdVVkhwcHhiVS1XVGt0Mk9hTFlNbDREd3N6NmJwWENOUGN5bGFDT0pPV0FQRjhFM0ZzV0tqUVdsa3BDbVAxb1NRZHRuT1BaRUxCWnZnc3JZWWZIRDh3U1NGUFdVUlF6bWpwNFZVNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjhNS