  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Lee and Sam are back, looking over all the weekend's FPL action!<br><br>In a week with barely any points for any of the major FPL assets, we look at a rejuvenated Raul Jimenez and ask whether Ole made a mistake dropping Ronaldo.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmIxSVRaTllMbi00dzNIam9jSXZCN2FBT2kxd3xBQ3Jtc0tseEhBRFcyNm5yamRIY1NvNkhqQWVhYy1EZzJneXJ4VE1iNmp1TDZOMGdleGZPbGFGOUh5aUZ3TmJSR1g4VV83RXZERlJMWDhMTDdVZGtUR0haMkRIMHd3S0RVcGZhUTFRbXh2cmE5aktfcDlGSFljNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXh6LW03SnhHSWEtVi1OMzhhRTA0TmNlYzJSQXxBQ3Jtc0tsYjU4UWNnajZnOWhrOXQ4c3BNXzhGUUhWNGphYVVDZHM5X0pxZWFMRkhkaUptOU9LdWFocEdFZVc1U1JRTGpDZjR4SnhEcTZQV3pCV2E4Zkg2NGlka3d2a1Nvc01wVjF1SEJzLTAySzBKbjQtTEFVOA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkRIS2UzZ1hOdFIzR2F6OTZzRWFYUjNRZHYzZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttZWwtWkhmb0pkdXVHdD