  <description><![CDATA[<div>Football's back, fans are back in stands and FPL Family LIVE streams are back on Sunday nights.<br><br>If you're new to the channel - WELCOME! If you've been here before, a warm welcome back and you know what to expect - FPL analysis of all the weekend's games and a look ahead to next week's key player targets and transfers for our FPL teams.<br><br>We'll also look at how GW1 went for Sam and Lee and our Overall Ranks.<br><br>It's great to be back!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9178363">https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9178363</a><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br>________________________<br><br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br> 🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br><br>📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br>Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes,  Deezer.<br> __________________________<br>Stats, Season Tickers and Player Ratings provided by Fantasy Football Scout Members Area.<br>Become a member here! - <a href="http://Bit.ly/FPLFamily1">http://Bit.ly/FPLFamily1</a>‬<br> __________________________   <br>More on 'Match Insights', Premier League's new Partnership with Oracle Cloud:<br><a href="https://www.oracle.com/premier-league/">https://www.oracle.com/premier-league/</a><br>__________________________   <br> #FPL #FPLFamily #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLTips</div>]]></description>
