<item>
  <title>S5 Ep2: FPL IS BACK! Latest Drafts &amp; Pre-Season Predictions! - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/7915981</link>
  <itunes:episode>2</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>FPL IS BACK! Latest Drafts &amp; Pre-Season Predictions! - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>5</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/7915981.mp3?modified=1631484811&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="93227468" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/38427990.png" />
  <itunes:duration>5791</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League.<br><br>We. Are. BACK! And so is FPL for a brand new season, with several weeks still to go in the transfer window, which promises to be pretty hectic! We'll talk about Kane, Grealish, Sancho and all this summer's big talking points.<br><br>We'll also be making our pre-season predictions, looking at our latest teams and  rating our Patron supporter's drafts.<br><br>It's great to be back!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9178363">https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9178363</a><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br>________________________<br><br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br> 🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br><br>📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br>Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes,  Deezer.<br> __________________________<br>Stats, Season Tickers and Player Ratings provided by Fantasy Football Scout Members Area.<br>Become a member here! - <a href="http://Bit.ly/FPLFamily1">http://Bit.ly/FPLFamily1</a>‬<br> __________________________   <br>More on 'Match Insights', Premier League's new Partnership with Oracle Cloud:<br><a href="https://www.oracle.com/premier-league/">https://www.oracle.com/premier-league/</a><br>__________________________   <br> #FPL #FPLFamily #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLTips</div>]]></description>
