  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. <br><br>The first FPL Prices of the season are REVEALED!<br><br>Here's the YouTube Audio from the two videos we recorded earlier this week when the Premier League Teams were releasing their FPL prices. These videos were also recorded  BEFORE the game was active.<br><br><em>Hope you enjoy and Happy New Season!</em><br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> _________________________         <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily 21/22 FPL Mini-League!<br>kjifg2<br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbi1QN1ZlX0hhY05XUm4yWnpqRGYxZ2xEQUE1Z3xBQ3Jtc0tscElzcGQwUXpPMXNBY2xMZm1LRk5QeE5YMDg4R0ZsWDlyTVEzZUlhS3Y3UDk3S2ZsN0xtOVN3S2RJcmZXMm9ybUtWOEVQRk9LNGdRbFhzbVl2R3c2dk5Kb000ZVBmTExZUzg4MWgtTWhfM0V0N18wYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily​​​</a><br><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUkzYzhYdWxITDhBQzRndWhPYkY2WXVrbzNRd3xBQ3Jtc0trOTZjNUtJMW9XaWdFNGFtWGMtU013bzhjcmUxT25SRWNsUTAxNGJuR1BiRDZsWXlRQ3pMdl9PRGFwR0ViQkNNaDRfd2tBMWR1ZzhUNGZDRGY1NmR3eVdxa215T1k2WTZBS214dVB4eXpkQXhaUmhTYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B">https://kickingtheballss.com​​​</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazcyOVh2a3lXcUxHcGVBNWNtZTFZLVFPR0lIQXxBQ3Jtc0tsUnNsV0VXUWtLUnpvXzQ3bmt3MGhsUno3Y