  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League.<br><br>FPL 20/21 is done and dusted! We look back at the action, remind ourselves of our pre-season predictions and finally, see who came out on top - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/teamsam">#TeamSam</a> or <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/teamlee">#TeamLee</a>?<br><br>Bring a beer, sit back and enjoy!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>1ie2mf<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkxKc3BUTUFrcnRpNEhZOExRQzRpRkRYV0hBQXxBQ3Jtc0trb3pOODF0UllqMzhSMm1ueVltQVpqQ0t0RlFWS0R3bG1SSDA2dFNXWHEwVjV0SUR0anZpTEFTWVRXVjM5WVhlMlVySzhwUzNkY1V3ZlFOelYwVmd1Q1MwdmJnaU5GUWtCcWtUd281T0VPY3FpQlQyUQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWJ5S1hPTVRVdW5rdG9XXzR3S3ljYmFHcldqUXxBQ3Jtc0tueWpvZXdlUWUyNkwzNjlDMm1XdWtkN2lfNmk4T2lrVUp6bUNCN0ViakhPdXJ3Mm1qYXZ5YXl4STdfTUVwblU1bXZ1SENXTHpuMWxkNkdPcktncS13Q2c0V2ZZenh3N3dOWGplOEVvVjVTNTNiY3hfTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmQ0aUMzTTdhN196eXlUdFNYbmlEdmtBdWJNd3xBQ3Jtc0tsOWNtb0tYVnloYklmVnpnRXFkZDE1MkJKaDhDZTFhU01IcE1vY3ZxWjVzR1BIUDlSZVc0bFIwV21OX2xfMEU3LTRxT1h