  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League.<br><br>This crazy season is about to come to a crazy end, so in this episode we look forward to the final week, with GW37 and GW38 on the horizon. We'll talk about our teams and transfers for the finale and pick out some key differentials to help you win those mini-leagues!<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>1ie2mf<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1pKN0tFOWFZYjMzbFRyLXVuNlRqVVdGZmZSd3xBQ3Jtc0tsMzBlUmpJRDRaU3FIcmhQZlduM3V1aDU1M0I1bks0MVBXS0hyR0xWVFJ1SVJfSk5DWWpLR2NIMW53QlQyWXAxeXhCbHZOX0MtcVNZaFBYNTBqd0lHVHNfOGg2bzVuUXM3dnROelV4Z2paLVZLdl9pNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGI0YjViakQ1MWE1cWdSbEh4OFNtVkRMR2o0QXxBQ3Jtc0tsdGp0WlpLVTJMTVZsd0VIUE5kTGpXTlhTU1N2R1daWExHTDZ2bkVVU2ZlQkc1dkZkSWZ2Z2Vyd1RNNlFydm55MFBpRjRnX2M0eXU5cW1DWWJlbHpkYWNjTUI5aHU2YjF5c3BtY2xiWUtjWlVhUGdOcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnE0a08yZEpaNmM4MFZZRFR6SG9fTmZyb2diUXxBQ3Jtc0tuVlhMdTRsOHEyNjVMb0JXWGJWWWtzQmJRanU4VWZIaTNqa1I1SHJWMUpoVHkzVjd5d3JybktjV3NIOVh5MllFRVVkbmYtTU5pcmpMM3N4TEtoOF9HNU1PZlBqem1EYTN2VjJYUDROX2