  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League.<br><br>We look back at all the weekend's action - and look ahead to the upcoming Gameweek 34 - which carries a bog-standard 10 Premier League fixtures - what a novel idea!  <br><br>With Lee creeping towards the Top 100k, can he break in next week? And was Sam's wildcard a success? <br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>1ie2mf<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDlWd1gzOE9YT2MxczZncFdzXzRrQ3ZETmhtd3xBQ3Jtc0tscVZocVdhVTdrT25WMVVBbEdBTl9CXzhPc2dYdk5Bclh2aVFfYzFsZTF2QXRVeEVYRkxOZmZUT0pxSnpJNkpVOGg1WjY0aVFtckwzRlRqYWZ6SzhqLW83WmV2Qm9jbjNGZ2tzbW1XRGd1YWJmRGkyVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a>​<br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0NFeFA1UTcwM2RfTi1rYkpIR05lTGlidmpnZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsODlLRGRzU0pFQnVDc3R5bGszNEdlUDJ6XzVuYTc4bUhrdXhaQS11OEZ5SlpOcGpIWW5nOUpXYXNaN0FNZnc0OE1WeFNYcXEwTmw3UldSWXFRSFc3VURGZTBRanJJaEE5bGR5ZDNpdVN2WklVLXRGNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a>​<br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblZfNHQ5OExYMkVvcXRPd1VobWlXa2lVTzhld3xBQ3Jtc0trcGhrZFkybGpwTlpkVUdya3VHS1N5Zmc3Wmw4V1MxWXFlUHFfUkpoUi1GRjI1RkJfWTVkbGZhOGlnQ0pSNnhVdi10UTVZclBNcXJqVW9vQW1Ra2RCa3VjQ0xsZThQRjdjWlcx