  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League.<br><br>Sam and Lee look back at all action form the DGW, including Lee's plans now for Kevin De Bruyne. We'll also look ahead to the midweek fixtures in GW20, which is only a few days away.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> _________________________         <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>1ie2mf<br>__________________________<br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br> <br><br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br><br> <br><br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br><br> <br><br>- Access to our Slack community<br><br> <br><br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><br> <br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkRWaDMtLURmQWNjRU94aHZ6V0hNMzhCbnJkd3xBQ3Jtc0tuY0NPa1gwS0ViZUFsRFZrZzZqejFSOUtRSWFkMHltbjBDY0dmWW5WaDlTOFJHVnF1YjZFWWZodC1vT21KaWdLQzFtTTlSVGlpZGw1Q2dRbzNOY2ttdDRMbmV1VUdGZlFxV1JFOHVLd3Joa29iRW5XTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a>​<br><br><br> <br><br> <br> <br> <br><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1l0ekZFQ2RtTlhTMnhhZ2lGeFdzZmNwbUJ3UXxBQ3Jtc0tra19kcmkzdnZuTllHMzBad0g5N1B6LU9HWVRISVdBdzdWTXB5Nk8zdFVaMDlGOEotOUtUb2FwQ2xoQWtwdTdvS3pCWmVVV3lUQ3VkY2l0UFI4SkpFanRQdWg5M3VBRGoyVi00X3FtSlRfZFVzUW9iTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a>​<br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>  <br> <br> <br><br>__________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br>😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUY1NkExNFpRenpTWFFOZmJQeThqdG9YMHhlZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsLVZrc0R