  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League.    <br><br>In form Spurs beat out-of-form City, leaving FP managers with a huge form vs fixtures conundrum ahead of GW10. Vity's fixtures look great, but who do we go for? And surely we're not sacrificing Son and Kane right now?<br><br>Elsewhere Fulham miss another comedy penalty, United sneak past WBA and Chelsea look the real-deal at Newcastle.<br><br>Sam and Lee take a look back at all the GW9 action and discuss who's on our radars for GW10.<br><br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br> <br> <br>_________________________         <br> <br> <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>1ie2mf<br>__________________________<br> <br><br> <br><br> <br> <br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br> <br><br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br><br> <br><br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br><br> <br><br>- Access to our Slack community<br><br> <br><br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><br> <br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1FpOWNRaHFjclJZMXM5cDhWZWVIcG9Dbl9hQXxBQ3Jtc0tsZHFJV0VzUnVVc0gzeFQwMUs2RjRudVZIOEN2Rm04TFJNZ3FLSVBQZkNjejFYd01KNFc1V2ZXQVdGeHd3MFpmTlB5QnIwQzJIanhfNUV2eVEtZmRrRGxLS24xTDg5M3ZxbHd5cVBpVV9xVTBmdWV1UQ%3D%3D&amp;v=6sLHaJOeM_Q&amp;event=video_description">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> <br><br> <br> <br> <br><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbW1wbHpCdlhiZTU1d0FXWE9ybWgwVDFfWnh4d3xBQ3Jtc0ttbEF1Mmw5YW9qczBRQ3JMOGFlMm0xR29aV0k3Zm5oUXNVQ3lKbnlSbkk2MGs0RDVUVDJzRTdTVDFPZnpZZUozaWxqU3dMeE1PWVBiZHRDcDRzRnU4V0syU1ptR2FCakV2QVVEYk5sYXJGS0d3N3lobw%3D%3D&amp;v=6sLHaJOeM_Q&amp;event=video_description">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br