  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. Sam and Lee take a look back at all the GW6 action.<br><br>A tough GW so far, that sees the FPL average way below 30. Perhaps Kane, Son and the Spurs boys can raise our spirits on Monday! United and Chelsea play out a drab 0-0 draw, Liverpool grind out a victory at home to Sheffield United and Patrick hits a hat-trick at Villa Park!<br><br>We'll also look at who's now on our radars for GW7!<br>    <br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br> _________________________         <br> <br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>1ie2mf<br>__________________________<br> <br><br> <br><br> <br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br> <br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br><br> <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br><br> <br>- Access to our Slack community<br><br> <br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><br> <br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> <br><br> <br> <br> <br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>  <br> <br> <br><br>__________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> 😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9178363">https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9178363</a><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br> <br><br>📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br>🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br