  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League.<br><br><br> The Premier League and FPL are BACK! Still no fans in the stands, but plenty of action on the pitch. Arsenal get off to a flayer against a defensively-poor Fulham. Mo Salah reminds us he's still the king and Everton pull of a great result away at Spurs.<br><br>We look back at all the weekends action, look ahead to GW2 when United and City return and check out how our teams got on.<br><br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> <br><br> <br><br><br>  __________________________<br><br> <br><br><br>  <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>1ie2mf<br>__________________________<br> <br><br> <br><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br> <br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br><br> - Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br><br> - Access to our Slack community<br><br> - Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><br> <br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> <br><br> <br> <br> *Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>  <br> <br> <br><br>__________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br>😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9178363">https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9178363</a><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br><br> <br><br> 🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br> <br> <br> <br>📸 Follow us on Instagra