  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/35728769/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.png" />
  <itunes:duration>5144</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League.<br><br><br>In our last live stream before the big kick off, we look at where we are with our GW1 drafts and any players that are on the radar. We talk plans to navigate the blanks and we make our pre-season predictions - Top 4, Bottom 3, Golden Boot and Top FPL Points Scorers in each position...then, we come to you and will be asking the live chat to make your predictions.<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> <br><br> <br><br> __________________________<br><br> <br><br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>1ie2mf<br>__________________________<br> <br><br> <br><br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br> - Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br><br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br><br>- Access to our Slack community<br><br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><br> <a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> <br><br> <br> <br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> <br><br> <br><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>  <br> <br> <br><br>__________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> 😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9178363">https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9178363</a><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br>📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br><br> <br><br>🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br> <br> <br> 📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><br> <br><br> <br><br><br> <br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes,  Deezer.<br><br><br> <br><br><br> <br>__________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br><br> <br>#FPL #FPLFamily #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLTips</div>]]></description>
