  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League.<br><br>In this episode, Sam meets David Akehurst, founder of FPL In The Dugout.<br><br>Sam and David discuss to what extent last season's results affect our thinking for this season - and who from last season's dream team should be in our thoughts for 20/21. <br><br>We then predict who we think will be in the dream team for this season and where we could be spending our FPL pounds.<br><br>Thanks for joining and for all your support this season!<br> <br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>__________________________<br><br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>1ie2mf<br>__________________________<br> <br><br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> <br><br> <br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>  <br> <br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br>😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/an">https://support.google.com/youtube/an</a>...<br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br><br> 🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br> <br> 📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><br> <br><br> <br><br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br><br><br> <br><br> <br>Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes,  Deezer.<br><br><br> <br><br><br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br>#FPL #FPLFamily #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLTips</div>]]></description>
