  <itunes:title>FPL Family X @FPL__Raptor PART 2: Management Leadership Styles - Bielsa, Bilic and Parker</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>4</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/7664711.mp3?modified=1598220294&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="21744874" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/35728769/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.png" />
  <itunes:duration>1323</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League.<br><br>We follow up last week's Podcast on PL Manager Leadership Styles by focussing on the new boys - Bielsa, Parker and Bilic - and how their styles effect the teams, players and ultimately FPL points.<br><br>Ross and Lee look individually at the three new PL managers and discuss who we think will make an impact, as well as which manager of the three we think will struggle in the top flight.<br><br>We hope you enjoy listening to this as much has we did making it!<br><br>Thanks for joining and for all your support this season!<br><br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> <br><br>__________________________<br><br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>1ie2mf<br>__________________________<br> <br><br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> <br><br> <br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>  <br> <br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br>😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/an">https://support.google.com/youtube/an</a>...<br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br><br> 🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br> <br> 📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><br> <br><br> <br><br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br><br><br> <br><br> <br>Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes,  Deezer.<br><br><br> <br><br><br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br>#FPL #FPLFamily #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLTips</div>]]></description>
