  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League.<br><br><br>After a week looking at prices in isolation we now have the context provided by fixtures - as the Premier League tell us who's playing who in 20/21. We'll take a look at the short/medium terms fixtures and pick out teams that should be in our FPL thoughts.<br><br>We'll also share our latest drafts - with Lee making several changes now the fixtures are available. Could we go WITHOUT Man City for a while?<br><br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> <br><br> __________________________<br><br> <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>1ie2mf<br>__________________________<br> <br><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br> - Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br><br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br><br>- Access to our Slack community<br><br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><br> <a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> <br><br> <br> <br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> <br><br> <br><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>  <br> <br> <br>__________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br>😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9178363">https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9178363</a><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br>📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br><br> <br>🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br> <br> <br>📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">http