<item>
  <title>S4 Ep2: FPL Family X @FPL__Raptor: PL Manager Leadership Styles and their Impact on FPL</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/7660660</link>
  <itunes:episode>2</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>FPL Family X @FPL__Raptor: PL Manager Leadership Styles and their Impact on FPL</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>4</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/7660660.mp3?modified=1597763552&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="48956739" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/35728769/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.png" />
  <itunes:duration>3024</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League.<br><br>In this first ever 'FPL Family X' video we meet FPL Raptor (Ross), one of my favourite follows on Twitter as we head into the new FPL 20/21 season. <br><br>Ross and Lee talk managerial psychology and the impact of different management styles on player performances. Find out why Ross and I agree Klopp is the absolute king of the Transformational Leadership and why the Pep Roulette is not just challenging for us FPL managers, but also has an impact on the mentality of the players.<br><br>We also look at why Lampard could be the next generation's Klopp and how Mourinho's Autocratic style might be all about short-term gain and long-term pain.<br><br>We hope you enjoy watching this as much has we did making it!<br><br>Thanks for joining and for all your support this season!<br> <br><br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> <br><br>__________________________<br><br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>1ie2mf<br>__________________________<br> <br><br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?v=AWB_vH1yuno&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbThJdWpvNEh5VExOdFN6Z2NTMlItVXhEMTViUXxBQ3Jtc0tuRDBMcnBCQl81NUxYSlV0MmFLSHQwMU1pa25Dek5FMXpaUk5tLTV0UlNmT0IxS3BkWjRkNVJmcURpd21SUFo0OXgxZE0wVmpJTUpVV2hla240MVJEcTc4THFtR3BLQnBGT182cmFMWnVmekEwMFA3UQ%3D%3D&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;event=video_description">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?v=AWB_vH1yuno&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazBqMktnU3RudFF6eVUxWHRqQzJUdGpRaXBtd3xBQ3Jtc0trMlRwdkpCalE2c2VsZ3dDckZGV3NfTnlrWVBQNHRZVG5QcWFDT1N2Q21uSUdUNTUyT1JvXzNTR3dFS2VMT1pMdl8zSFV5c0ZSTlJNTkVQX09pTk9KcE12Yn