  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League.<br><br>FPL 20/21 IS LIVE! Lee and Sam are BACK with our view on the player prices and the position changes - Aubameyang as a midfielder anyone...?! We'll also be attempting to make a first draft and pointing out those all-important 4.5 defender bargains!<br><br>Thanks for joining and for all your support this season!<br> <br><br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> <br><br>__________________________<br><br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>1ie2mf<br>__________________________<br> <br><br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:<br><br>- Manager of the Month competitions, and Prizes* <br>- Direct access to Lee and Sam via Zoom every season<br>- Access to our Slack community<br>- Bonus, weekly OHANA Podcasts<br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>*Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> <br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br> __________________________<br><br><br>😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how: <a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9178363">https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9178363</a><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br>________________________<br><br><br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br><br> 🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br> <br> 📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.