  <title>S3 Ep48: THE GW38+ FINALE! AND PRE-SEASON PREDICTIONS REVEALED!  - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/7641395</link>
  <itunes:episode>48</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>THE GW38+ FINALE! AND PRE-SEASON PREDICTIONS REVEALED!  - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>3</itunes:season>
