  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. <br><br>So here we are. After a roller-coaster of a season, unlike any other, we've reached the finale.<br><br>Liverpool may be Champions, but there is so much still to play for in the Top 4 and in the Battle to avoid the drop. We'll review who's up, who's down and who's Europe-bound.<br><br>We'll also crown our Project Restart Super League CHAMPION and find out who's won in the eternal battle of #TeamSam vs #TeamLee (as if we don't know!)...<br><br>And last but by no means least, we'll reveal our pre-season predictions and how close we were to predicting the Top 4, bottom 3 and top FPL points scorer.<br><br> Thanks for joining and for all your support this season!<br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> <br><br><br>   <br>__________________________<br><br>  <br> <br><br><br>  <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>bbkuz4<br>__________________________<br> <br><br> <br><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon and win great prizes in our Manager of the Month competitions!<br><br><br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br><br>Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> <br><br> Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>  <br> <br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br> 😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how:<br><a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/an">https://support.google.com/youtube/an</a>...<br><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br><br> <br><br> <br><br>  __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br>📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br><br>🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br> <br><br>📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><br> <br><br> <a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br><br><br> <br><br> Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes,  Deezer.<br><br><br> <br><br><br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> #FPL #FPLFamily #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLTips</div>]]></description>
