  <title>S3 Ep47: SAM'S FREE HIT TEAM FOR GW38+  - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/7636149</link>
  <itunes:episode>47</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>SAM'S FREE HIT TEAM FOR GW38+  - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</itunes:title>
