  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. <br><br>We're very much mid-gameweek with plenty of football still to play in GW 37+, so instead of reviewing only a handful of games, we'll look ahead to GW 38+, where Sam will be on a Free Hit. Who are the must-haves, who are the best Jammy Picks to finish your FPL season with a flourish!<br><br>Thanks for joining!<br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> <br><br><br>   __________________________<br><br>  <br> <br><br><br>  📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>bbkuz4<br>__________________________<br> <br><br> <br><br><br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon and win great prizes in our Manager of the Month competitions!<br><br><br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> <br><br> <br>Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> <br><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>  <br> <br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br><br>😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how:<br><a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/an">https://support.google.com/youtube/an</a>...<br><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br><br> <br><br> <br><br><br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br>📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br>🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br> <br>📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><br> <br><br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">htt