  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. <br><br>Norwich are down and out, sent packing by West Ham and GW35 4-goal hero Antonio - were you one of the lucky 1.6% who owned the Hammer's marksman?<br><br><br>Those that bought the Sterling-shaped ticket to the Pep Roulette were handsomely rewarded, as were FPL managers that kept faith in Heung-Min Son.<br><br> Elsewhere Burnley again show how defensively resilient they can be with a point at Anfield - and despite no clean sheet Nick Pope stakes his claim for this season's Golden Gloves.<br><br><br> We also look at Chelsea's trip to Sheffield United and the fallout from the North London Derby.<br><br><br> Thanks for joining!<br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> <br><br><br>   __________________________<br><br>  <br> <br><br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>bbkuz4<br>__________________________<br> <br><br> <br><br><br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon and win great prizes in our Manager of the Month competitions!<br><br><br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> <br><br> <br>Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> <br><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>  <br> <br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br><br><br>😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how:<br><a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/an">https://support.google.com/youtube/an</a>...<br><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br><br> <br><br> <br><br><br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> <br>📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br> <br>🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br> <br>📸 Follow us on Instagram!