  <description><![CDATA[<div>Join the FPL Family Project Restart Super-League!<br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. <br><br>So Liverpool finally wrap up the title, thanks to City's defeat at Chelsea - so what now for their FPL assets? Are Salah and Mane too expensive keep? Who are the fringe players that we expect to see more of? We'll also look at a battle all FPL managers should be keeping a close eye on - the race for fourth. With Leicester seemingly doing their best to get dragged into the dogfight, with an improved Manchester United, in form Wolves and Chelsea and a solid looking Spurs - we'll discuss which of those teams might even be worth a treble-up!<br><br>Thanks for joining!<br> Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> <br><br> __________________________<br><br>  <br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>bbkuz4<br>__________________________<br> <br><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon and win great prizes in our Manager of the Month competitions!<br><br><br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> <br><br> Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> <br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>  <br>  __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br> 😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how:<br><a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/an">https://support.google.com/youtube/an</a>...<br><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br><br> <br><br>  __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> <br><br>📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a> ]<br><br>🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a> <br>📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><br> <br><br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br><br><br> <br>Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes,  Deezer.<br><br><br> <br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> #FPL #FPLFamily #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLTips</div>]]></description>
