  <description><![CDATA[<div>Vote for us in the 2020 Football Content Awards!<br>Select 'FPL Family' in the 'Best in Fantasy Football - Video' category.<br><br>Vote: <br><br><a href="http://footballcontentawards.com/2020-voting/">http://footballcontentawards.com/2020-voting/</a><br><br>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. <br>It's certainly starting to feel real now - the fixtures are announced, the bloggers and podcasts are back on and the players are in contact training. On 17th June, FPL will kick off again and with a DGW no less!<br><br>Thanks for joining!<br><br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br> __________________________<br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>bbkuz4<br>__________________________<br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon and win great prizes in our Manager of the Month competitions!<br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> <br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>  __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> 😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how:<br><a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/an">https://support.google.com/youtube/an</a>...<br><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br><br> <br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a> ]<br>🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a><br><br> <br>📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><br> <a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audio