  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Its great to be back... :)<br><br>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. <br><br>On 17th June, football will again be on our screens and FPL will resume. It'll be weird, it'll be different, but it'll be SOMETHING - and we cannot wait to get back into FPL!<br><br>We try to think back to what our teams actually looked like (!!) and look at the first handful of <a href="https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=%23ProjectRestart">#ProjectRestart</a> fixtures. Which teams will be fighting and which teams will be going through the motions. Who's kept themselves fit over the break and who's been 'on the beach' - metaphorically of course!<br><br>Thanks for joining!<br><br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br> Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>bbkuz4<br>__________________________<br><br><br> <br><br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon and win great prizes in our Manager of the Month competitions!<br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br>😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how:<br><a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/an">https://support.google.com/youtube/an</a>...<br><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br><br> <br><br>__________________________<br><br><br> <br><br>📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br><br>🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a><br><br> 📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><br><br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br><br>Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes and Deezer.<br><br><br> __________________________<br><br><br> <br><br>#FPL #FPLFamily #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLTip</div>]]></description>
