  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. <br><br>With no Premier League or Fantasy to analyse, we join forces with James Linden from PlanetFPL Podcast (Twitter: @PlanetFPL) - to look back on the ROAD TO MADRID 2019 for our teams - Spurs and Liverpool.<br><br>In Part 1, we look back at the Group Stages, Last 16 and the Quarter Finals - including that crazy game at the Ethihad, where Spurs overcame Man City.<br><br>We'll be back next weekend with Part 2, sharing our memories of THOSE two semi-finals and of course, the Final! Stay safe everyone!<br><br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>  <br>________________________<br><br> <br><br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>bbkuz4<br>__________________________<br><br><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon and win great prizes in our Manager of the Month competitions!<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?redir_token=UabECNEC3s9Lp_LctLSaD7i2kC98MTU4NjY4NjQyNEAxNTg2NjAwMDI0&amp;v=wkhBXoSJxqM&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;event=video_description">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?redir_token=UabECNEC3s9Lp_LctLSaD7i2kC98MTU4NjY4NjQyNEAxNTg2NjAwMDI0&amp;v=wkhBXoSJxqM&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com&amp;event=video_description">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>__________________________<br><br><br> 😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?redir_token=UabECNEC3s9Lp_LctLSaD7i2kC98MTU4NjY4NjQyNEAxNTg2NjAwMDI0&amp;v=wkhBXoSJxqM&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.google.com%2Fyoutube%2Fan&amp;event=video_description">https://support.google.com/youtube/an</a>...<br><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br><br> __________________________<br><br><br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href