<item>
  <title>S3 Ep37: Family Catch-Up! - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/7543281</link>
  <itunes:episode>37</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>Family Catch-Up! - FPL Family (Fantasy Premier League)</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>3</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/7543281.mp3?modified=1585566113&amp;sid=5010221&amp;source=rss" length="59150813" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/35728769/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.png" />
  <itunes:duration>3661</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. <br><br><br> What strange and difficult time we are in. It's been three weeks since we last spoke and the world has changed with the Coronavirus, Covid-19, cancelling many if not all sporting events across the globe - including the Premier League.<br><br><br> Twitter followers will know that FPL Family hasn't escaped the virus - but with Sam now fighting fit, we're here for you - to discuss anything and everything. Leave your questions in the Live Chat and tell us how you're feeling.<br><br><br><br>We'll also be discussing how you can vote for FPL Family in this year's Football Content Awards - to be held at the Tottenham Hotspur Stadium in November! Click the link below to vote!<br><br><a href="https://footballcontentawards.com/2020-voting/">https://footballcontentawards.com/2020-voting/</a><br><br>ALL of us have a role to play in beating this virus together - stay at home, stay safe and we'll all save lives.<br><br> <br><br>Thanks for joining!<br><br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>  <br><br>__________________________<br><br> <br><br><br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>bbkuz4<br>__________________________<br><br><br> 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon and win great prizes in our Manager of the Month competitions!<br><br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br> Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br> Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>__________________________<br><br><br> 😎 <br><br>Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how:<br><a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/an">https://support.google.com/youtube/an</a>...<br><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br><br> __________________________<br><br><br> 📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br><br>🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a><br><br> 📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><br><br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br><br>Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes and Deezer.<br><br><br>__________________________<br><br><br> #FPL #FPLFamily #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLTips</div>]]></description>
