  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. Lee and Sam look over all the weekend's action including a yawn fest on Saturday, with only a smattering of goals - followed by a SUPER Sunday, as United beat City in the Derby and Chelsea put Ancelotti's Everton to the sword! <br><br>Big transfer targets like Aubameyang and Jota blank, but McCarty owners take advantage of a penalty save and bonus!<br><br><br><br>Thanks for joining!<br><br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>  __________________________<br><br> 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>bbkuz4<br>__________________________<br><br><br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon and win great prizes in our Manager of the Month competitions!<br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br><br>Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br><br>__________________________<br><br><br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? <br><br>Here’s how:<br><a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/an">https://support.google.com/youtube/an</a>...<br><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br> __________________________<br><br><br>📺 Subscribe to the channel! <a href="http://youtube.com/c/fplfamily">youtube.com/c/fplfamily</a><br>🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a><br><br><br>📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a href="https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221">https://audioboom.com/channels/5010221</a><br>Search 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes and Deezer.<br><br><br>______