  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. Lee and Sam look over all the weekend's action and ask when (not if) we should bring in Bruno Fernandes after United's new man grabs a goal and assist at Old Trafford. Spurs look unconvincing again against Chelsea and Wolves breeze past to three points, leaving Norwich still firmly rock bottom.<br><br>We look at Wolves vs Norwich, Arsenal vs Everton, Man United vs Watford and Leicester vs Man City.<br><br>More FPL analysis and views tonight on FPL Family! Thanks for joining!<br><br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>__________________________<br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>bbkuz4<br>__________________________<br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon and win great prizes in our Manager of the Month competitions!<br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPL10%' for 10% off all products on their website!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? Here’s how:<br><a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/7277005?hl=en">https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/7277005?hl=en</a><br><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br>__________________________<br>📺 Subscribe to the channel!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg?sub_confirmation=1">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg?sub_confirmation=1</a><br><br>🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!<br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br><a