  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. In this week’s episode, Lee and Sam react to Gameweek 14, a week which saw Liverpool find a way to win again, despite the loss of their Goalkeeper Alisson with a red card for handball. De Bruyne and Shelvey exchange worldies for a share of the spoils at The Etihad and the Pukki party might be back on, as Norwich and Arsenal play out an entertaining game at Carrow Road.<br><br>More FPL analysis and views tonight on FPL Family! Thanks for joining!<br><br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>__________________________<br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>bbkuz4<br>__________________________<br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon and win great prizes in our Manager of the Month competitions!<br><a href="https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://kickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPLFAMILY10' for 10% off all products!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? Here’s how:<br><a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/7277005?hl=en">https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/7277005?hl=en</a><br><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br>__________________________<br>📺 Subscribe to our YouTube channel!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg?sub_confirmation=1">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg?sub_confirmation=1</a><br><br>🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily">https://www.twitter.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>📸 Follow us on Instagram!<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily">https://www.instagram.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>🎧 Subscribe to our Soundcloud for live stream audio in Podcast format!<br><a href="https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily">https://soundcloud.com/fplfamily</a><br>__________________________<br><b