  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. In this week’s episode, Lee and Sam react to Gameweek 13, a week which saw Jose Mourinho get his first win as new Spurs boss, Vardy extend his lead in the top scorer charts and Marco Silva's Everton drop deeper into the mire.<br><br>Elsewhere Leicester and Man City keep the pressure on Liverpool at the top.More FPL analysis and views tonight on FPL Family! Thanks for joining!<br><br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>__________________________<br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>bbkuz4<br>__________________________<br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon and win great prizes in our Manager of the Month competitions!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?v=gLkM0iVZzm4&amp;redir_token=4mjaF8-jEP4ekDJB8Pk65IRS4MR8MTU3NDcyMjUwOEAxNTc0NjM2MTA4&amp;event=video_description&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?v=gLkM0iVZzm4&amp;redir_token=4mjaF8-jEP4ekDJB8Pk65IRS4MR8MTU3NDcyMjUwOEAxNTc0NjM2MTA4&amp;event=video_description&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPLFAMILY10' for 10% off all products!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? Here’s how:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?v=gLkM0iVZzm4&amp;redir_token=4mjaF8-jEP4ekDJB8Pk65IRS4MR8MTU3NDcyMjUwOEAxNTc0NjM2MTA4&amp;event=video_description&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.google.com%2Fyoutube%2Fanswer%2F7277005%3Fhl%3Den">https://support.google.com/youtube/an...</a><br><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br>__________________________<br>📺 Subscribe to our YouTube channel!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOaaO1SSxEMZwfrSkg?sub_confirmation=1">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_...</a><br><br>🏃‍♂️ Follow us on Twitter!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.