  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. In this week’s episode, Lee and Sam react to Gameweek 12 - as Leicester and Chelsea make their claim for the Top 4 with impressive wins. Vardy does what Vardy does best for his owners, with a 24-point haul for captainers, ahead of a decent run of fixtures where the Foxes look irresistible rom an FPL perspective. <br><br>Elsewhere Norwich, Southampton and West Ham all look in trouble and Man United start scoring goals again as Rashford and Martial return to our FPL radars.<br><br>More FPL analysis and views tonight on FPL Family! Thanks for joining!<br><br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>__________________________<br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>bbkuz4<br>__________________________<br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon and win great prizes in our Manager of the Month competitions!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?v=kt9u85GkHZw&amp;event=video_description&amp;redir_token=9nciqbpmXPan2Zf3glzH8xbUY598MTU3MzUwOTk2NkAxNTczNDIzNTY2&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?v=kt9u85GkHZw&amp;event=video_description&amp;redir_token=9nciqbpmXPan2Zf3glzH8xbUY598MTU3MzUwOTk2NkAxNTczNDIzNTY2&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPLFAMILY10' for 10% off all products!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? Here’s how:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?v=kt9u85GkHZw&amp;event=video_description&amp;redir_token=9nciqbpmXPan2Zf3glzH8xbUY598MTU3MzUwOTk2NkAxNTczNDIzNTY2&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.google.com%2Fyoutube%2Fanswer%2F7277005%3Fhl%3Den">https://support.google.com/youtube/an...</a><br><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br>__________________________<br>📺 Subscribe to our YouTube channel!<br><a href="https://www.