  <itunes:duration>3991</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>Welcome to FPL Family, a chat show dedicated to all things Fantasy Premier League. In this week’s episode, Lee and Sam react to Gameweek 11 - as it's all about he budget defenders, with Soyuncu, Lundstrum and Rico all returning for their owners. <br><br>Meanwhile, Kane's illness, Salah's dodgy ankle and blanks from Sterling, KDB and Aubameyang mean that it's getting harder and harder to trust the premium assets with the armband. We'll look over all the fixtures, our teams and discus early thoughts on transfers for next week.<br><br>More FPL analysis and views tonight on FPL Family! Thanks for joining!<br><br>Like, Share and Subscribe! :)<br><br>__________________________<br>📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!<br>bbkuz4<br>__________________________<br>🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon and win great prizes in our Manager of the Month competitions!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;v=Od7bDWl2STA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Ffplfamily&amp;redir_token=7zWRFW9pNUqZSYtZDiKu4OeMmNZ8MTU3MjkwNTgwOEAxNTcyODE5NDA4">https://www.patreon.com/fplfamily</a><br><br>Prizes sponsored by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;v=Od7bDWl2STA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fkickingtheballss.com&amp;redir_token=7zWRFW9pNUqZSYtZDiKu4OeMmNZ8MTU3MjkwNTgwOEAxNTcyODE5NDA4">https://kickingtheballss.com</a><br>Use 'FPLFAMILY10' for 10% off all products!<br>__________________________<br>😎 Want to highlight your msg in the chat and send a SUPERCHAT? Here’s how:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;v=Od7bDWl2STA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.google.com%2Fyoutube%2Fanswer%2F7277005%3Fhl%3Den&amp;redir_token=7zWRFW9pNUqZSYtZDiKu4OeMmNZ8MTU3MjkwNTgwOEAxNTcyODE5NDA4">https://support.google.com/youtube/an...</a><br><br>Donations welcome, but not expected 😊<br>__________________________<br>📺 Subscribe to our YouTube channel!<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDG_EqOa